<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">- Mbugu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Matayo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mburi kulho sakigi igondiwe ni Matayo</para>
  <para style="toc2">Matayo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mat</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mburi kulho sakigi igondiwe ni</para>
  <para style="mt1">MATAYO</para>
  <para style="imt">Chikaee</para>
  <para style="ip">Ya kitabu chigondowe ni Matayo ni kiwe cha vitabu vihai he Iaghano ikua, viyoiya mburi ya mizokhoire yakwe Yesu. Kira kitabu kiwe heka vitabu chisewe “Injili” Kiome chitoe sakuba “Mburi Kulho.” Ya vitabu vyeegondiwe ni Matayo ne Mariko ne Luka ne Yohana, vyeegondiwe Yesu areakhwa aaga. Vahe Vesomie vakumure teveilie ite Mburi Kulho sakigi igondiwe ni Matayo igondiwe ami, mira chiramuruika ite yeegondiwe he miko ya mikado sita kuli to Yesu areakhoika. Kihali ni ite muang'a ho igondiwe teuilika kikulho, mira vakumure vetoti ite hangi yeegondiwe he idi la Palestina naho chimurika ite igondiwe he muang'a usewa Yerusalemu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ya kitabu cheegondiwe Matayo, ya muhe to esinasewe ni Yesu kukhwa mhina kuu eekuboi nyamalo ya kudara kodi. Naho lhe ihali ekusewe Lawi. Matayo nee muwe wa vazasughawe vakwe Yesu ikado na vanu nau eevagondiie Vayahudi. Ya chiakhoika kikulho kwaite helo magondo yetakho mikado sita eyagondie kuli he Iaghano la Azeto. Ekudumu kuvaaija vahe ite Yesu niu Kiristo, mzakombo vahe elhoijwe ni Kiumbi. Ka Yesu niu erotiiwe nivaroto va Kiumbi. Wato oto heya kitabu Matayo eegondie mburi kumure jilanga udilao wa Kiumbi. Vayahudi vemuarire Kiristo eseekhwae Ngurumo wa idi kini. Mira Matayo etayoiya kikulho ite kacho eyo ni udilao wa Saa wa Kiumbi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mburi Kulho sa kigi igondiwe ni Matayo ni kitabu kikulho chiye kukhwa niu kulholhoshi kwa Iaghano Ikuale kwa mburi ya magondo kuu makumure kuli he Iaghano la Azeto. Niu chisaheja kikulho ya Maaghano manu. Vasomi veekutoti ite Matayo eekutagali kuliaha hucho vigondiwe hu vitabu vyakwe Musa, kwaite niu vitabu vikoi vyabosi vya Iaghano la azeto.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yeata za</para>
  <para style="io">Matayo etalholhoshi Mburi Kulho kwa kuyoiya mburi ja Yesu Kiristo kuakhoika na kulholhoshi kwa nyamalo kuu. Heluhige lwa 1-4</para>
  <para style="io">Areafiriti kayo Matayo etayoiya nyamalo yakwe Yesu na mahinyo kuu makumure yakwe Yesu. Heluhige lwa 5-25.</para>
  <para style="io">Hodi hamkhito wa Mburi Kulho Matayo etayoia nyamalo giru iakhoika he kigame na kuka kuli he kigame chakwe Yesu, ilanga mkhito wa nyamalo yakwe Yesu. Luhige lwa 26-28.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1" />
  <para style="s">Mbari yakwe Yesu Kiristo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">Luka 3:23-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1" />Mburi ja mbari yakwe Yesu Kiristo Muinyi wa mbari yakwe dilao Daudi nawa mbari yakwe Ibrahimu. <verse eid="MAT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2" />Ibrahimu niu igii Isaka, Isaka nau ni igii Yakobo, Yakobo nau ni igii Yuda na vabakhu kuu, <verse eid="MAT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3" />Yuda nau ni igii Peresi ne Zera, alhii kini ni Tamari, Peresi nau ni igii Hezroni, Hezroni nau ni igii Rami. <verse eid="MAT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4" />Rami nau ni igii Aminadabu, Aminadabu nau ni igii Nashoni, Nashoni nau ni igii Salimoni, <verse eid="MAT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5" />Salimoni nau ni igii Boazi, alhii kini ni Rahabu, Boazi ne Rutu niu vemuakho Obedi, Obedi niu igii Yese, <verse eid="MAT 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6" />naho ka Yese niu igii Dilao Daudi, nau ni igii Solomoni, alhii Solomoni esewa Batisheba nee mlage wakwe Uria. <verse eid="MAT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7" />Solomoni niu igii Rehoboamu, Rehoboamu nau ni igii Abiya, Abiya nau ni igii Asa, <verse eid="MAT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8" />Asa niu igii Yehoshafati, Yehoshafati niu igii Yoramu, Yoramu niu igii Uzia, <verse eid="MAT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9" />Uzia niu igii Yosamu, Yosamu niu igii Ahazi, Ahazi niu igii Hezekia, <verse eid="MAT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10" />Hezekia niu igii Manase, Manase niu igii Amoni, Amoni niu igii Yosia, <verse eid="MAT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11" />Yosia niu kakare Yekonia hawe na vabakhu kuu. Ka nee maaze yo Vayahudi veebalejwe kuso idi la Babeli. <verse eid="MAT 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12" />Heka madamo Vayahudi vareabalejwa kuso idi la Babeli, Yekonia ekamsa Shetieli, Shetieli nau ekamsa Zerubabeli, <verse eid="MAT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13" />Zerubabeli ekamsa Abiudi, Abiudi ekamsa Eliakimu, Eliakimu ekamsa Azori, <verse eid="MAT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14" />Azori ekamsa Zadoki, Zadoki ekamsa Akimu, Akimu ekamsa Eliudi, <verse eid="MAT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15" />Eliudi ekamsa Eliazari, Matani ekamsa Yakobo, <verse eid="MAT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16" />Yakobo nau ekamsa Josefu, mwagiru wakwe Maria alhii Yesu, naka Yesu niu esewa Kiristo. <verse eid="MAT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17" />Heelo makolwa ikado na hai kuli he Ibrahimu sari dilao Daudi. Naho kuli he dilao Daudi heelo makolwa ikado na mahai he kubalejwa kuso Babeli sa vahaye sari madamo Yesu areakhoka.<verse eid="MAT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuakhoika kwakwe Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 2:1-7">Luka 2:1-7</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18" />Kuakhoika kwakwe Yesu kweetoe to, Maria alhii Yesu, eehashiwe ni Josefu. Mira ii vesina zokho hawe sa muhe na mlage kuu, Maria ekailika ite aatii maso kwa umuruisho wa Saa wa Kiumbi. <verse eid="MAT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19" />Kwaite Josefu nee mhe elo swaho kulho, ekatoti amro ilai ekudumu vahe vasiile, eedumue kuboi to kwaite teedumue kumbutu susune he vahe. <verse eid="MAT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20" />Areakhwa echeri toti kuboi to, ekadarwa ni luireno, Mzasughawa wa are ana he Kiumbi ekamlianyija he makhala, ekamba, “Josefu, kakare Daudi, usibughenu kumdori Maria akhwa mlage kechi, kwaite elo maso kwa umuruisho wa Saa wa Kiumbi. <verse eid="MAT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21" />Maria enesa muinyi wa kiagiru, naho unemse Yesu kwaite niu enevakaa vahe kuli he makusa kini.” <verse eid="MAT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22" />Ya makhabuna yeelijanye kalo hu kiome cheeyoiwe ni Dilao kutakhoiya he mroto wa Kiumbi chiliijanye.<verse eid="MAT 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23" />“Mualeta esinaraabodi na muagiru enetii maso,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:23">Enesa muinyi wa kiagiru</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:23">Navo venemse Imanueli” Nikuba, “Kiumbi eahaa hawe na nne.”<verse eid="MAT 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24" />Kwato Josefu areaka he luireno, ekaboi sakigi eesughawe ni Mzasughawe wa are ana he Kiumbi, ekamdori maria kukhwa mlage kuu. <verse eid="MAT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25" />Mira teveebodie sa muagiru na mlage kuu sari to Maria aremsa muinyi kuu wa kiagiru, niho Josefu ekamse ilhe kuu Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2" />
  <para style="s">Vagalho kuli bwa kaaze ho keli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1" />Yesu eeakhoike he muang'a wa Betilehemu, idi la Yudea, ka madamo Herode nee dilao, areakhoka bi, veiliishishe nhondwe kuli bwa kaaze ho keli vekahe Yerusalemu, <verse eid="MAT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2" />vekalhasu, “Eahale ka Dilao wa Vayahudi eakhoke? Kwaite twaiakho nhondwe kuu irealianya are bwa ho kaaze kelianya, tukalita tumuaresi.” <verse eid="MAT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3" />Dilao Herode hawe na vahe vakhabuna va Yerusalemu vareako ka mburi, vekahiri he swaho kini. <verse eid="MAT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4" />Herode ekavase vagiru va muaresi, vahinya va miku yakwe Musa, ekavalhasu ite “Kiristo eneakhoka le?” <verse eid="MAT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5" />Niho vekamba, “Kiristo eneakhoka he muang'a wa Betilehemu he idi la Yudea. Kwaite nicho chigondiwe ni mroto wa Kiumbi ite.<verse eid="MAT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6" />Ari muang'a wa Betilehemu idi la Yudea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">Ari tumgitutu neri he miang'a iiliikishe ya Yudea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">Kwaite he ari heneli mgiru</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">Enevakaeti vahe gho Israeli.”<verse eid="MAT 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7" />Niho iji Herode ekavase kakera hu vahe veiliishe nh'ondwe, ekudumu kuila ite ni madamo mina veiakhoye ka nhondwe ikulijanya. <verse eid="MAT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8" />Niho ekavaba, “Soni Betilehemu mzelhasuisha mburi ja muinyi, naho mkunemuakho, mnibaye kalo na ani niso nire muaresi.” <verse eid="MAT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9" />Dilao Herode areafiriti kuvaajia hu vapitu va nhondwe, ka vapitu va nhondwe vekahali ata vekaso. Ilai veaha kwalhi, watooto vekaiakho kahali hu nhondwe wahuuhu veeiakhoe bwa hodi kaaze keliia, naho ka ndondwe ikavakaeti sari to hodi hu muinyi ho eeaha ikauma. <verse eid="MAT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10" />Ka nhondwe ikavakaeti sari hodi eaha hu muinyi ikarauma ana. <verse eid="MAT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11" />Niho vekabuu minda, vekamuakho hu muinyi hawe ne Maria alhii kuu, vekama mamuro na kududukhu ilai vekumuaresi. Niho vekamuo vitumulilo vya zahabu na lubani na mkha mkulho wa vaing'i usewa marihamu. <verse eid="MAT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12" />Kiumbi ekavalhiija hemakhala ite vasikirii hakwe Herode, kwato vekagale kwa kwalhi hali.<verse eid="MAT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ne Abaghe ne alhii kuu vetagugulu kuso Misiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13" />Hu vagalho vareagale, mzasughawe waare ana he Kiumbi ekamlianyija Josefu he makhala, ekamba, “Hali ii, mdori muinyi hawe na alhii, mugugulu kuso idi la Misiri. Fufuni arai sari nikunemubaiya, kwaite Herode emdaija ka muinyi kalo amgaa.” <verse eid="MAT 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14" />Niho Josefu ekaka, ekamdori muinyi hawe na alhii muinyi vekahali naama wahuuhu, vekaso idi la Misiri, <verse eid="MAT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15" />veefufue are sari Herode ekaga. Ya mburi yeeboike kalo chilijanye hu kiome cheeyoiwe ni Dilao Kiumbi kutakhoya mroto wa Kiumbi ite,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:15">“Neemsee muinyi gho kuli idi la Misiri.”<verse eid="MAT 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vainyi vagitutu va kiagiru vetagaawe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16" />Herode areaila ite hu veilie nhondwe kuli bwa wa kaaze ho keliya vaamta, ekasanuishishwa. Ekavaji vaaku kuu varevagaa vainyi vagitutu vakhabuna va kiagiru velo miko minu kukirii di he muang'a wa Betilehemu na miang'a iaha sina. Eeboie to kuagha na madamo emurue kuila kuli hehu veilishe nhondwe. <verse eid="MAT 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17" />Niho chikafuru hu kiome chiyowe ni Yeremia mroto wa Kiumbi ite, <verse eid="MAT 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18" />“Kizoi chikakoika are Rama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">Kizoi cha vuhuye vukumure.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">Raheli etavazoiya vainyi kuu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">Neri tedumu kutaaijwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">Kwaite vakhabuna vaaga.”<verse eid="MAT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ne Abaghe ne alhii kuu vetakirii kuli Misiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19" />Herode areaga, mzasughawe waare ana he Kiumbi ekamlianyija Josefu he makhala are Misiri, <verse eid="MAT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20" />ekamba, “Ka, umdori muinyi hawe na alhii kuu, ukirii he idi la Iziraeli, kwaite hu veedumue kumgaa ka muinyi vaaga.” <verse eid="MAT 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21" />Niho Josefu ekaka, ekamdori muinyi hawe na alhii muinyi vekakirii he idi la Iziraeli. <verse eid="MAT 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22" />Mira Josefu areako ite Arikelao, muinyi wakwe Herode niu dilao wa idi la Yudea hodi ha abaghe, ekabughenu kuso are. Nau arealhiijwa he makhala, ekaso bwa ja idi la Galilaya, <verse eid="MAT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23" />ekaso kurafufu he muang'a usewe Nazareti. Kwato chikafuru hu kiome chiyoiwe ni varoto va Kiumbi chiba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:23">“Enesewe Mnazareti.”<verse eid="MAT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3" />
  <para style="s">Yohana mzabatija etabirikira</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mariko 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yohana 1:19-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1" />Heka maaze Yesu erecheri aha he idi la Nazareti, muhe muwe esewa Yohana mzabatija eelitie ekubirikira he roro ya Yudea, ekuvaba, <verse eid="MAT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2" />“Roni makusa kaghu mumkiriiye Kiumbi kwaite Udilao waare ana he Kiumbi waahe sina.” <verse eid="MAT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3" />Ya Yohana niu hu eyoiwe ni Isaya mroto wa Kiumbi areaba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">“Kiome kigiru cha muhe chise are roro chikuba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">‘Mboieni Dilao kwalhi kuu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">Ikuuruni balabala.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4" />Yohana eeoroe gomae iboiiwe na mafoya ya kimagheri chisewa ngamia, naho eoroe lumulhu lwa bulhe hasi ya msa. Naho viaghu kuu nee mahalala na naa ja maeza. <verse eid="MAT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5" />Niho vahe kuli Yerusalemu na kuli bwa khabuna ja Yudea na hodi hakhabuna hawe na miang'a iaha sina na muharaza wa Yoridani, vekamliaha. <verse eid="MAT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6" />Vekayo makusa kini he Kiumbi na kuyaro, nau ekavabatija he muharaza wa Yoridani, <verse eid="MAT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7" />Mira Yohana areavaakho Mafarisayo na Masadukayo vemliaha kalo avabatije, ekavaba, “Kune ikolwa la bome niji emung'ee ilama ite muyagugulu malhaha ya Kiumbi yenelita? <verse eid="MAT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8" />Kwato aijani kwa kuboi ite mwaayo na kuyaro makusa kaghu makhabuna. <verse eid="MAT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9" />Neri musitoti he swaho kaghu ite mumuru kubaiyana ite, nne tulo aba kanu Ibrahamu. Kweri nimubaya ite Kiumbi emuru kum'boiya Ibrahamu vainyi kuli heya masaheru. <verse eid="MAT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10" />Naho waijiji ihoya la zamaro laakewa he majindo ya mkhatu, kwato kira mkhatu usisa matunda makulho unetewe na kubibiwe he mwalha. <verse eid="MAT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11" />Ani nimubatija na mai kuaija ite mwaayo na kuyaro makusa kaghu mukamkiriiya Kiumbi. Mira helo elitie elo Ugiru kunitakho ani, naho ani siye neri kuge mulhu ja makwadoe kuu. U enemubatija kwa Saa wa Kiumbi na mwalha. <verse eid="MAT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12" />Naho lungo lwa kuhetia ngano luaha he miharegha kuu, nau enelhalhami minda hodi ngano ihetiiwa, naho enebunguru ngano he minda na kulhaha makanka he mwalha usiga.”<verse eid="MAT 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etabatijwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mariko 1:9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luka 3:21-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13" />Ka madamo Yesu ekali Galilaya ekahe he mharaza wa Yoridani, ekamliaha Yohana kalo abatijwe. <verse eid="MAT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14" />Mira Yohana ekagali kulhi ekumba, “ Ho, naari unilitia? Ani niu nidumuwe nibatijwe niari.” <verse eid="MAT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15" />Mira Yesu ekamba, “Dumu bi chikhwa to waijiji, kwaite nicho chiye tuyaboi hu makhabuna yo Kiumbi eyadumu.” Ata Yohana ekadumu ekambatija. <verse eid="MAT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16" />Yesu areafiriti bi kubatijwa na kuli he mai, wato oto are ana he Kiumbi hekalhaika, ekaakho Saa wa Kiumbi ekudimi sa sula na kuuma ana he Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17" />Niho kiome kuli ana he Kiumbi chikakoika chikuba, “Ya niu muinyi gho nimdumue, naagijwa niu.”<verse eid="MAT 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4" />
  <para style="s">Yesu etagaliwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:12">Mariko 1:12</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 1:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luka 4:1-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1" />Saa wa Kiumbi ekamkaeti Yesu kuso he ilangwa kalo aregaliwe ni Shetani. <verse eid="MAT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2" />Yesu ekafufu miaze mikado mihai chakhakho na naama, neri teae kigi, niho ekako kela. <verse eid="MAT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3" />Ata Shetani ekamlitiya, ekamba, “Kai ari u Muinyi wakwe Kiumbi yaba ya masaheru yakhwa mikate.” <verse eid="MAT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4" />Mira Yesu ekamba, “He magondo ya Kiumbi hegondiwe ite, mhe tekazokho kwa kua viaghu bi, mira enezokho he kira kiome chili he Kiumbi.” <verse eid="MAT 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5" />Niho Shetani ekamkaeti Yesu sari Yerusalemu, he muang'a wa Kiumbi ekamboi auma ana he kigango cha minda ya Kiumbi. <verse eid="MAT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6" />Niho ekamba, “Kai ari u Muinyi wakwe Kiumbi kubibi sari twai di. Kwaite hegondiwe ite,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">‘Kiumbi enekusughaya vazasughawa va are ana kuu, navo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">Venekusamata he miharegha kini kalo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">Usirekuma kusame kechi he isaheru.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7" />Yesu ekamkiritia kiome ekamba, “Naho he magondo ya Kiumbi hegondiwe ite,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:7">‘Usimgali Dilao Kiumbi kechi.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8" />Kahali Shetani ekamkaeti sari ana he lubwa lugiru, ekam'aija dilao khabuna ja idi na vigi vikhabuna vikulho vya idi, <verse eid="MAT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9" />ekamba, “Ya vikhabuna ninekuo kai ukunimaia mamuro ilai kunidudukuia na kuniaresi.” <verse eid="MAT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10" />Niho Yesu ekamba, “Haka ii Shetani. Magondo ya Kiumbi yegondiwe ite,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:10">Unemuaresi Dilao Kiumbi kechi na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:10">Kumboia nyamalo uye salaghe.”<verse eid="MAT 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11" />Niho Shetani ekamro Yesu, naho vazasughawa va are ana he Kiumbi vekalita kumlhaari Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etalholhoshi kubirikira are Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:14">Mariko 1:14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 1:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14">Luka 4:14</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 4:15">15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12" />Yesu areako ite Yohana aorowe he igereza, ekaso Galilaya. <verse eid="MAT 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13" />Ekahali Nazareti, ekaso Kafaranaumu muang'a uaha sina na iziwa lisewa Genesareti ilhe ihali ni iziwa Galilaya he mihake ya idi la Zabuloni na Naftali, ekazokho are, <verse eid="MAT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14" />kalo hu uroto wakwe Isaya mroto wa Kiumbi ufuru, sakigi ebae, <verse eid="MAT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15" />“Lahonhani kune vahe va idi la Zabuloni na idi la Naftali nahe madi eaha he kwalhi iso he iziwa mlha wa muharaza wa Yoridani lahonhani kune vahe va Galilaya he idi la vahe vesi Vayahudi, <verse eid="MAT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16" />ka vahe vezokho he idi lilo kidughu vaakho luatame lugiru naka vezokho he makusa, vaakho luatame.” <verse eid="MAT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17" />Kuli heka madamo, Yesu ekalholhoshi kubirikira ekuba, “Mkiriieni Kiumbi muro makusa kaghu, kwaite Udilao wa Kiumbi waahe sina.”<verse eid="MAT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etavase vahina kuu vabosi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mariko 1:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luka 5:1-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18" />Ata Yesu ekudaha kakera he iziwa la Galilaya, ekavaakho vabakhu vanu, Simoni esewa Petro ne Andrea mbakhu kuu, velo nyavu kini vekuvula samaki. <verse eid="MAT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19" />Niho Yesu ekavaba, “Litani, niliahani ninemuboi kune muvagere vahe hagho sakigi mweekuvula samaki nakujigera ang'a.” <verse eid="MAT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20" />Wato oto vekaro nyavu kini naho vekamliaha. <verse eid="MAT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21" />Areazemeri hagitutu, ekavaakho vabakhu vahali vanu, Yakobo ne Yohana vainyi vakwe Zebedayo veeaha za he mashua hawe ne aba kini Zebedayo, vekujiboi nyavu kini. Niho Yesu ekavase, <verse eid="MAT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22" />navo vekamroia aba mkini mashua nahu nyavu kini, vekamliaha Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etahinya vahe na kuvauti varukhao</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Luka 6:17-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23" />Yesu ekatakho kira hodi he idi la Galilaya, ekuhinya he minda jo vesahea Vayahudi na kubirikira Mburi Kulho jiyoya Udilao wa Kiumbi, nakuvauti vahe marukho kini. <verse eid="MAT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24" />Kwato mburi kuu jikailika bwa khabuna ja idi la Siria. Varukhao vakhabuna vekagerawe heu naho velo mapepo naho velhu kifafa nahu veholoje vakhabuna ekavauti. <verse eid="MAT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25" />Maifyo ya vahe vakumure kuli idi la Galilaya nahe muang'a wa Dekapoli nahe muang'a wa Yerusalemu nahe idi la Yudea na mlha wa kanu wa muharaza Yoridani vekamliaha.<verse eid="MAT 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5" />
  <para style="s">Mahinyo yakwe Yesu are he Lubwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1" />Yesu areaakho maifyo ya vahe vekakutu he lubwa, naho areazokhodi, vahina kuu vekamlitia. <verse eid="MAT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2" />Niho ekalholhoshi kuvahinya ekuba.<verse eid="MAT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlhamuisho wa kweri</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:20-23">Luka 6:20-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3" />“Venelhamuiwa vahuye va swaho, kwaite Udilao waare ana he Kiumbi ni mkini. <verse eid="MAT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4" />Venelhamuiwa huvo vebenie ulhamuisho, kwaite venelhamuijwa. <verse eid="MAT 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5" />Venelhamuiwa vahe vetaae kwaite venepala idi. <verse eid="MAT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6" />Venelhamuiwa velo kela na kasu iye kuboi vyo edumu Kiumbi, kwaite venekhuijwa. <verse eid="MAT 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7" />Venelhamuiwa velo mbalamija he vahali, kwaite Kiumbi enevaakhoiya mbalamija. <verse eid="MAT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8" />Venelhamuiwa velo swaho isilo makusa, kwaite venemuakho Kiumbi. <verse eid="MAT 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9" />Venelhamuiwa vegera nhunguru he vahe, kwaite venesewa vainyi va Kiumbi. <verse eid="MAT 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10" />Venelhamuiwa vekharotijwa kwa mburi ya kuboi cho Kiumbi edumu, kwaite Udilao wakwe Kiumbi ni mkini.” <verse eid="MAT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11" />“Venelhamuiwa kune vahe vekune muolhu na kumula vigi kaghu na kumukharotija kwa mburi gho. <verse eid="MAT 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12" />Lhamuiwani hawe nakuma gimbe ja mlhamuisho ake kulhamuwa kaghu ni kugiru are ana he Kiumbi. Kwaite nirewato vevaboiie varoto va Kiumbi veelitie mweesinalita.”<verse eid="MAT 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mnaro na luatame</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mariko 9:50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Luka 14:34-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13" />“Kune mumnaro wa idi. Mira mnaro ukulahati unaro kuu unesawemo? Teukaye kigi kahali, mira unebibiwe gahana naho vahe veneudaha. <verse eid="MAT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14" />Kune mu luatame lwa vahe va idi, muang'a ukwauwe ana he lubwa kira muhe eneuakho. <verse eid="MAT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15" />Neri vahe tevekati kijari na kuchighubika na khore, mira vechike ana he lushagha kalo chivamurikie vakhabuna veaha he minda. <verse eid="MAT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16" />Wato oto, na kune chidumuwe luatame kaghu lumurike he vahe, kalo vaakho miboire kaghu mikulho, vamkaari Aba kaghu eaha are ana.<verse eid="MAT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahinyo kwa mburi ya miku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17" />“Msieratoti ite nilitie kukaa miku yakwe Kiumbi emuoe Musa na mahinyo ya varoto va Kiumbi. Silitie kuboi to, mira nilitie kujifuruti nyamalo na mahinyo yo veboi. <verse eid="MAT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18" />Kweri nimubaya, sari ata ana he Kiumbi na idi vikune takho, tehelo neri kabalo kawe hile hodi ha igondo iwe la miku linekaawe sari makhabuna yafuru. <verse eid="MAT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19" />Kwato muhe enelhi kuliaha miku we heya miku khabuna na kuvahinija vahali vaboi to, ka enekhwa mgitutusha he Udilao wa are ana he Kiumbi. Mira huye eneliaha miku na kuvahinya vahali sato, ka enekhwa mgiru he Udilao waare ana he Kiumbi. <verse eid="MAT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20" />Kwato namubao, mnezabuu he Udilao waare ana he Kiumbi kai bi miboire kaghu imuagija Kiumbi ikunetakho miboire ya vahinya va miku yakwe Musa hawe na Mafarisayo.”<verse eid="MAT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahinyo yakulhiija malhaha</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:57-59">Luka 12:57-59</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21" />“Mwaakoo cho vahe va azeto veebaiwe ite, ‘Usigaa, muhe enegaa, edumuwa azamariwe.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22" />Mira ani nimuba, muhe emsanuiya mbakhu kuu, chidumuwe ezamariwe. Naho enemfwa mbakhu kuu enetiiwe he ibaraza la Vayahudi. Kahali enemse mbakhu kuu ‘Kivile’ chinemye kubuu he mwalha wa bamuza. <verse eid="MAT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23" />Kwato ukutii kivulu kechi ata he kiringo cha kukeiya kivulu he Minda ya Kiumbi, naho ukahulha ite mukwekwee na mbakhu kechi, <verse eid="MAT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24" />Ke kivulu kechi sina na ata hakuguiya kivulu, urongeso ureiseko na mbakhu kechi, niho ukirii ugu kivulu kechi.” <verse eid="MAT 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25" />“Mangaiseko na mnkuru kechi mwereaha kwalhi kuso he mahakama. Kai sicho, mnkuru kechi ekunekuotija he hakimu, naka hakimu enekuotija hevaaku naho ari uneorowe he igereza. <verse eid="MAT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26" />Kweri nikubaya, tukahali neri sari ukhwa waalhanu mawero makhabuna.”<verse eid="MAT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahinyo yelhiija udana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27" />“Mwaako ite vahe veebawe ite, ‘Usidane.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28" />Mira ani namuba, enemuwesia mlage kwa kudumu abodi nau, enekhwa aafiriti kudana nau he swaho kuu. <verse eid="MAT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29" />Ukuneakho iila kechi la sughano likuboi uboi makusa, ling'ofule urelibibi uda. Ni keba ari kulahati kigi kiwe he msa kechi, kuro msa kechi kubibiwe he mwalha wa bamuza usiga. <verse eid="MAT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30" />Naho kai muharegha kechi wa sughano ukuboi uboi makusa, ute ureubibi uda. Ni keba kulahati kigi kiwe cha msa kechi kuro kulahati msa kechi mkhabuna kuso he mwalha wa bamuza usiga.”<verse eid="MAT 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Magondo ya kuroana</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:9">Matayo 19:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mariko 10:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luka 16:18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31" />“Naho he miku yakwe Musa iba ite, ‘Enemro mlage kuu, chimdumu amgondie magondo ya kumro’. <verse eid="MAT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32" />Mira ani namubao, kira muagiru enem'o mlage kuu magondo ya kumro, kai sikwa mburi ya kudana, etamboi ka mlage akhwa mzadana, naho muagiru mhali ekumdori ka mlage eoiwe magondo ya kurowe, naka muagiru enekhwa mzadana.”<verse eid="MAT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahinyo he mburi ya kuke muo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33" />“Kahali mwaako ite vahe va azeto vebaiwe ite, ‘Usike muo kechi kwa lame, mira furuti muo ukee hakwe Dilao.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34" />Mira ani nimubao neri muaze muwe musike mio neri, kwa ilhe la are ana he Kiumbi, kwaite ni kikire cha Udilao cha Kiumbi, <verse eid="MAT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35" />hile msilape kwa ilhe la idi, kwaite ni hodi Kiumbi ekeiya masame, neri Yerusalemu kwaite ni muang'a kuu mgiru wa Kidilao. <verse eid="MAT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36" />Neri musilape kwa mia kaghu, kwaite temumuru kuboi neri lualhu luwe kukhwa luakhu hile lukuhame. <verse eid="MAT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37" />Ukuba ‘Ee’, idumuwa ikhwa ‘Ee’, naho ukuba ‘Hai’ idumuwa ikhwa ‘Hai’. Neri kigi kiwe chisaisha ka chili he Shetani.”<verse eid="MAT 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etalhiija mburi ya nkuru</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:29-30">Luka 6:29-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38" />Mwaako he miku yakwe Musa heeyoiwe ite, “Muhe ekumhiri m'aro kuu iila, nau enehiriwe iila hile ekumgu m'aro iiki nau eneguwe iiki.” <verse eid="MAT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39" />Mira ani namuba, “Usihikane na muhe mkusa. Mira kai muhe ekukuma izokhera he iulho kechi la sughano, mkiritie akuma na iulho la hina. <verse eid="MAT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40" />Kai muhe ekukutii he ibaraza ekudumu kudori nkazu kechi, muro adori na ikoti. <verse eid="MAT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41" />Kai muhe ekukukungumija kuso naari uuda wa kilomita we, so nau uuda wa kilomita nu. <verse eid="MAT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42" />Kahali kai muhe ekukulhawa umuo kigi, naho muhe ekudumu kukuambala kigi usimlhiije.”<verse eid="MAT 5:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuvadumu vankuru</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:27-28">Luka 6:27-28</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:32-36">32-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43" />“Mwaako he miku yakwe Musa heeyowe ite, ‘Mdumu msina kechi, naho msanuie mnkuru kechi.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44" />Mira ani namubao, vadumuni vankuru kaghu naho muvaaresie huvo vemukharoti kune, <verse eid="MAT 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45" />niho mnekhwa vainyi va Aba kaghu eaha are ana. Kwaite u evakatia kaaze kuu vahe vakusa na vakulho, na kuvageria mare vahe vemko na vesimko. <verse eid="MAT 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46" />Ho mneowe kitumurilo mina kwa kuvadumu bi hu vemudumue kune? Tehelo! Kwaite vazadori ushuru navo veraboi wato oto. <verse eid="MAT 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47" />Naho mkuvaholu vabakhu kaghu bi, he, mnekhwa mwaaboi kigi mina kutakho vahali? Kwaite vesimdarisha Kiumbi navo veraboi sato. <verse eid="MAT 5:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48" />Kwato miboire kaghu ifuru, sahucho Aba kaghu waare ana cho efurue he vigi khabuna.”<verse eid="MAT 5:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6" />
  <para style="s">Kuvalhaari vahuye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1" />Wesiani musirezaboi miboire kaghu mikulho he vahe kalo ite vamuakho. Kwaite mkuboi to, Aba kaghu eaha are ana neri tekamuo kitumulilo. <verse eid="MAT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2" />“Kwato mkuvalhaari vahuye, musiyo he muhe sacho valame veboi he minda ja kusaheia Vayahudi nahe kwalhi kalo vayoiwe kikulho ni vahe. Kweri nimubaya, kavo vaafiriti kudoria kitumulilo kini. <verse eid="MAT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3" />Mira ari mkumlhaari mhuye, boini kwa kumatu neri muharegha kechi wa hina usiile hucho muharegha wa sughano uboi, <verse eid="MAT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4" />kalo kivulu kechi chisiiliwe ni muhe mhali. Niho Aba kechi waare ana eakho vimatuike enekuo kitumulilo.”<verse eid="MAT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahinyo ya kumuaresi Kiumbi na kulhati</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:2-4">Luka 11:2-4</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5" />“Mkuaresi, musikhwa sa vahe vakusa vekuaija ite ni vakulho. Vo vedumuu kuuma na kuaresi hodi vesahea Vayahudi na kakera he kwalhi kalo vahe vavaakho. Kweri nimubaiya, kavo vaafiriti kudoria kitumulilo kini. <verse eid="MAT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6" />Mira kune mkuaresi, buuni za he minda kaghu naho mulhati maluhige mumuaresi Aba kaghu esiakhoika. Naka Aba kaghu eakho yematuike, enemuo vitumulilo kaghu.” <verse eid="MAT 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7" />“Kune mkuaresi, msiyo viome vikumure sa vahe vesimuilie Kiumbi. Kwaite vetoti ite Kiumbi enevako kwa mburi ya viome kini vikumure. <verse eid="MAT 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8" />Musikhwa muaresi sakigi vo vearesi, kwaite Aba kaghu ereila yo myadumu neri musina mlhawa”. <verse eid="MAT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9" />Kwato mkumuaresi Kiumbi, muba to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:9">“Aba kanu uaha are ana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:9">Ilhe kechi likowe.<verse eid="MAT 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10" />Udilao kechi ulita,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:10">Hucho udumu nachikhwa wato, ii he idi saare ana.<verse eid="MAT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11" />Utuo viaghu kanu kira muaze.<verse eid="MAT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12" />Utukaaie makusa kanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:12">Sakigi nne tuvakaaiya vakusa kanu.<verse eid="MAT 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13" />Usituro tukagaliwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:13">Mira utukaa hehu mkusa. Kwaite Udilao ni mkechi na umuruisho na ugiru, maaze makhabuna. Nachikhwa to.”<verse eid="MAT 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14" />Kwaite mkuvakaaiya vahe makusa kini, Aba kaghu eaha ana enemukaaya na kune. <verse eid="MAT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15" />Mira iji mkusaavakaaiya vahe makusa kini, naka Aba kaghu eaha are ana tekamukaaiye kune makusa kaghu.<verse eid="MAT 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahinyo ya kulhati kusaa kigi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16" />“Mukulhati kusaa kigi, musiaije uhuye sacho veboi vahe vakusa vekuboi vakulho. Kwaite vo vekoma vubasa kini kalo vamuru kuakhoika he vahe ite tevae. Nimubaya kweri, kavo vaafiriti kudoria vitumulilo kini. <verse eid="MAT 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17" />Mira kune mukulhati kusaa kigi, muonhi vubasa kaghu naho mulhomi malhoma he mia kaghu, <verse eid="MAT 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18" />kalo kulhati kaghu kusaa kigi kusiiliwe ni vahe vahali, mira Aba kaghu bi waare ana esiakhoika niu edumuwa aile, naka Aba kaghu eakho mburi jo muboi jimatuike enemuo kune vitumulilo kaghu.”<verse eid="MAT 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukeiyeni uzuri kaghu are ana he Kiumbi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:33-34">Luka 12:33-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19" />“Musikukeiye uzuri kaghu he idi kwaite vunyongole na nkanga vineoni, naho vagwalo venebuu na kugwa. <verse eid="MAT 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20" />Kukeiyeni uzuri kaghu ana he Kiumbi areho vunyongole na nkanga tevimuru kuoni neri vagwalo tevemuru kubuu kugwa. <verse eid="MAT 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21" />Kwaite ho uzuri kechi unekhwa uaha niho na swaho kechi ho inekhwa iaha.”<verse eid="MAT 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iila nisa kijari cha msa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:34-36">Luka 11:34-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22" />“Iila nisa kijari cha msa. Iji kai iila kechi ni izime, msa kechi mkhabuna unekhwa na luatame. <verse eid="MAT 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23" />Mira kai iila kechi ligae, msa kechi mkhabuna unekhwa na kidughu. Iji kai luatame luaha za kechi ni kidughu, ka kidughu chinekhwa kigirusha.”<verse eid="MAT 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kiumbi na uzuri</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 16:13">Luka 16:13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:22-31">12:22-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24" />“Tehelo neri muhe muwe emuru kunyamarikia madilao vanu, enemsanuiya muwe naho enemdumu mhali, enekhwa mkulho he muwe na kukhwa na kumfwa mhali. Kune temkamuru kumnyamarikia Kiumbi na uzuri.”<verse eid="MAT 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25" />Kwato nimubaya, musibughenu mburi ya mifufuire kaghu ite munea kiakhoni hile munewaha kiakhoni hile muneoro kiakhoni. Ho, mifufuire simikulhosha kutakho viaghu na msa sikutakho gomae? <verse eid="MAT 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26" />Wesiani vuhimeno tevulha mbeyu, naho tevuloja naho tevulo mami'a yakukea, mira Aba kaghu waare ana eyao viaghu. Ho, kune temvakulho kutakho mahimeno? <verse eid="MAT 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27" />Niji he kune ii ekukunyamarisha emuru kukususu neri kela we yahe mifufuire kuu? <verse eid="MAT 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28" />Niakhoni mukunyamarisha kwa mburi ja gomae? Wesiani malua ya maeza hucho yelheru. Teyeboi nyamalo neri teyekuboiya gomae. <verse eid="MAT 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29" />Mira nimubaiya, neri Dilao Sulemani salaghe na uzuri kuu mkhabuna tenaraa oro gomae kulho saya malua. <verse eid="MAT 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30" />Mira chikukhwa Kiumbi eyaoroija kikulho to ya mahako he mbuva yeaha wai na lhenu yetabibiwe he mwalha, ho tekamuoro kikulho kune musilo kudarisha kufurue? <verse eid="MAT 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31" />Kwato musitoti nakuba ite, “Tunea kiakhoni?” Hile, “Tunewaha kiakhoni? Hile, tuneoro kiakhoni? <verse eid="MAT 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32" />Kwaite vahe vesimulie Kiumbi nivo vedaa vigi saka, mira Aba kaghu waare ana ereila ite mudumue ka vigi vikhabuna. <verse eid="MAT 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33" />Mira kune rongadaani Udilao wa Kiumbi nakuboi huyo edumu yaboike, naka makhabuna mnesusuwe. <verse eid="MAT 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34" />Kwato musitoti kwa mburi ya lhenu, kwaite lhenu inekunyamarikia salaghe. Kunyamarika kwa iaze iwe kumuagha.”<verse eid="MAT 6:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7" />
  <para style="s">Kuzamari vahali</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:37-38">Luka 6:37-38</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:41-42">41-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1" />“Musivazamari vahali, kalo na kune museezamariwa ni Kiumbi, <verse eid="MAT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2" />kwaite cho munevazari vahali, nire wato Kiumbi enemuzamari, nacho munevaaghatia vahali nire wato muneaghatiwa ni Kiumbi.” <verse eid="MAT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3" />Kwaakhoni uwesia kabasi keaha he iila la mbakhu kechi naho tuakho ibare liaha he iila kechi? <verse eid="MAT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4" />Hile umuru kimomo kumbaya mbakhu kechi, “Hakiro nikukaa kabasi keaha he iila kechi naho ari salaghe ulo ibare he iila kechi? <verse eid="MAT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5" />Ari muhe mkusa ukuakho mkulho, rongakaa ibare liaha he iila kechi niho unemuru kuakho kikulho kabasi keaha he iila la mbakhu kechi.” <verse eid="MAT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6" />“Musiyao madie viaghu vikulho kalo yasiremukiriiya na kumuhiri, neri musijibibie gua vigi kaghu vikulho kwaite jinevidaha naho jinemukiriia nakumuhiri.”<verse eid="MAT 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulhawa, kudaa na kuba mwuii</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Luka 11:9-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7" />“Lhawani, naho muneowe, daaijani naho muneakho, bani mwuii, na kune munelhaiwa luhige. <verse eid="MAT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8" />Kwaite, elhawa etaowe nahu edaa eneakho, nahu eba muii enelhaiwa luhige.” <verse eid="MAT 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9" />Niji he kune enemuo muinyi kuu isaheru kai muinyi kuu ekumlhawa mkate? Hile enemo bome ekumlhawa samaki? <verse eid="MAT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10" />Hile muinyi kuu ekumlhawa samaki enem'o bome? <verse eid="MAT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11" />Kai kune bi vakusa mureile kuvao vainyi kaghu vigi vikulho. Kweri aba kaghu eaha are ana tekavao vigi vikulhosha huvo vemlhawa? <verse eid="MAT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12" />“Vaboiyeni vahe vahali sa hucho mudumu muboiiwe, kwaite ya nicho idumu hu miku yakwe Kiumbi emuoe Musa na mahinyo ya varoto va Kiumbi.”<verse eid="MAT 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwalhi chacho na luhige mhana</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 13:24">Luka 13:24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13" />“Buuni kwa kutakhoya he luhige luchacho. Kwaite luhige luso bamuza ni lumpana na kwalhi iso bamuza ni mhana naka veitakho ka kwalhi ni vakumure. <verse eid="MAT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14" />Mira luhige ni luchacho na kwalhi iso he uzime ni chacho, navo veiakho ka kwalhi nivaghere.”<verse eid="MAT 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mkhatu uilika he matunda kuu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:43">Luka 6:43</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:44">44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15" />“Khwani maila na varoto valame, vo velita naho ukuvawesia kwa gahana vetoe sa maalu, mira are za ni madie makusa ya maeza. <verse eid="MAT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16" />Munevaila bi kwa miboire kini.” Ho, vahe vedaa zabibu he mikhatu ya milhae, hile he mhuti? <verse eid="MAT 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17" />Wato oto, mkhatu mkulho usa matunda makulho, na mkhatu mkusa usa matunda makusa. <verse eid="MAT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18" />Mkhatu mkulho teumuru kusa matunda makusa, na mkhatu mkusa teumuru kusa matunda makulho. <verse eid="MAT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19" />Naho kira mkhatu usisa matunda makulho unetewe na kubibiwe he mwalha. <verse eid="MAT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20" />Kwato munevaile varoto va lame kwa hucho veboi.<verse eid="MAT 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Simuilie kune</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 13:25-27">Luka 13:25-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21" />“Si kira muhe enise, ‘Dilao, Dilao,’ niu enebuu he Udilao waare ana, mira nihu bi eboi hucho Abagho edumu. <verse eid="MAT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22" />Muaze wa zamaro ukuhe, vakumure venenise, Dilao, Dilao tetugue uroto na mapepo na kuboi vimako vikumure kwa ilhe kechi?” <verse eid="MAT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23" />Niho ninemuba ite, “Simuilie kune hakani ii nisimuakho kune muvahe vakusa.”<verse eid="MAT 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vahe vanu vekwa minda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:47-49">Luka 6:47-49</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24" />Kwato, kira muhe eko viome gho na kuvidarisha, etoiane na muhe elo viugho, ekwae minda kuu ana he ighamba kalo minda isirelhu. <verse eid="MAT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25" />Mare ikasi, miharaza ikahu, nkunkunho giru ivumira ikalita naho ikaima hu minda. Mira teilhue kwaite yeekwawe ana he ighamba. <verse eid="MAT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26" />“Mira muhe eko viome gho naho teviboiya nyamalo, etoyane sa muhe esilo akiri ekwae minda kuu ana he msangalagala. <verse eid="MAT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27" />Mare ikasi naho miharaza ikahu, nkunkunho giru ikalita naho ikaima ka minda, naka minda ikalhu kwa msindo mgiru.”<verse eid="MAT 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umuruisho wakwe Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28" />Yesu areafiriti kuyo ka viome, vahe vakumure vekamashwa ni mahinyo kuu. <verse eid="MAT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29" />Kwaite ehinyie sa muhe elo umuruisho neri tehinyie sahu vahinya kini va miku yakwe Musa.<verse eid="MAT 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8" />
  <para style="s">Yesu etamuuti muhe elo lukoma</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mariko 1:40-45</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luka 5:12-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1" />Yesu areadimi kuli he lubwa, maifyo makumure ya vahe vekamliaha. <verse eid="MAT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2" />Niho ekalita mhe muwe eru urukhao wa lukoma, ekammaiya Yesu mamuro ekamba, “Dilao ukudumu umuru kuniuti” <verse eid="MAT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3" />Yesu ekakhuuru muheregha kuu, ekamdoa naho ekamba, “Nidumu, uu.” Wato oto hu muhe ekau urukao wa lukoma. <verse eid="MAT 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4" />Niho Yesu ekamba, “Uwesie usirembaya muhe, mira so urekuaija hehu mgiru wa kirurumo naho uregu kivulu chiyoiwe he miku yakwe Kiumbi emuoe Musa kalo kuaija ite ari waau urukhao.”<verse eid="MAT 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etamuuti mnyamalo wa muaku wa Kirumi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 7:1-10">Luka 7:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5" />Yesu areabuu he muang'a wa Kapernaumu, muaku muwe ekamliaha na kumgogo amlhaari <verse eid="MAT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6" />ekumba, “Dilao, mnyamalo gho ebodie are ang'a eholoje naho eruisha.” <verse eid="MAT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7" />Niho Yesu ekamba “Nnelita nimuuti.” <verse eid="MAT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8" />Ka muaku ekamba, “Dilao, techiye ari ulite he minda gho. Mira yo bi kiome na mnyamalo gho eneu. <verse eid="MAT 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9" />Kwaite naani nireaha di ya vadilao vahali naho nilo vaaku gho vahali. Nikumba muwe, ‘So’ Nau etaso, na muhali, ‘Lita’ Nau etalita, naho nikumba mnyamalo gho, ‘Boi kigi ya’ Nau etaboi.” <verse eid="MAT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10" />Yesu areako ka viome ekamaka, ekavaba vahe veekumliaha, “Kweri nimubaya, neri sinaraakho muhe ii Izraeli edarisha saya muhe. <verse eid="MAT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11" />Iji namubao, vahe vakumure venelita kuli ho kaaze keliiya naho kefilia, navo venezokhodi he elha hawe ne Iburahamu ne Isaka ne Yakobo he Udilao waare ana he Kiumbi. <verse eid="MAT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12" />Mira vainyi vaka udilao venebibiwe gahana he kidughu, are venezo na kung'e maiki.” <verse eid="MAT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13" />Niho Yesu ekamba ka muaku wa Kirumi, “So ang'a naho chikhwa sacho udarishe.” Nahu mnyamalo wa muaku wa Kirumi ekau madamo wahuuhu.<verse eid="MAT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etavauti vahe vakumure</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mariko 1:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luka 4:38-41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14" />Yesu areahe ang'a hakwe Petro, ekamhelha lage mkora wakwe Petro ebodie he muhasi naho eelo ihoma. <verse eid="MAT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15" />Yesu ekamdoa muheregha ka mlage, naka mlage ekau ekauma, ekamanhuiya viaghu Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16" />Hareakhokwa, vekamgeria vahe vakumure velo mapepo nau ekavagu mapepo kwa kiome kuu naho ekavauti vahe vakhabuna varukhao. <verse eid="MAT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17" />Eboie to kalo hu yeeyowe ni Isaya mroto wa Kiumbi yafuru, yeba, “U salaghe aatuuti marukhao kanu naho aatuboi tukhwa vazime.”<verse eid="MAT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Veye kumliaha Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 9:57-62">Luka 9:57-62</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18" />Muaze muwe Yesu areakho vahe vakumure vemjuguluke, ekavaba vahina kuu vatakho mlha wa kanu wa iziwa. <verse eid="MAT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19" />Mhinya muwe wa miku yakwe Kiumbi emoe Musa ekamliaha Yesu ekamba, “Mhinya ani ninekuliaha kira hodi uneso.” <verse eid="MAT 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20" />Yesu ekamba, “Mhelele jidi he mhanga, na mahimeno yelo mashasha kini, mira Muinyi wa Muhe telo hodi ha kufufu na kubodi.” <verse eid="MAT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21" />Niho mhina mhali hehu vahina kuu ekamba, “Mgiru, ronganiro ini niso niremke aba he mbira.” <verse eid="MAT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22" />Mira Yesu ekamba, “Niliaha, varo vegae vakeane he mbira salaghini.”<verse eid="MAT 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etaitaaija nkunkunho giru</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mariko 4:35-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luka 8:22-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23" />Yesu eebuiye he mashua, vahina kuu vekamliaha. <verse eid="MAT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24" />Wato oto hekakhwa na nkunkunho girusha ata heiziwa, niho hu mashua ikatahe sina kufili za hemai, mira Yesu eekhwae eie luireno. <verse eid="MAT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25" />Vahina vekamsusughuia kuramkaa vekumba, “Dilao tulhaari!” “Tuata sina kuga” <verse eid="MAT 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26" />Yesu ekavaba, “Kune mulo kudaraisha kugitutu, ‘Kwaakhoni mubugheno?’ Niho ekaka ekaiba huu nkunkunho ya mai taa nakawe, vikhabuna vikataa.” <verse eid="MAT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27" />Hu vahe vekamaka, vekuba, “Ni muhe wa mbari mina ya? Sari nkunkunho ya mai na iziwa vimko.”<verse eid="MAT 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etavauti vahe vanu velo mapepo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mariko 5:1-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luka 8:26-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28" />Yesu ereahe chauju ya iziwa he idi la Vagerasi, ekasahe na vahe vanu velo mapepo velie hodi hakukeia vahe vegae. Ka vahe nee vakilalu kweri naho tehelo mhe emurue kutakho heka kwalhi. <verse eid="MAT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29" />Hu vahe vekalholhoshi kuma gimbe vekuba, “Ulo kiakhoni na nne ari Muinyi wa Kiumbi? Hile utelita kutunyamarisha madamo yedumuwa yesinahe?” <verse eid="MAT 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30" />Sina to heelo ifyo igiru la gua jeekuzeuwa. <verse eid="MAT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31" />Niho ka mapepo yekamgogo Yesu yekuba, “Kai unetugu ii, uturo tujibuie hu gua.” <verse eid="MAT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32" />Yesu ekayaba, “Haya soni.” Hu mapepo yekali hehu vahe nakabuu he gua. Hu gua khabuna jikadimi he lubwa, jikafili he iziwa jikaga kwa mburi ya mai. <verse eid="MAT 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33" />Niho hu vazemo veekuzeu ka gua vekagugulu, vekaso he muang'a, naho are vekavabaia vahe mburi khabuna jivaheye hu vahe veebuiwe ni mapepo. <verse eid="MAT 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34" />Niho vahe vakhabuna hehu mwang'a vekali nakumliaha Yesu, varemuakho vekamgogo ahali he muang'a kini.<verse eid="MAT 8:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesu etamuuti muhe eholoje</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mariko 2:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luka 5:17-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1" />Yesu ekakutu he mashua, ekatakho iziwa nakukirii kuhe he muang'a kini usewa Kaperenaumu. <verse eid="MAT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2" />Niho vahe vekamgeria muhe muwe eholoje msa, ebodijwe he kamhasi. Yesu areakho kudarisha kini, ekamba ka muhe eholoje, “Muinyi gho kuo swaho, waakaaiwa makusa kechi.” <verse eid="MAT 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3" />Niho vahinya wa miku ya Kiumbi eemoe Musa vekalholhoshi kutoti he swaho kini ite, “Ya muhe etamfwa Kiumbi.” <verse eid="MAT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4" />Yesu areaila cho vetoti he swaho kini, ekaba, “Kwaakhoni mutoti makusa he swaho kaghu? <verse eid="MAT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5" />Ni kihama chimangamuruika, kuba, ‘Waakaaiwa makusa kechi,’ Hile kuba, ‘Uma, udaha?’ <verse eid="MAT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6" />Kwato iji, nidumu muile ite Muinyi wa Muhe elo ugiru he idi la kukaaya vahe makusa.” Niho Yesu ekamba hu muhe eholoje, “Ka, udori mhasi kechi, uso ang'a hakechi.” <verse eid="MAT 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7" />Hu muhe eeholoje ekaka na kuso ang'a hakuu. <verse eid="MAT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8" />Vahe vakhabuna hehu ifyo vareakho kayo, vekamaka na kubugheno, vekamkairi Kiumbi evaoye vahe ugiru saka.<verse eid="MAT 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etamse Matayo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mariko 2:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luka 5:27-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9" />Yesu ereakhwa eso, ekamuakho mhe muwe mzadara kodi esewa Matayo, eezokhodie hodi hakudoria kodi. Niho Yesu ekamba, “Niliaha.” Niho Matayo ekaka, ekamliaha. <verse eid="MAT 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10" />Ata Yesu eaha minda, ezokhodie kua viaghu, vazadara kodi vakumure na velo makusa vekalita kua viaghu hawe nau na vahina kuu. <verse eid="MAT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11" />Mafarisayo vareakho to, vekavaba vahina kuu, “Kwaakhoni mhinya kaghu ea hawe na vazadara kodi na velo makusa?” <verse eid="MAT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12" />Yesu ekavako, ekavaba, “Vahe vazime tevedumu mkura, vemdaa mkura nihu varukhao. <verse eid="MAT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13" />Kwato mrehina mburi jaya viome, ‘Nidumu mbalamija, neri si vivulu.’ Kwaite silitie kuvase vahe vakulho, mira nilitie kuvase velo makusa.”<verse eid="MAT 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mburi ya kulhati kua kigi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mariko 2:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luka 5:33-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14" />Niho vahina vakwe Yohana Mzabatija vekaso hakwe Yesu, vekamlhasu, “Kwaakhoni nne na Mafarisayo tulhati kua, mira vahina kechi tevelhati kua kigi?” <verse eid="MAT 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15" />Yesu ekavaba, “Verarikwe he elha tevedumuwe kulhati kua to mzadori eaha hawe navo? Hai, neri, mira madamo yenehe mzadori enekaawe hakini, ka madamo niho venezalhati kua kigi.” <verse eid="MAT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16" />“Vahe tevehi kilaka cha gomae kuale hegomae ialalue. Kwaite ka kilaka kikuale chineiboi ka gomae ialalue isaishe kukhaika, na to heekhaaike henekhwa hagirusha. <verse eid="MAT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17" />Neri vahe tevebutu divai kuale he mfuko wa bulhe ialalue. Kai vekuboi to, vishau vya bulhe vinekhaaika na divai inesuika, naka mfuko wa bulhe uneonika. Mira vahe vebutu divai kuale he vishau vya bulhe vikuale, vishau vya bulhe na divai, vikhabuna vinu vitakhwa kikulho.”<verse eid="MAT 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etemuuti mlage muwe na kumkaa mualeta wa mgiru kuli he kigame</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mariko 5:21-43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luka 8:40-56</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18" />Ka madamo Yesu areakhwa echeri yo, wato oto mgiru muwe Myahudi ekalita, ekamgogo Yesu kwa kumaya mamuro ekamba, “Mualeta gho aaga waijiji to. Mira nikugogo tuso uremkeia miheregha kechi nau akhwa mzime.” <verse eid="MAT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19" />Yesu hawe na vahina kuu vekamliha hu mgiru. <verse eid="MAT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20" />Mlage muwe, mrukhao wa kuliwe ni sako he madamo ya miko ikado na minu, ekamliaha Yesu kwa mzungure, ekadoa gomae kuu. <verse eid="MAT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21" />Ka mlage eekutotie he swaho kuu ite, “Nikunedoa bi gomae kuu, nineu.” <verse eid="MAT 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22" />Niho, Yesu ekawesia aremuakho, ekamba, “Mualeta, kuo swaho, kudarisha kechi kwakuuti.” Ka mlage ekau madamo waka aka. <verse eid="MAT 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23" />Yesu ekabuu he minda yahu mgiru wa Kiyahudi. Areaakho vazama firimbi na ifyo la vahe vezo, <verse eid="MAT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24" />Yesu ekavaba, “Halini ii! Ya mualeta tegae, etebodi bi.” Navo vekamsisi kwa kumfwa. <verse eid="MAT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25" />Niho ifyo la vahe lireakaawe, Yesu ekabuu hehu minda ekamdara mharegha ka mualeta, nau ekaka. <verse eid="MAT 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26" />Ka mburi ikaparaa hehu idi ikhabuna.<verse eid="MAT 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etavauti vahe vanu velo maila esiakho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27" />Yesu ereakhwa eli ata, vahe vanu velo maila esiakho vekamliaha ilai vema nkalasu, “Muinyi wakwe Daudi, tukoe mbalamija!” <verse eid="MAT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28" />Yesu areabuu he minda, ka vahe vanu vesiakho kwa maila vekamliaha nau ekavalhaasu, “Ho, mudarisha ite nimuru kumuboi muakho?” Navo vekamba, “Ee, mgiru.” <verse eid="MAT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29" />Niho Yesu ekayadoa maila kini, ekaba, “Nachikhwa to hakaghu sacho mudarisha.” <verse eid="MAT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30" />Waata ata maila kini yekalhaika. Yesu ekavalhiija kwa kuvajoghoiya, “Museerambaya neri muhe ya mburi.” <verse eid="MAT 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31" />Mira vo vekaso na kuraparati mburi jakwe Yesu hodi hakhabuna.<verse eid="MAT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etamuuti muhe esimuru kuyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32" />Heka madamo vahe vekuhali, vahali vekamgeria Yesu muhe muwe esimuru kuyo kwaite eedaraiwe ni ipepo. <verse eid="MAT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33" />Mira hu ipepo lireaguwe ka muhe eesimuru kuyo ekalholhoshi kuyo. Hu ifyo la vahe likamaka nakuba “Mburi saya teinaraalijanya he idi la Izraeli.” <verse eid="MAT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34" />Mira Mafarisayo vekaba, “Ya egu ipepo kwa lumuruisho lwa mgiru wa ipepo.”<verse eid="MAT 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etavakoiya mbalamija vahe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35" />Yesu edahae he miang'a mikhabuna nahe vijiji, ekuhinya hodi hakusaheiya Vayahudi kini ilai ekubirikira Mburi Kulho ja Udilao wa Kiumbi na kuuti marukhao makhabuna yeaha he vahe. <verse eid="MAT 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36" />Iji, areaakho vahe vakumure, ekavakoiya mbalamija kwaite vekua kharo neri kulhaariwe. Vetoe sa maalu yesilo mzemo. <verse eid="MAT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37" />Niho ekavaba vahina kuu, “Ulojo ni mkumure mira vanyamalo ni vaghere. <verse eid="MAT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38" />Kwato mlhawani elo ka ulojo kalo asugha vanyamalo he mbuva kuu ya ulojo.”<verse eid="MAT 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10" />
  <para style="s">Yesu etavalhoija vazasughawa ikado na vanu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mariko 3:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luka 6:12-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1" />Niho Yesu ekavalhoja vahina kuu ikado na vanu, ekavao umuruisho wa kuguguluti mapepo na kuuti kira urukhao na marukhao makhabuna. <verse eid="MAT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2" />Malhe yaka vazasughawa ikado na vanu nee Simoni esewe Petro ne Andrea mbakhu kuu ne Yakobo muinyi wakwe Zebedayo ne Yohana mbakhu kuu, <verse eid="MAT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3" />Filipo ne Batolomayo ne Tomaso ne Matayo eemzadara kodi ne Yakobo muinyi wakwe Alfayo ne Tadayo, <verse eid="MAT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4" />Simoni eekumaania idi kuu ne Yuda Isikarioti emlhie Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etavasugha vahina ikado na vanu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mariko 6:7-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luka 9:1-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5" />Yesu eevasughae ka vahina ikado na vanu na kuvaba, “Msiso he vahe vesi Vayahudi, neri musibuu he miang'a ya Vasamaria. <verse eid="MAT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6" />Mira soni he vahe va Isiraeli bi kwaite vetoe sa maalu yelahae. <verse eid="MAT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7" />Mwaraaso birikirani to, ‘Udilao wa are ana he Kiumbi waahe sina.’ <verse eid="MAT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8" />Utini varukhao, vakaani vahe kuli he kigame, utini velo lukoma, guni mapepo. Muoiwe bule, guni bule. <verse eid="MAT 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9" />Musidori mimaru ya zahabu, neri mihaku, neri magongolo ya shaba. <verse eid="MAT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10" />Musidori ibena la barime, neri gomae hali neri makwadoe, neri ndate kwaite mnyamalo edumu kulhanuwa cho eboiie nyamalo.” <verse eid="MAT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11" />“He muang'a munebuu hile kijiji, daani muhe eye kumudoria, nakune zokhoni ata sari muaze mkunehali. <verse eid="MAT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12" />Mkubuu he minda vaholuni muvaba nhunguru ikhwa nakune. <verse eid="MAT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13" />Kai vahe vaka ang'a veneidoria ka holume, ka nhunguru kaghu inekhwa navo. Mira chikukhwa tevemudoriie, niho nhunguru kaghu inemukiriia. <verse eid="MAT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14" />Chikukhwa muhe temubae buuni hile kumulakhona, niho mkuneli heka minda hile heka muang'a humhunhani masonka he masame kaghu chikhwa ikanyo hevo. <verse eid="MAT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15" />Kweri nimubaiya, he muaze wa kuzamariwa ka muang'a unezamariwa zamaro giru kutakho hu zamaro yeeguwe he miang'a ya Sodoma na Gomora.”<verse eid="MAT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kharo jinelita</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:9-13">Mariko 13:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-17">Luka 21:12-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16" />“Wesiani, ani nitamusugha sa maalu hodi helo madie ya maeza. Kwato mukhwa mupitue sa bome, na vakulho sa sua. <verse eid="MAT 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17" />Mukhwa maila na vahe, kwaite venemudara na kumutii he mabaraza kini na kumuma heminda vesaheya Vayahudi, <verse eid="MAT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18" />kwaite mwaanidarisha ani mnetiiwe he vagiru va idi na madilao kalo muvabaiye Mburi Kulho nahe vahe vesi Vayahudi. <verse eid="MAT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19" />Mira vekunemutii he ibaraza, kune msibughenu ite mneyo kiakhoni hile chinekhwa kimomo, kwaite madamo yekunehe, mneowe cha kuyo. <verse eid="MAT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20" />Kwaite sikune muneyo ka viome, mira ni vya Saa wakwe Kiumbi enekhwa eyo kutakhoiya kune.” <verse eid="MAT 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21" />Heka madamo, “Mbakhu enemkirii mbakhu kuu agaawe, naho aba enemkirii muinyi kuu, na vainyi navyo venevakirii aba ne lage kini na kuvaro vagaawe.” <verse eid="MAT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22" />“Kira muwe enemusanuiya kune kwaite mwaanidaraisha ani. Mira enegumirija sari mkhito, niu eneutiwe. <verse eid="MAT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23" />Vahe vekunemuboiia makusa he muang'a muwe, guguluni he muang'a mhali. Kweri namubaiya temkafiriti kudaha miang'a mikhabuna ya Iziraeli Muinyi wa Muhe esinahe.” <verse eid="MAT 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24" />“Mhina temtakho mhinya kuu, neri mhaye temtakho dilao kuu. <verse eid="MAT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25" />Kwato chiye mhina alhamuiwe kukhwa sa mhinya kuu, na mhaye alhamuiwe kukhwa sa dilao kuu. Kai mgiru wa ang'a esewa Belizebuli, ho vahe va ang'a kuu venesewa malhe makusasha.”<verse eid="MAT 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Edumuwa kubughenuwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:2-7">Luka 12:2-7</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26" />“Kwato musibughenu ka vahe, kwaite tehelo chikumatuike chisikaakhoike, naho tehelo mburi isikailike. <verse eid="MAT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27" />Cho nimubaiya kune he kidughu, chiyoni he luatame na mburi yo mukoie ikuyowe ankau, ibirikireni lheme. <verse eid="MAT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28" />Musivabughenu ka vemuru kugaa msa mira tevemuru kugaa swaho. Nikeba kumbughenu Kiumbi, ka emuru kuoni vikhabuna msa na swaho he mwalha usiga maaze makhabuna neri mkhito . <verse eid="MAT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29" />Ho, nibaieni, vuzeewe vunu tevudiwe kwa sarafu we gitutu? Mira neri muwe teimuru kulhu di kai Aba kaghu esinadumu . <verse eid="MAT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30" />Mira kwa bwa kaghu, sari alhu ja mia kaghu jitariwe khabuna. <verse eid="MAT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31" />Kwato musibughenu, kwaite kune muvakulho kutakho vuzeewe vakumure.<verse eid="MAT 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuvabaiya vahe vahali mburi yakwe Kiristo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:8-9">Luka 12:8-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32" />“Kira mhe eyo he vahe ite u ni mgho, naani nineyo he Aba gho eaha are ana ite ni mgho. <verse eid="MAT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33" />Mira muhe enenilhi he vahe, naani ninemlhi he Aba gho eaha ana.”<verse eid="MAT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sigerie nhunguru nigerie aku</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:51-53">Luka 12:51-53</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:26-27">14:26-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34" />Musitoti ite nilitie kugera nhunguru he idi. Silitie kugera nhunguru mira nigerie aku. <verse eid="MAT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35" />Kwaite nilitie kugera aku he mburatu na igii kuu, he mualeta ne alhii kuu, he mkora na mkora kuu. <verse eid="MAT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36" />Naho vankuru va muhe ni vahe va ang'a kuu. <verse eid="MAT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37" />“Emdumuishe aba hile lage kuu kutakho cho enidumue ani teniye. Emdumuishe muinyi kuu wakiburatu hile wakialeta kutakho ani teye kukhwa mhina gho. <verse eid="MAT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38" />Kahali muhe esidori msalaba kuu naho ekaniliaha, teye kukhwa mhina gho. <verse eid="MAT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39" />Edumuishe mizokhoire kuu, eneilahati, mira elahati mizokhoire kuu kwa mburi gho, eneyaakho.<verse eid="MAT 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kitumulilo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:41">Mariko 9:41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40" />“Emudoria kune, enidoria ani, naho enidoria ani, emdoria hu enisughae. <verse eid="MAT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41" />Kira muhe emdoria mroto wa Kiumbi kwaite aamuakho ka mhe ite ni mroto wa Kiumbi, enedoria kitumulilo cha mroto wa Kiumbi. Emdoria muhe mkulho kwaite amuakho ka mhe ite ni muhe mkulho, enedoria kitumulilo cha muhe mkulho. <verse eid="MAT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42" />Kweri nimubaiya, muhe enemo kikonho cha mai muwe waya vagitutu kwaite ni mhina gho, tekabeni kudoria kitumulilo kuu.”<verse eid="MAT 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11" />
  <para style="s">Vahe vesughaiwe kuli hakwe Yohana Mzabatija</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 7:18-35">Luka 7:18-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1" />Niho Yesu areafiriti kuvabaya vahina kuu ikado na vanu, ekahali ata, ekaso kuhinya na kubirikira he miang'a ya Galilaya. <verse eid="MAT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2" />Yohana Mzabatija eeoroiwe heigereza, ekako mburi jakwe Yesu jo eekuboi, niho Yohana ekavasugha vahina kuu hakwe Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3" />Vakamlhasu Yesu ite, “Ho, ari nihu Yesu eneralita, hile tumlaa mhali?” <verse eid="MAT 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4" />Yesu ekavaba, “Kiriini muremba Yohana mburi jomko nakujiakho. <verse eid="MAT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5" />Velo maila esiakho veakho, vesimuru kudaha vedaha, na velo lukoma veutiwa, velo malama esiko veko, vegae vekaawe kuli hekuga na vahuye vebaiwa Mburi kulho. <verse eid="MAT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6" />Kiumbi Enemboiya makulho kira muhe esinilhi ani kwa mburi jo niboi.”<verse eid="MAT 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7" />Ka madamo vahina vakwe Yohana Mzabatija vareakhwa vehali, Yesu ekalholhoshi kuvabaia maifyo ya vahe mburi jakwe Yohana Mzabatija, ekavalhasu ite, “Mweesoe kurawesia kiakhoni twai roro? Ho, mwedumue kuakho mkhatu ukushwa ni saa?” <verse eid="MAT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8" />Kai sicho, mweesoe kurawesia kiakhoni? Mhe eoroe gomae kulho? Vahe veoro gomae kulho vezokho he minda ja madilao <verse eid="MAT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9" />Iji, mweesoe kurawesia akhoni? Ho, musoe kuramuakho mroto wa Kiumbi? Eee, niu chitoe Yohana niu mgiru kutakho mroto. <verse eid="MAT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10" />Ya niu eyowe hemagondo ya Kiumbi ite, “Kiumbi eebae, nnemsugha mzatii mburi gho akukaeye, enekuboia kwalhi kechi.”<verse eid="MAT 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11" />Kweri nimuba, he vainyi vakhabuna va vahe, tenaraalijanya emgiru kutaho Yohana Mzabatija. Mira emgitutusha he udilao wa are ana he Kiumbi, ni mgiru kumtakho Yohana Mzabatija. <verse eid="MAT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12" />Kulholhoshi he maaze yakwe Yohana Mzabatija eekubirikira sari maaze ya waijiji, Udilao wa are ana he Kiumbi urasahe na kharo ja velo u, naka velo u vetagali kuudori kwa u. <verse eid="MAT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13" />Yohana mzabatija esinalita, miku khabuna na varoto vakhabuna va Kiumbi verotie mburi jinelijanya heya madamo jiyoya Udilao wa Kiumbi. <verse eid="MAT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14" />Kwato kai mudarisha uroto kini nikuba ite Yohana niu Eliya hu varoto veebae ite eneralita. <verse eid="MAT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15" />Elo malama yeko, nako. <verse eid="MAT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16" />Mira, ya ikolwa la waijiji nilitoije na kiakhoni? Litoe sa vainyi vezokhodie kikhoja, vekuse vaaro kini, na kuvaba, <verse eid="MAT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17" />“Twaamumaiya mtaragha mira temlhalhahae, twaafaru faru ja vigato mira temzoe.” <verse eid="MAT 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18" />Kwaite Yohana eelitie, ekaro kua naho neri tewahae divai, navo vekaba, “U elo ipepo.” <verse eid="MAT 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19" />Muinyi wa Mhe eelitie, eekua nakuwaha divai, navo vekaba, “Muwesieni ya ni mhayo naho mzaengeli, msaho wa vazadara kodi na velo makusa. Mira iji, viugho vya Kiumbi viraakhoika kukhwa vikulho kutakhoia he miboire kuu.”<verse eid="MAT 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Miang'a ya vahe vesidarisha</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 10:13-15">Luka 10:13-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20" />Niho Yesu ekalholhoshi kuvajoghoia vahe va miang'a yo eboie vimako vikumure, kwaite tevekiriie na kuro makusa kini. <verse eid="MAT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21" />“Kuriuwa kaghu vahe va Korazini hawe na vahe va Betisaida, kwaite, kai vimako viboike hakaghu nanga vyeeteboika twai Tiro na are Sidoni, vahe kuu veseeoroe gomae jiboiwe na magunia azeto na kukulhomi maora na kuyo na kuro makusa kini.” <verse eid="MAT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22" />Mira namubao, muaze wa kuzamari, kune muneowa kharo giru kutakho zamaro vezamariiwe vahe va miang'a ya are Tiro na Sidoni. <verse eid="MAT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23" />Naho vahe va Kapernaumu, ho mutoti ite Kiumbi unemukuturu sari are ana hakuu? Hai, unedimiriwe sari bamuza, kwaite, kai vimako viboike hake vyeeteboiika twai he muang'a wa Sodoma, ka muang'a weseekhwa ureaha sari wai. <verse eid="MAT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24" />Mira nimubaiya ite, muaze wa zamaro kune mneowe kharo giru kutakho Sodoma.<verse eid="MAT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Litani hagho mfufu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 10:21-22">Luka 10:21-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25" />Niho Yesu ekaba, “Nikukairi ari Aba, Dilao wa are ana na idi, kwaite waavamatu ya mburi vahe velo viugho nahu vepitue waavaaija ya mburi vahe vesilo viugho nahu vesipitue. <verse eid="MAT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26" />Ee, Aba, nicho chikulhamuije.” <verse eid="MAT 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27" />“Aba gho aanio vigi vikhabuna. Tehelo mhe em'ilie Muinyi mira Aba bi, neri mhe em'ilie Aba mira ni Muinyi bi, Mira Muinyi edumu avabaie vahali mburi yakwe Aba, kwato navo venemuru kum'ila.” <verse eid="MAT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28" />“Litani hagho kune vakhabuna munyamarika na kuyakhiiwa ni mimaru, naho ani ninemufufuija. <verse eid="MAT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29" />Boini hu nimuhinya kuboi, lakhonhani mahinyo gho yo nimuhinya, naho muhine kuli hagho, kwaite ani nimkulho neri sikuaija ite ani nimgiru, kwaite nnemulhaari, nakune munekhwa na nhunguru nakufufu. <verse eid="MAT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30" />Kwaite sikamuba ite muboi mburi ure, neri sikamuba ite muchii mimaru iyakhi.”<verse eid="MAT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12" />
  <para style="s">Mahinyo ya Muaze wa kufufu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mariko 2:23-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luka 6:1-5</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1" />Ka madamo, Yesu eekutatakho he mbuva ja ngano muaze wa Kufufu. Niho, vahina kuu vekako kela, vekalholhoshi kupu vireri vya ngano, vekaa mpuluzi. <verse eid="MAT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2" />Mafarisayo vareaakho to, vekamba Yesu, “Wesia, vahina kechi veboi mburi isidumuwa he miku ya Muaze wa kufufu.” <verse eid="MAT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3" />Yesu ekavalhasu, “Ho, temsomie cho eboie Daudi hawe na vaaro kuu to veelo kela? <verse eid="MAT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4" />Daudi eebuuye he minda ya Kiumbi ekaa mikate yeeguwe kwa mburi ya minda ya Kiumbi. U hawe na vaaro kuu teveekudumujwa kua ka mikate mira vahe veekudumuijwa kua ka mikate ni vakirurumo vahe Minda ya Kiumbi bi. <verse eid="MAT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5" />Hile kune temuwesie chigondiwe he miku yakwe Musa ite muaze wa Kufufu vakirurumo veoni miku ya Muaze wa kufufu he Minda ya Kiumbi mira Kiumbi tevaakhoe ite veboie kikusa.?” <verse eid="MAT 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6" />Kwato, nimubaiya ite ka emgiru kutakho minda ya Kiumbi ereaha ii. <verse eid="MAT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7" />Kai mweilie chiyoiwe heya Magondo ya Kiumbi ite, “Nidumuisha mbalamija neri sidumu kivulu,” Temweseevazamari vahe vesilo makusa. <verse eid="MAT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8" />Kwaite Muinyi wa Mhe niu elo ugiru wa Muaze wa kufufu.<verse eid="MAT 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etamuuti muhe elo mharegha uholoje</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mariko 3:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luka 6:6-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9" />Yesu ekahali ata, ekaso he minda yakusaheiya Vayahudi, <verse eid="MAT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10" />Are heelo muhe muwe elo mheregha uholoje. Niho, vahe vekamlhasu Yesu, “Ho, chiraye kumuusi muhe Muaze wa kufufu?” Veemlhasue to kalo vaakho mburi ya kumbutu he maoghe. <verse eid="MAT 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11" />Mira Yesu ekavaba, “Tuba ite muwe kaghu elo ialu kuu libuuye he ihora, ho temkalidare na kuligu ata Muaze wa kufufu? <verse eid="MAT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12" />Mira iji, muhe uzuri mkulho kutakho ialu. Kwato, chidumuwe kuboi makulho muaze wa kufufu.” <verse eid="MAT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13" />Niho Yesu ekamba hu muhe, “Kuuru muharegha kechi ulhawa.” Ka muhe ekaukuuru mharegha kuu, nawo ukakhwa mzime sahu mhali. <verse eid="MAT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14" />Mira Mafarisayo vekali gahana, vekaiseko cho venemgaa Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mnyamalo elhoijwe ni Kiumbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15" />Mira Yesu areaila ka mburi, ekahali to hodi. Vahe vakumure vekamliaha, ekavauti varukhao vakhabuna, <verse eid="MAT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16" />ekavalhiija vasivabaye vahe ite u niji, <verse eid="MAT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17" />kalo yalijanye huyo Kiumbi kutakhoia Isaya hu eemroto ite, <verse eid="MAT 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18" />“Wesia mzasughawa gho, ka nimlhoje, naho nimdumue enilhamuija he swaho.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">“Nneke saa gho hakuu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">Nau enevabaia vahe va madi makhabuna ite</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">Nnevazamari sakigi chidumuwe.<verse eid="MAT 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19" />Tekakwe neri tekama gimbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:19">Neri tehelo eneko kiome kuu he kwalhi.<verse eid="MAT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20" />Tekavahiri vahe vahuye, enekhwa mkulho hevahe velo u,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:20">Sari ekuneboi ukweri wa Kiumbi uilike.<verse eid="MAT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21" />Vahe va madi makhabuna venemuarira u ite enevakaa.”<verse eid="MAT 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ne Belizebuli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 3:20-30">Mariko 3:20-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luka 11:14-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22" />Niho vahe vekamgera muhe muwe hakwe Yesu esimuru kuwesia hile kuyo kwaite ebuuiwe ni ipepo. Yesu ekamuuti niho ekamuru kuyo na kuwesia. <verse eid="MAT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23" />Vahe vakhabuna vekamaka ilai vekulhasu ite, “Ho, chimuru chikakwa ite ya niu Muinyi wakwe Daudi?” <verse eid="MAT 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24" />Mira Mafarisayo vareako to, vekaba, “Ya muhe eyagu mapepo kwa umuruisho wa Belizebuli, mgiru wa mapepo.” <verse eid="MAT 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25" />Yesu eereile cho veekutoti, kwato ekavaba, “Kira udilao ukukhakhaana wangau he maifyo ifyo emayana salaghe, teumuru kuzokho, naho ang'a hile mbari ikakhakhaana maifyo, inelhu. <verse eid="MAT 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26" />Kai Shetani emgu Shetani, etakukweti salaghe. Ho, udilao kuu uneuma kimomo? <verse eid="MAT 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27" />Kune mwaaba ite niyagu mapepo kwa umuruisho wakwe Belizebuli, ho, ka vemuliaha veyagu kwa umuruisho wakwe ji? Kwaka mburi nivo venemuzamari kune. <verse eid="MAT 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28" />Mira kwaite niyagu mapepo kwa umuruisho wa Saa wa Kiumbi, iji muile ite Udilao wa Kiumbi waamuheya hakaghu.” <verse eid="MAT 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29" />“Hile, muhe emuru kimomo kubuu he minda ya muhe elo u na kumla vigi kuu, neri esimoroe ini ka muhe elo u kumure? Ata niho enemuru kumla vigi kuu.” <verse eid="MAT 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30" />“Muhe esikhwari hawe naani, ka ni mnkuru gho na esibunguru hawe naani etazarisha.” <verse eid="MAT 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31" />Kwato namubao, kira eyo kikusa nahu enem'olhu Muinyi wa Muhe enekaaiwa, mira mhe enem'olhu Saa wa Kiumbi tekakaaiwe. <verse eid="MAT 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32" />Naho mhe eneyo kiome cha kum'olhu Muinyi wa Mhe enekaaiwa, mira eneyo kiome cha kumolhu Saa wa Kiumbi tekakaaiwe, neri heya idi, hile he idi lilitie.<verse eid="MAT 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mukhatu na matunda kuu.</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:43-45">Luka 6:43-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33" />“Mkhatu mkulho niu unesa matunda makulho, naho mkhatu mkusa, unesa matunda makusa. Kwaite mkhatu uneilika kwa matunda kuu.” <verse eid="MAT 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34" />Kune ikolwa la bome, mumuru kimomo kuyo mburi kulho naho kune muvakusa? Kwaite mhe eyo vigi viaha he swaho kuu. <verse eid="MAT 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35" />Muhe mkulho eyo mburi kulho kuli hmitotire kuu mikulho, naho muhe mkusa eyo mburi kusa kuli he mitotire kuu mikusa. <verse eid="MAT 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36" />“Kwato namubao, muaze wakuzamariwa kira muwe eneyo salaghe mburi khabuna kusa hujo eejiyoe. <verse eid="MAT 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37" />Kwaite kwa viome kechi unedumuijwa kukhwa mhe mkulho naho kwa viome kechi unezamariwa kukhwa mhe mkusa.”<verse eid="MAT 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kudumu kuakho vimako</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:11-12">Mariko 8:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29-32">Luka 11:29-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38" />Niho vahinya va miku yakwe Musa na Mafarisayo vakuwe vekamba Yesu, “Mhinya, tudumu kuakho vimako kuli heari.” <verse eid="MAT 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39" />Nau ekavaba, “Ikolwa ikusa lisidaraishwa mudumu lhaa, mira temkaowe lhaa mira hubi hu lhaa yakwe Yona mroto wa Kiumbi. <verse eid="MAT 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40" />Sa hucho Yona ezokhoe maaze makai chakhakho na naama za he maso ya samaki, nirewato nahe Muinyi wa Muhe enezokho za he mpulhe maaze makai chakhakho na naama. <verse eid="MAT 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41" />Vahe va Ninawi veneuma hawe na vahe vaya ikolwa muaze wazamaro, navo venelizamaria ka ikolwa ite lilo makusa. Kwaite Vaninawi veekirie nakuyaro makusa kini vareamko Yona mroto wa Kiumbi ekubirikira, naho kave ii helo mgiru kutakho Yona. <verse eid="MAT 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42" />He muaze wa kuzamariwa, dilao wa kilage kuli idi la Sheba eneuma nau enemuzamaria ite mulo makusa. Kwaite u eelie mkhito wa idi, kalo kulakhona viome vilo viugho vyakwe Solomoni, naho kave ii helo mgiru kutaho Solomoni.<verse eid="MAT 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukirii kwa ipepo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:24-26">Luka 11:24-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43" />“Ipepo likumli muhe, litakhwa litakho hodi hesilo mai likudaa hodi hakufufu likusehaakho, <verse eid="MAT 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44" />ata litakuyoia ite, ‘Ninekirii ang'a hagho ho niliye’. Niho iji likukirii na kuihelha heaha lheme, helhalhamiwe na kukewe kikulho, <verse eid="MAT 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45" />litaso kuzadori mapepo hali saba, makusa kutakho lo, na makhabuna yetalita kumbuu ka muhe. Naho ka muhe enekhwa mkusa kutakho ata azeto. Nicho chinekhwa heya ikolwa la vahe vakusa.”<verse eid="MAT 12:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alhii Yesu na vabakhu vakwe Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mariko 3:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luka 8:19-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46" />Yesu areakhwa echeri yo na ifyo la vahe, ka madamo alhii kuu na vabakhu kuu vekahe na kuuma gahana, vekudumu kuyo nau. <verse eid="MAT 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47" />Niho, muhe muwe ekamba Yesu, “Lage kechi na vabakhu kechi veaha gana, vedumu kuyo naari.” <verse eid="MAT 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48" />Mira Yesu ekamba ka muhe, “Lage gho niji? Na vabakhu gho ni vaji?” <verse eid="MAT 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49" />Ekaaija mharegha kuu kuvawesia vahina kuu, ekaba, “Ya nivo lage gho na vabakhu gho. <verse eid="MAT 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50" />Kwaite kira muhe eboi cho edumu Aba gho eaha are ana, ka niu mbakhu gho wa kiagiru na mbakhu gho wa kilage ne lage gho.”<verse eid="MAT 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13" />
  <para style="s">Mtotiano wa mhe esoe kurabibi mbeyu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mariko 4:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luka 8:4-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1" />Heka muaze, Yesu ekahali hehu minda, ekaso ekazokhodi khakhera he iziwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2" />Vahe vakumure vekabunguru heu sari ekakutu he mashua, ekazokhodi, na vahe vakhabuna vekazokhodi khakhera he iziwa, <verse eid="MAT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3" />Niho Yesu ekavabaiya mburi kumure kwa mitotire ekuba, “Mzabibi mbeyu eesoe kurabibi mbeyu he mbuva kuu. <verse eid="MAT 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4" />Ka madamo ekubibi mbeyu, hali jikalhu khakhera he kwalhi, mahimeno yekalita yekajia. <verse eid="MAT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5" />Hali jikalhu he masaheru hesilo mpulhe mkumure. Jikamangali kwaite mpulhe nee mghere. <verse eid="MAT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6" />Kaaze kareali, mbeyu jikanyuluka na kuhala kwaite majindo kuu teyeesoe di. <verse eid="MAT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7" />Mbeyu hali jikalhu he mhuti ja milhae, naka mhuti jikalheeru na kujifinha ka mbeyu. <verse eid="MAT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8" />Hali jikalhu helo mpulhe mkulho, jikali, jikasa, hali jikasa mhuluzi igana na hali jikasa mikado sita na hali jikasa mikado mikai.” <verse eid="MAT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9" />Niho Yesu ekavaba, “Elo malama yeko nako.”<verse eid="MAT 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chiroe Yesu akhwa ehinya kwa mitotiano</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mariko 4:10-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luka 8:9-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10" />Niho vahina vekaso he Yesu, vekamlhasu, “Kwaakhoni uyo na vahe kwa mitotiano?” <verse eid="MAT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11" />Yesu ekavaba, “Kune mwaaboiwe muile hu vimatuwe he Udilao waare ana he Kiumbi, mira vahali teveoiwe ka umuruisho wa kuile.” <verse eid="MAT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12" />Kwaite muhe elo kigi eneowe na kususuwe, mira hu esilo kigi, sari hucho elo nacho enechilawe. <verse eid="MAT 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13" />Nicho chiro niyo navo kwa mitotiano, kwaite vewesia yo niboi mira teveyaakho, veko kayo niyo mira teveyaile. <verse eid="MAT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14" />Ya yeboike hakini kalo vifuru viome vyakwe Isaya mroto wa Kiumbi vibae ite,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:14">Kweri munelakhonha mira temkaile, naho</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:14">Munewesia mira temkaakho.<verse eid="MAT 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15" />Kwaite swaho kini ni ure,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">Naho kwa malama kini teveko, naho</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">Vaalhati maila kini.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">Mira kai sicho, veseeakho na maila kini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">Veseeko na malama kini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">Veseeile na swaho kini na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">Kuyo nakuro makusa kini, naani neseevautie.<verse eid="MAT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16" />“Mira iji lhamuiwani, kwaite maila kaghu yeakho na malama kaghu yeko. <verse eid="MAT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17" />Kweri nimubao, varoto va Kiumbi na vahe vakumure vakulho veedumue kuwesia yo muyaakho mira teveyaakhoe na kuko huyo muyako mira teveyakoie.<verse eid="MAT 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etavabaiya maana yahu mtotiano wa esoe kurabibi mbeyu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mariko 4:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luka 8:11-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18" />“ Iji, lakhonhani naho muko chitotie na mzabibi mbeyu. <verse eid="MAT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19" />Mhe eko ya mburi ya Udilao wa Kiumbi mira teile, ni sahu mbeyu jilhue he kwalhi nahu Mkusa etalita na kuchidori hucho chilhawe he swaho kuu . <verse eid="MAT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20" />Nahu mbeyu ilhue helo ighamba, nisa muhe ekoe mburi ya Udilao wa Kiumbi ekaudoria kwa kulhamuiwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21" />Mira kwaite telo majindo yeso di, etadarisha mburi ya Kiumbi kwa madamo maghere, manyamarisho yekumheya hile kharo kwa mburi ya Kiumbi, etamanga gawe ni swaho. <verse eid="MAT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22" />Nahu mbeyu ilhue he mhuti nahe milhae, itotijwa na mhe ekoe ka mburi ya Kiumbi mira bughu jaya mifufure he idi na uzuri vitahinka ka mburi, nau etakwasiwe kuboi huyo Kiumbi edumu. <verse eid="MAT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23" />Nahu mbeyu ilhue he mpulhe mkulho itotijwa na mhe ekoe ka mburi ya Kiumbi na kuile nau enesa matunda, muwe igana, mhali mikado sita na mhali mikado mikai.”<verse eid="MAT 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mtotiano wa mahako</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24" />Yesu ekavao mtotiano mhali ekuba, “Udilao wa are ana he Kiumbi utotie na mhe ebibie mbeyu kulho he mbuva kuu. <verse eid="MAT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25" />Mira kiama kiwe vahe veeie, mnkuru kuu ekalita, ekabibi mahako za he ngano naho ekahaka. <verse eid="MAT 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26" />Kwato, mbeyu jireali na kulholhoshi kuasi na mahako yekalholhoshi kuakhoika.” <verse eid="MAT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27" />Vanyamalo vahu mzalo mbuva vekamliaha niho vekamlhasu, “Mgiru, tetweelhaye mbeyu kulho heya mbuva kechi? Iji mahako yelinale?” <verse eid="MAT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28" />Ekavaba, mnkuru niu eboie to. Niho vanyamalo kuu vekamlhasu, “Ho, udumu tuso tureyang'ofula?” <verse eid="MAT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29" />Nau ekavaba, “Hai, musing'ofule, kwaite to mkuyagu mahako mumuru mung'ofule hawe na ngano. <verse eid="MAT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30" />Roni bi ngano na mahako vilheru hawe sari he madamo ya ulojo. Ka madamo ninevabaiya vazaloja vayagu mahako vayake khakhera ini, vayaoro he mafumbe kalo yalhahawe. Mira ngano ibunguruni mureike hakukeya ngano.”<verse eid="MAT 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mtotiano wa mbeyu isewa haradali</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mariko 4:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18">Luka 13:18</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 13:19">19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31" />Yesu ekavabaiya vahe mtotiano mhali ekuba, “Udilao waare ana he Kiumbi utotie sa mbeyu isewa haradali yeedoriwe ni muhe muwe, ekarailha he mbuva kuu. <verse eid="MAT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32" />Neri ite ni gitutu kutakho mbeyu khabuna, mira yaraali itakhwa mkhatu mgiru kutakho mikhatu mikhabuna ya hembuva. Ilheru kukhwa mkhatu, na mahimeno yaare ana yetalita na kukwa mashasha kini he matambi kuu.”<verse eid="MAT 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mtotiano wa hamira</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 13:20-21">Luka 13:20-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33" />Yesu ekavabaiya mtotiano mhali, “Udilao waare ana he Kiumbi utoiane na hamira idoriwe ni mlage muwe, ekavikwarianya za he madebe makai ya mdufu mkhabuna ukayakhi.”<verse eid="MAT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chiroe Yesu ayo kwa mitotiano</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:33-34">Mariko 4:33-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34" />Yesu eyoe navo mburi khabuna kwa mitotiano. Teyoe neri kigi esigue mtotiano. <verse eid="MAT 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35" />Kalo mburi iyoiwe ni mroto wa Kiumbi ilijanye iba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:35">“Nineyo navo kwa mitotiano,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:35">Ninehinya mburi jo vesijiilie kuli azeto cho idi lireaboiwe.”<verse eid="MAT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etavabaiya vahe mburi ya mtotiano wa mahako</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36" />Niho Yesu ekavasange vahe, ekabuu minda. Vahina kuu vekamliaha, vekamba, “Tubaiye maana yahu mtotiano wa mahako yeeaha hembuva.” <verse eid="MAT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37" />Yesu ekavaba, “Elhae hu mbeyu kulho ni Muinyi wa Mhe. <verse eid="MAT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38" />Hu mbuva ni idi, nahu mbeyu kulho ni vahe va Udilao. Mira hu mahako nihu vahe vahu mnkuru. <verse eid="MAT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39" />Hu mkusa elhae mahako ni Shetani. Ulojo ni mkhito wa idi na vezaloja ni vazasughawe vaare ana he Kiumbi. <verse eid="MAT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40" />Sahucho mahako yebunguruwe hawe na kulhahawe, nicho chinekhwa he muaze wa mkhito” <verse eid="MAT 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41" />Muinyi wa Muhe enevasugha vazasughawa vaare ana he Kiumbi vavagera kuli he udilao kuu hu ugera vahe vakhabuna velahati vahe na vakhabuna veboi makusa, <verse eid="MAT 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42" />naho vazasughawa venevabibi he itanuri igiru la mwalha lisiga maaze makhabuna, naho are venezo na kung'e maiki. <verse eid="MAT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43" />Naho hu vahe veboie yo edumu Kiumbi veneaku sa kaaze he Udilao wakwe Aba kini. Elo malama yeko nako.<verse eid="MAT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mtotiano wa uzuri umatuiwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44" />“Udilao waare ana he Kiumbi utotiane na uzuri umatuiwe he mbuva. Mhe muwe ekauakho, ekaumatu kahali. Ekalhamuishishwa niho ekaso kuradi vigi kuu vikhabuna eelo navyo ekaraiwe hu mbuva.”<verse eid="MAT 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mtotiano wa kigi cha mihaku mikumure chisewe lulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45" />“Naho Udilao waare ana he Kiumbi utotiane na mzuri muwe edaa lulu kulho. <verse eid="MAT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46" />Areaakho lulu we ilo uzuri mgiru, ekaso ekaradi vigi vikhabuna vyo eelo naho ekaiwe hu lulu.”<verse eid="MAT 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mtotiano wa lwavu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47" />“Kahali, Udilao waare ana he Kiumbi utoyane na lwavu lubibiwe he bahari, ukadara samaki ja kira mbari. <verse eid="MAT 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48" />Lwavu lurehu, vahe vekauhuru kakera hesilo mai, vekazokhodi vekadori samaki kulho vekajibutu za heviteju kini, nahu kusa vekajibibi.” <verse eid="MAT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49" />Nicho chineraakhwa he maaze ya mkhito. Vazasughawa va Kiumbi, venelita, venevakakaanya vahe vakusa na vakulho. <verse eid="MAT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50" />Navo venevabibi ka vazaboi makusa he itanuru lilo mwalha usiga maaze makhabuna, are venezo na kung'e maiki.<verse eid="MAT 13:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uzuri mkuale nawa azeto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51" />Niho Yesu ekavalhasu, “Ho, mwaaile ya mburi khabuna?” Vekamba, “Eee.” <verse eid="MAT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52" />Nau ekavaba, “Kwato iji kira mhinya wa miku ehinyijwe mahinyo ya Udilao waare ana he Kiumbi nisa mzalo minda egue vigi kuu vikulho vikuale navya azeto.”<verse eid="MAT 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vahe va Nazareti vetamlhi Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mariko 6:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luka 4:16-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53" />Yesu areafiriti kuyo ka mitotiano ekahaka ata hodi, <verse eid="MAT 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54" />ekaso ang'a hakini. Are ekakhwa evahinya vahe he minda jo vesahea Vayahudi sari vekamaka, vekaba, “Ya egunale ya viugho na ugiru wa kuboi vimako? <verse eid="MAT 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55" />Ho, ya sihu muinyi wakwe mzape? Ho, alhii kuu tesewa Maria, na vabakhu kuu siya Yakobo ne Josefu ne Simoni ne Yuda? <verse eid="MAT 13:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56" />Naho vaing'inhii kuu vakhabuna veaha ii hawe na nne. Iji, egunale ya makhabuna?” <verse eid="MAT 13:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57" />Niho iji vekalhi kumdarisha. Mira Yesu ekavaba, “Mroto vemko hodi hakhabuna mira tekowe he muang'a kuu nahe vahe va ang'a kini.” <verse eid="MAT 13:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58" />Kwato iji, tereboi vimako vikumure kwa mburi kini ya kusaadarisha.<verse eid="MAT 13:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14" />
  <para style="s">Kigame chakwe Yohana Mzabatija</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mariko 6:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luka 9:7-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1" />Heka madamo, Herode mgiru wa idi la Galilaya ekako mburi jakwe Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2" />Iji ekavabaya vanyamalo kuu, “Ya muhe ni Yohana Mzabatija, aaka kuli hekigame, niu chiro umuruisho wa kuboi vimako jiaha za kuu.” <verse eid="MAT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3" />Kwaite Herode esughae vaaku kuu ite Yohana adarawe na kubutuwe he igereza, kwa mburi yakwe Herodia, mlage wakwe Filipo mbakhu kuu. <verse eid="MAT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4" />Kwaite Yohana eekumbaya Herode ite, “Techiye he Kiumbi ari kumdori mlage wa mbakhu kechi esinaga.” <verse eid="MAT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5" />Herode eedumue kumgaa Yohana, mira ekavabughenu vahe kwaite veemilie ite Yohana ni mroto wa Kiumbi. <verse eid="MAT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6" />He muaze wa elha ya kuhulha kuakhoika kwakwe Herode, mualeta wakwe Herodia ekara kikulho he vagalho. Herode ekalhamuishwa, <verse eid="MAT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7" />niho ekake muo ekamba “Nilapa ite ninekuo kira kigi cho unelhawa.” <verse eid="MAT 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8" />Ka mualeta ilai eotirijwe ni alhii kuu, ekamba Herode ite, “Nio mua wakwe Yohana Mzabatija waijiji he isinia.” <verse eid="MAT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9" />Mgiru Herode ekabuuwe ni vuhuye, mira kwa mburi yahu muo kuu naho kwa mburi ya vagalho veaha he elha, ekaba aowe. <verse eid="MAT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10" />Kwato Herode ekasugha muhe he minda ya kulhatia vahe arempaa Yohana mua. <verse eid="MAT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11" />Mua kuu ukagerawe he kihanka, vekamuo hu mualeta, nau ekamtiiya alhii kuu. <verse eid="MAT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12" />Vahina vakwe Yohana mzabatija vekalita, vekaudori msa kuu, vekauke he mbira. Naho vekaso kuzambaiya Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etavao viaghu vahe erufu koi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mariko 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yohana 6:1-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13" />Yesu areako mburi ya kigame chakwe Yohana, ekahaka na mashua, ekaso hodi hesilo vahe ekazokho salaghe. Mira vahe vekako ka mburi, vekamliaha kwa masame kuli he miang'a kini. <verse eid="MAT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14" />Yesu areahe kakera he idi lisilo mai ekali he mashua, ekaakho vahe vakumure, ekavakoiya mbalamija, ekavauti varukao kini. <verse eid="MAT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15" />Hareakhwa chamagheri, vahina kuu vekamliaha vekamba, “Hodi ii ni roro bi, na kela ja chakako jaataho. Iji, uvasange vahe vaso he miang'a vazewe viaghu.” <verse eid="MAT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16" />Yesu ekavaba, “Techimuruika ya vahe vaso bi vesiae, kune vaoni viaghu.” <verse eid="MAT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17" />Mira vo vekamba, “Tulo mikate mikoi bi na samaki nu.” <verse eid="MAT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18" />Yesu ekavaba, “Vigerani ii.” <verse eid="MAT 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19" />Ekavaba vahe vazokhodi he mahako. Niho Yesu ekadori hu mikate mikoi nahu samaki nu, ekawesia ana, ekamuaresi Kiumbi. Naho ekaibendula hu mikate, ekavao vahina kuu, navo vekavao vahe. <verse eid="MAT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20" />Vahe vakhabuna vekaa, vekakhu. Naho vahina vekabunguru vimerisie, vekahuti viteju ikado na vinu. <verse eid="MAT 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21" />Vakhabuna veae veekurahe vaagiru arufu koi ukaa valage na vainyi.<verse eid="MAT 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etadaha ana he mai</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mariko 6:45-52</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yohana 6:15-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22" />Niho Yesu ekavaba vahina kuu vakutu he mashua, vamkaeye kuso chauju ya iziwa to eracheri vasange vahe. <verse eid="MAT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23" />Areafiriti kuvasange vahe, ekakutu he lubwa salaghe kuaresi. Yesu eereaha salaghe bi sari chamagheri. <verse eid="MAT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24" />Hehu madamo mashua yeesoe uda kuli idi lisilo mai, mira ikaheiwa ni nkunkunho giru ya mai ikaihinkahinka. <verse eid="MAT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25" />Kiamaama, Yesu ekavaliaha vahina ekudaha ana he mai. <verse eid="MAT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26" />Vahina kuu vareamuakho ekudaha ana he mai vekabughenusha, vekaba, “Ni mbamuza,” vekama lukalasu kwa bughu. <verse eid="MAT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27" />Niho Yesu ekayo navo, “Taani, niani, musibughenu.” <verse eid="MAT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28" />Petro ekamba, “Dilao, kai niari kweri, niba nidaha ana he mai nikuliahe.” <verse eid="MAT 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29" />Yesu ekamba, “Haya, lita.” Niho, Petro ekadimi kuli hehu mashua, ekadaha ana he mai, ekamliaha Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30" />Mira areaakho kunkunho ya mai, ekabughenu, ekalholhoshi kufili he mai, ekazo kwa kuse, “Dilao, nilhaari nisifili.” <verse eid="MAT 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31" />Niho iji Yesu ekakuuru mharegha kuu, ekamdara ekamba, “Ari udarisha hagitutu, nikiakhoni ukabughenu?” <verse eid="MAT 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32" />Niho vekakutu he mashua, na kunkunho ikataa. <verse eid="MAT 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33" />Vakhabuna veaha za he mashua vekammaiya mamuro na kumdudukuiya, vekuba, “Kweri ari u Muinyi wa Kiumbi.”<verse eid="MAT 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etavauti varukhao are Genesareti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:53-56">Mariko 6:53-56</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34" />Vekatakho he iziwa vekahe he idi la Genesareti. <verse eid="MAT 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35" />Vahe vahu muang'a vareamuile ite niu, vekabaiyana miang'a mikhabuna iaha sina. Niho vekamgeria Yesu varukao vakhabuna. <verse eid="MAT 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36" />Vekamgogo ite avaro vadoe bi he gomae kuu. Naho vakhabuna veemdoie vekautiwe.<verse eid="MAT 14:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15" />
  <para style="s">Mahinyo yelie he vakaka va azeto</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 7:1-13">Mariko 7:1-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1" />Niho Mafarisayo na vahinya va miku yakwe musa vekalita kuli Yerusalemu, vekamliaha Yesu vekumlhasu ite, <verse eid="MAT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2" />“Kwaakhoni vahina kechi teveliaha mahinyo yelie he vakaka kanu va azeto? Teveonhi miheregha sakigi chidumuwe vesinaa viaghu?” <verse eid="MAT 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3" />Yesu ekavaba ite, “Ni kwaakhoni kune temuwesia miku ya Kiumbi mira muwesiisha mahinyo kaghu salaghe?” <verse eid="MAT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4" />Kwaite Kiumbi ebae, “Umko aba kechi ne lage kechi. Naho em'olhu aba kuu hile lage kuu, chidumuwe agaawe.” <verse eid="MAT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5" />Mira kune muhinya ite mhe ekukhwa elo kigi cho eseemurue kumlhaari aba kini hile lage kini, mira ekaba, “Ya kigi chaaguwe he Kiumbi.” <verse eid="MAT 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6" />Kwato, tedumuwe kahali kumko aba kuu, kwakuboi to ka nicho mufwa mburi ya Kiumbi kwa kuliaha mahinyo kaghu salaghe. <verse eid="MAT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7" />Kune vahe vakusa mkuakho vakulho, Isaya mroto wa Kiumbi nee mkweri to area murotia ite,<verse eid="MAT 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8" />Kiumbi eba, “Ya vahe veniko kwa viome bi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 15:8">Mira he swaho kini veata uda naani.<verse eid="MAT 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9" />Kuniaresi kini tekuye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 15:9">Kwaite mahinyo kini yeli he vahe.”<verse eid="MAT 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mburi jimboi muhe asidumuijwe kumuaresi Kiumbi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 7:14-23">Mariko 7:14-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10" />Yesu ekase hu ifyo la vahe veeaha ata, ekavaba ite, “Lakhonhani kikulho, naho muile. <verse eid="MAT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11" />Kigi chimboi muhe asidumuijwe kumuaresi Kiumbi sihu chibuu he muo, mira nihu chili he muo. Ka nicho chimro muhe asidumuijwe Kumuaresi Kiumbi.” <verse eid="MAT 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12" />Niho vahina kuu vekamliaha, vekamlhasu, “Ho, ureile ite Mafarisayo veesanuiwe kweri vareako viome kechi vyo weekuyo?” <verse eid="MAT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13" />Mira Yesu ekavaba ite, “Kira mkhatu usilhawe ni Aba gho eaha ana, eneukaa <verse eid="MAT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14" />Zokhoni uda naka Mafarisayo kwaite maila kini teyeakho, naho vevakaeti vahe velo maila yesiakho, kai muhe elo maila esiakho naho ekaeti muaro elo maila esiakho, vakhabuna vanu venefili he ikugha.” <verse eid="MAT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15" />Petro ekaba, “Tubaiye kikulho ya mtotiano.” <verse eid="MAT 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16" />Yesu ekavalhasu ite, “Neri kune temuilie? <verse eid="MAT 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17" />Ho, temuilie ite kira chibuu he muo chiso he maso naho chiguwe gahana sa kisalo naho chitabuu hechoo? <verse eid="MAT 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18" />Mira hu chimli muhe he muo kuu, chilie he swaho kuu, naka nicho chimboi muhe asidumuijwe kumuaresi Kiumbi. <verse eid="MAT 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19" />Kwaite he swaho heli mitotire mikusa igera kugaa na udana na ugwalo na kumyoia mhe lame. <verse eid="MAT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20" />Ya nijo mburi jimboi muhe asidumuijwe kumuaresi Kiumbi. Mira kua viaghu usionhiye miharegha tekumboi mhe asidumuijwe kumuaresi Kiumbi.”<verse eid="MAT 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kudarisha kwa mlage wa Kaanani</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Mariko 7:24-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21" />Yesu ekahaka ata hodi ekaso ekarazokho sina na miang'a isewa Tiro na Sidoni. <verse eid="MAT 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22" />Niho ekasahe na mlage muwe kuli Kaanani ekalita ekamseisha, “Dilao, Muinyi wakwe Daudi, niakhoiya mbalamija, mualeta gho enyamarishwa ni mapepo.” <verse eid="MAT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23" />Mira Yesu temandue kigi. Kwato vahina kuu vekamliaha, vekamba, “Mbae aso kwaite etatuliaha ilai etumaya gimbe.” <verse eid="MAT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24" />Yesu ekavaba vahina kuu, “Kiumbi etenisugha nivalhaari bi he vahe va Iziraeli. Vetoe sa maalu yelahae kwalhi.” <verse eid="MAT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25" />Niho hu mlage ekalita, ekama mamuro, ekamba Yesu, “Dilao, nikugogo unilhaari.” <verse eid="MAT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26" />Yesu ekayo kwa mtotiano ekamba, “Techiye kudori viaghu vya vamilo na kuyabibiya madie.” <verse eid="MAT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27" />Ka mlage ekamba,“Ni kweri, Dilao, mira madie nau yea viaghu vilhuye di kuli he meza ja madilao kini.” <verse eid="MAT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28" />Niho iji Yesu ekamba, “Mlage, kudarisha kechi ni kugiru, naho chinekhwa sa kigi udumu.” Hu mualeta kuu ekau kela wakaaka.<verse eid="MAT 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etauti vahe vakumure</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29" />Yesu ekali ata ekaso khakhera ya iziwa liaha Galilaya, ekakutu he lubwa, ekazokhodi. <verse eid="MAT 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30" />Vahe vakumure vekamliaha vekavagera vilemuna na velo maila esiakho na vesimuru kudaha na vesimuru kuyo na vahali vakumure vee varukhao, vekavake sina na masame kuu, Yesu nau ekavauti. <verse eid="MAT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31" />Hu vahe vakumure vekamakisha vareakho vesimuru kuyo vekuyo na vilemna na vaautiwe na vesimuru kudaha vekudaha na velo maila yesiakho veakho vekalholhoshi kumuaresi Kiumbi u ekuaresiwe ni Vaizraeli.<verse eid="MAT 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etavao viaghu vahe erufu hai</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">Mariko 8:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32" />Niho iji, Yesu ekavase vahina kuu, ekaba ite, “Nivaakhoia mbalamija ya vahe kwaite vaazokho na ani kwa maaze makai, neri teveae viaghu. Sidumu kuvaro vagale neri vesiae, vaseezalhu mshare are kwalhi.” <verse eid="MAT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33" />Vahina kuu vekamba, “Ilai ho tuaha ni roro bi, tuneakhole viaghu vyakuvao vahe vakumure to?” <verse eid="MAT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34" />Yesu ekavalhasu, “Mulo mikate mime?” Vekamba, “Tulo mikate saba na vusamaki vughere.” <verse eid="MAT 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35" />Kwato, Yesu ekavaba vahe vazokhodi. <verse eid="MAT 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36" />Ekadori hu mikate saba nahu vusamaki, ekamuaresi Kiumbi, ekavikakaanya, ekavao vahina, vahina navo vekavakakaaya vahe. <verse eid="MAT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37" />Vakhabuna vekaa vekakhu, niho vahina vekahuti viteju saba vyahu viaghu vyeemerisie. <verse eid="MAT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38" />Ka vahe veeaye nee vaagiru elufu hai, ukukaa valage na vainyi. <verse eid="MAT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39" />Niho Yesu ekavasange ka vahe, ekakutu mashua, ekaso he idi la Magadani.<verse eid="MAT 15:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16" />
  <para style="s">Vahe vedumu lhaa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:11-13">Mariko 8:11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">Luka 12:54-56</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1" />Mafarisayo na Masadukayo vekamliaha Yesu vekamgali kalo vamdarati vekamba avaaije lhaa kuli ana he Kiumbi. <verse eid="MAT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2" />Mira Yesu ekavaba, “Ikunehe chamagheri, kune mutaba ite, ‘Lhenu henelhe kikulho kwaite are ana he Kiumbi yaabayu,’ <verse eid="MAT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3" />Nakune he kela ja chalhenu muba, ‘Wai henesi mare, kwaite are ana ilhareno libayu naho are ana malhareno yehue.’ Mureiliisha kurota yenelijanya kwa kuwesia bi are ana he Kiumbi, mira kuwesia lhaa ja madamo temumuru. <verse eid="MAT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4" />Ikolwa ikusa lisidarisha, lidumu lhaa, mira telikaowe lhaa hali kutakho hu yakwe Yona bi.” Kwato, ekavaro, ekaso.<verse eid="MAT 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hamira ya Mafarisayo na Masadukayo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:14-21">Mariko 8:14-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5" />Vahina kuu vareahe bwa wa kanu wa iziwa, vekakhwa vaazi kudori mikate. <verse eid="MAT 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6" />Yesu ekavaba, “Muwesiishe naho mukhwa maila na hamira la Mafarisayo na Masadukayo.” <verse eid="MAT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7" />Mira iji vekakhwa veyo salaghini vekuba “Eyo to kwaite tetudorie mikate.” <verse eid="MAT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8" />Yesu eeilie cho vetoti, ekavaba, “Kune vahe mudarisha hagitutu! Niakhoni muyo mburi ja kusaakhwa na mikate? <verse eid="MAT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9" />Kwato temunaile? Ho, temuhulha nireaikhakhaanya hu mikate mikoi kwa mburi yahu vahe erufu koi? Ho, mweebungurue viteju vime vya mikate imerisie? <verse eid="MAT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10" />Hile hu mikate saba vekakaiwe hu vahe erufu hai, ho, mweebungurue viteju vime vya mikate vimerisie? <verse eid="MAT 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11" />Chikhwae kimomo temuile ite seekuyo mburi ja mikate? Mukhwa maila na hamira ya Mafarisayo na Masadukayo.” <verse eid="MAT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12" />Niho vahina vekaile ite teekuyoia mburi ya hamira la mikate, mira eekuyoia mahinyo ya Mafarisayo na Masadukayo.<verse eid="MAT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petro etayo lheme ite Yesu niu Kiristo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Mariko 8:27-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luka 9:18-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13" />Yesu areahe he idi la Kaisaria Filipi, ekavalhasu vahina kuu, “Vahe veba Muinyi wa muhe niji?” <verse eid="MAT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14" />Vekamba, “Vahali veba ite ni Yohana Mzabatija, vahali veba ni Eliya, vahali veba ni Yeremia hile muwe wa varoto va Kiumbi. <verse eid="MAT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15" />Yesu ekavalhasu, ho, na kune muba ani niji?” <verse eid="MAT 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16" />Simoni Petro ekamba, “Niari Kiristo, Muinyi wa Kiumbi ezokho.” <verse eid="MAT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17" />Yesu ekaba, “Lhamuiwa ari Simoni Muinyi wakwe Yona, Kwaite tehelo muhe neri ekughubulie ya mburi mira ni Aba gho eaha are ana. <verse eid="MAT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18" />Naani nakuba, ari ni Petro, naho ana heya ighamba ninelikwa ikanisa gho, naho u ja kidughu tejikamuru kulilhuku. <verse eid="MAT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19" />Ninekuo funguo ja Udilao waare ana he Kiumbi hucho unechilhatiya he idi, chinelhatiiwa are ana he Kiumbi, naho cho unelhaiya he idi, chinelhaiwa are ana he Kiumbi.” <verse eid="MAT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20" />Naho Yesu ekavalhiija vahina kuu vasimbaiye muhe neri ite niu Kiristo.<verse eid="MAT 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu erota mburi ja kharo na kigame kuu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:31-9:1">Mariko 8:31-9:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luka 9:22-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21" />Kuli ka madamo Yesu eekuravabaiya vahina kuu ite chidumuwa aso Yerusalemu, naho are eneowe kharo kumure ni velo ugiru na vagiru va muaresi na vahinya va miku yakwe Musa naho chinemdumu agaawe mira muaze wa kakai enekaawe kuli he kigame. <verse eid="MAT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22" />Niho Petro ekamse Yesu khakhera, ekalholhoshi kumjoghoya ite, “Dilao usiyo to, ya mburi teimuru kuliijanya” <verse eid="MAT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23" />Mira Yesu ekamwesia Petro , ekamba , “Haka he maila gho, Shetani. Ari u lugo he ani. Swaho kechi teitoti mburi ja Kiumbi mira utoti sa vahe.” <verse eid="MAT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24" />Niho Yesu ekavaba vahina kuu, “Muhe ekudumu kuniliaha, chidumuwe aro mburi kuu khabuna kahali adori msaraba kuu naho aniliahe. <verse eid="MAT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25" />Kwaite muhe edumu kuuti uzime kuu salaghe, eneulahati, mira muhe elahati uzime kuu kwa mburi gho, eneyaakho. <verse eid="MAT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26" />Ho, muhe eneakho kitumulilo mina ekuowe udilao mkhabuna wa idi naho ekukhwa aalahati uzime kuu? Hile, muhe enegu kigi mina chiagha sa uzime kuu? <verse eid="MAT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27" />Kwaite Muinyi wa Muhe enelita he umuruisho wakwe Aba kuu hawe na vazasughawa kuu, naho ata niho enemlhanu kira muhe kuaghati na miboire kuu. <verse eid="MAT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28" />Namubayani kweri, helo vahe vahali wai ii tevekaga vesinamuakho Muinyi wa Muhe ekulita he udilao kuu.”<verse eid="MAT 16:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17" />
  <para style="s">Yesu etakirii vubasa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Mariko 9:2-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luka 9:28-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1" />Maaze sita yareatakho, Yesu ekavadori Petro ne Yakobo ne Yohana mjunawa wakwe Yakobo esewa, ekavatii sari ana he lubwa lugiru salaghini. <verse eid="MAT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2" />Are Yesu ekakirii vubasa hevo, vubasa kuu vukaaku sa kaaze na gomae kuu jikakhwa jiakhu sari kuhiri maila. <verse eid="MAT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3" />Wato oto vekalijanya Musa ne Eliya, vekakhwa veyo ne Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4" />Niho Petro ekamba Yesu, “Dilao, kai unedumu nne tuzokho ii, ninekwa vuminda vukai, Kawe kakechi, kawe kakwe Musa na kawe kakwe Eliya.” <verse eid="MAT 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5" />Petro arekhwa echeri yo, wato oto malhareno yeaku swe yekavaghubika, naho kiome chikakoika kuli heka malhareno chikuba, “Ya ni Muinyi gho nimdumue. Nilhamuishwa niu. Mlakhonhini.” <verse eid="MAT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6" />Vahina vareako to vekalhu kwa kubodiya maso kini ilai vebughenu. <verse eid="MAT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7" />Yesu ekavasusughuia sina, ekavadoa ekavaba, “Umani, musibughenu.” <verse eid="MAT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8" />Vareakaa maila ana vekamuakho Yesu eaha salaghe bi. <verse eid="MAT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9" />Niho vareakhwa vedimi kuli he lubwa, Yesu ekavaaji ekaba, “Museerambaiya neri muhe ya mburi jo muakhoe ii sari Muinyi wa Mhe ekuneka kuli he kigame.” <verse eid="MAT 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10" />Niho vahina kuu vekamlhasu ite, “Kwaakhoni vahinya va miku yakwe Musa veba chidumuwa Eliya arongelita ini?” <verse eid="MAT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11" />Yesu ekavaba, “Ni kweri, Eliya enelita kuke mburi khabuna kikulho. <verse eid="MAT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12" />Mira nimubao, Eliya aalita pere navo teveemuilie, mira vekamboiya kikusa hucho vedumue. Wato oto venemboiia kikusa Muinyi wa Muhe.” <verse eid="MAT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13" />Niho vahina vekaila ite eekuyo navo kwa mburi yakwe Yohana mzabatija.<verse eid="MAT 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etamuuti mburatu elo ipepo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Mariko 9:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luka 9:37-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14" />Vareakirii hehu ifyo la vahe, muhe muwe ekamliaha Yesu, ekammaya mamuro, <verse eid="MAT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15" />ekaba, “Dilao, mkoie mbalamija muinyi gho kwaite elhu kifafa naho enyamarikisha, kagi kakumure elhuu he mwalha nahe mai madamo makumure. <verse eid="MAT 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16" />Neemgerie he vahina kechi mira tevemurue kumuuti.” <verse eid="MAT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17" />Yesu ekavaba, “Kune ikolwa lisidarisha naho lilahae, ninezokho nakune sari ami? Ninemugumirija kune sari ami? Mgerani ii ka muinyi.” <verse eid="MAT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18" />Niho Yesu ekaliba ka ipepo lili nalo likamli ka mburatu, madamo wakaaka hu muinyi ekau. <verse eid="MAT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19" />Niho vahina vekamliaha Yesu vekukhwa salaghe, vekamlhasu, “Ni kwaakhoni nne tetumurue kuligu hu ipepo?” <verse eid="MAT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20" />Yesu ekavaba, “Kwa mburi ya kudarisha kaghu kugitutu. Nimubaiya kweri, kai kudarisha kaghu ni kugitutu bi sa mbeyu isewa haradali, munemuru kuluba lubwa, ‘Haka ii uso to,’ Nalwo luneso. Tehelo neri linekwasi hakaghu. <verse eid="MAT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21" />Ipepo saya telimuru kuli sari kwa kuaresi na kulhati kua kigi.”<verse eid="MAT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etayo kahali mburi ya kigame kuu na kuka kuli he kigame</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mariko 9:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luka 9:43-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22" />Vahina kuu vareakhwa veaha hawe are Galilaya, Yesu ekavaba, Muinyi wa Muhe enelhiwe na kuotiwe he vahe. <verse eid="MAT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23" />Navo venemgaa, mira muaze wa ka kakai eneka kuli he kigame. Vahina kuu vekadarawe vuhuyesha.<verse eid="MAT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulhanu kodi he Minda ya Kiumbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24" />Yesu na vahina kuu vareahe Kapernaumu vahe vedoria kodi ya minda ya Kiumbi vekamliaha Petro na kumlhasu, “Ho mhinya kaghu eralhanu kodi ya Minda ya Kiumbi?” <verse eid="MAT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25" />Petro ekavaba, “Ee eralhanu.” Petro areabuu za he minda, Yesu ekakhwa wa bosi kuliyoiya, ekamlhasu, “Simoni ari uakho kimomo? Vadilao va idi vedoria ushuru hile kodi kuli he heji? Kuli he vahe kini hile kuli he vagalho?” <verse eid="MAT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26" />Petro ekamba, kuli he vagalho vebuu he idi. Yesu ekamba, kwato vahe kini tevedumuwa kulhanu kodi. <verse eid="MAT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27" />Mira kalo tusivasanuije, so he iziwa uzebibi ndoana. Idori samaki ya bosi uneivula. Lha muo kuu naari uneakho mihaku, dori urelhanu kodi gho hawe na kechi.<verse eid="MAT 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18" />
  <para style="s">Niji mgiru?</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mariko 9:33-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luka 9:46-48</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1" />Ka madamo, vahina vekalita hodi Yesu eaha na kumlhaasu, “Ho niji emgiru kutakho vakhabuna he Udilao wa Kiumbi?” <verse eid="MAT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2" />Yesu ekamse muinyi muwe mgitutu ekamuumati hasi na hasi kini, <verse eid="MAT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3" />nau ekavaba, “Kweri nimubaya, mkusaakhwa saya muinyi mgitutu, temukabuu he Udilao wa Kiumbi.” <verse eid="MAT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4" />Kira muhe ekukudimiri saya muinyi, niu emgiru kutakho vakhabuna he Udilao wa Kiumbi. <verse eid="MAT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5" />Kira mhe ekudimiri saya muinyi kwa ilhe gho, enidoria ani.<verse eid="MAT 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulhiija vahe vasivata vahali kuboi makusa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:42-48">Mariko 9:42-48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luka 17:1-2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6" />“Mira muhe enemboi muwe waya vainyi venidarisha kuboi makusa, chidumuwe aorowe isaheru liyahi la kushaghia he waka kuu, naho abibiwe za he bahari.” <verse eid="MAT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7" />Kharo giru jinevalitia vahe vaidi vero vahe vedarishe vaboi makusa. Ya mburi jidumuwe kulijanya, mira nivuhuye vugiru hehu veboi jilijanye. <verse eid="MAT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8" />Kai muharegha kechi hile kusame kechi kukuboi uboi makusa, kute naho uubibi uda naari. Nikeba kubuu he uzime wa maaze makhabuna usilo muharegha hile kusame, kuro kusa na miharegha minu hile masame manu naho ukabibiwe he mwalha wa maaze makhabuna usiga. <verse eid="MAT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9" />Naho kai iila kechi likukuboi uboi makusa, ling'ofule naho urelibibi uda naari. Nikeba he ari kubuu he uzime tulo iila iwe mira usibibiwe he mwalha wa bamuza ulo maila kechi makhabuna manu.<verse eid="MAT 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mtotiano wa ialu lilahae</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 15:3-7">Luka 15:3-7</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10" />“Wesiishani musimfwa neri muwe waya vagitutu, kwaite nimubaya, velo vazasughawa kini veaha sina ne Aba gho eaha are ana.” <verse eid="MAT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11" />Kwaite Muinyi wa Muhe elitie kudaa hu chilahae. <verse eid="MAT 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12" />“Muakho kimomo? Chikukhwa muhe elo maalu igana iwe, na iwe likalakha, ho tekayaro hu mikado kenda na kenda he lubwa na kuso kuradaa ka iwe lilahae?” <verse eid="MAT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13" />Nau ekuliakho, kweri namubaya etalhamuiwa kwa mburi yaka ialu iwe kuro hu maalu mikado kenda na kenda yeesilahae. <verse eid="MAT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14" />Wato oto, Aba kaghu waare ana tedumu neri muwe heya vagitutu alaha.<verse eid="MAT 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbakhu kechi ekukuboia kikusa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15" />“Kai mbakhu kechi ekukuboia kikusa, so uremuaija ukusa kuu, wakune vanu bi. Kai ekukuko, unekhwa wamuakho kahali mbakhu kechi.” <verse eid="MAT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16" />Mira kai tekakuko, so na muhe mhali muwe hile vanu kalo kira kiome chikowe ni vahe vanu hile vakai. <verse eid="MAT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17" />Kai ekulhi kumulahonha, vabaie vahe vemdarishe Kiumbi. Nau ekulhi kuvalalhona ka vahe, muakhoni sa muhe esidarisha.<verse eid="MAT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulhiija na kudumuija</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18" />“Kweri nimubaiya, kira lo munelilhiija heidi linekhwa laalhiijwa naareana he Kiumbi nahu munekhwa mulidumuije he idi linekhwa laadumuijwa naare ana he Kiumbi.” <verse eid="MAT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19" />“Kahali namubaiya, chikukhwa vanu hekune veneyo kigi nakuiseko heidi kwa mburi yo venelhawa, veneboiiwa ni Aba gho eaha are ana. <verse eid="MAT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20" />Kwaite ho vebunguru hawe vahe vanu hile vakai kwa ilhe gho, ani niaha hawe navo.”<verse eid="MAT 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mtotiano wa muhe esikaaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21" />Niho Petro ekamliaha Yesu ekamlhasu, “Dilao mbakhu gho ekuniboiya kikusa kagi kame naani nimkaaye? Ho, neri kagi saba?” <verse eid="MAT 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22" />Yesu ekamba, “Umkaaye muaro neri ite ekukiriia kagi mikado saba.” <verse eid="MAT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23" />Kwaite Udilao waare ana he Kiumbi utoiane ne dilao muwe edumue kuwesia nyamalo kuu ite iso kimomo na vanyamalo kuu. <verse eid="MAT 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24" />Arealholhoshi kuwesia nyamalo kuu, ekageriiwa muhe muwe elo iwero la mafumba erufu ikado ya zahabu. <verse eid="MAT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25" />Kwaite ka muhe teelo neri cha kulhanu, dilao kuu ekaba adidiwe u salaghe sa mhaye na mlage kuu na vainyi kuu na vigi vikhabuna vyo elo navyo kalo iwero lilhanuwe. <verse eid="MAT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26" />Kwato, hu mnyamalo ekammaiya mamuro nakumgogo ekumba, nikulhawa ronga niro ninekulhanu iwero kechi ikhabuna. <verse eid="MAT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27" />Hu mgiru ekamwakhoiya mbalamija, ekamkaaya hu iwero naho ekamro agale. <verse eid="MAT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28" />Mira ka mnyamalo ekaiwe iwero areali gahana, ekasahe na mnyamalo muaro emuambale magongolo igana. Ekamdara, ekamfufa hewaka ekumba, nilhanu iwero gho. <verse eid="MAT 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29" />Ka mnyamalo muaro kuu ekama mamuro nakamgogo ekuba, “Nikugogo urongeniro ninekulhanu iwero kechi ikhabuna. <verse eid="MAT 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30" />Mira u ekalhi, ekarambutu he igereza sari ekunelhanu hu iwero. <verse eid="MAT 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31" />Vanyamalo vahali vareakho ka mburi vekasanuishwa, vekaso kurambaiya mgiru kini ka mburi khabuna jilijanye. <verse eid="MAT 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32" />Niho hu dilao ekamse ka mnyamalo ekamba, ‘Ari umnyamalo mkusasha. Weenigogoe nikakukaaya iwero kechi ikhabuna. <verse eid="MAT 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33" />Ho, techeekukudumu naari umkoe mbalamija mnyamalo muaro kechi sacho nikukoie mbalamija ari?’ <verse eid="MAT 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34" />Kwato, hu mgiru ekasanuishishwa, ekambutu heigereza kalo akharotijwe sari ekunelhanu iwero ikhabuna. <verse eid="MAT 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35" />Ya nicho Aba gho eaha are ana he Kiumbi enemboia kira muwe kaghu ikukhwa muwe kaghu tekamkaaie mbakhu kuu kwa swaho kuu khabuna.”<verse eid="MAT 18:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19" />
  <para style="s">Yesu etahinya mburi ya kuoana magondo ya kuroana</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:1-12">Mariko 10:1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1" />Yesu areafiriti kuyo ka kiome, ekahali Galilaya, ekaso Yudea, chauju ya mharaza usewe Yoridani. <verse eid="MAT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2" />Vahe vakumure vekamliaha are, nau ekavauti. <verse eid="MAT 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3" />Mafarisayo vakuwe vekamliaha kalo vamgali, vekamlhasu, “Ho, chiradumuijwa muhe kumro mlage kuu?” <verse eid="MAT 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4" />Yesu ekavaba, “Ho temusomie he Magondo ya Kiumbi ite kuli azeto Kiumbi evaboie muagiru na mlage, <verse eid="MAT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5" />naho ekaba, ‘Kwaka mburi muagiru enem'ro igii kuu ne alhii kuu enekhwa hawe na mlage kuu, naho ka vanu venekhwa msa muwe?’ <verse eid="MAT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6" />Kwato, vo si vanu kahali mira ni msa muwe. Kwato chikhwarijwe ni Kiumbi, muhe asirechikakaanya.” <verse eid="MAT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7" />Mira vo vekamlhasu, “Ni kwakhoni iji Musa eeajie ite muagiru amuo mlage kuu magondo ya kumro?” <verse eid="MAT 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8" />Yesu ekavaba, “Musa eemudumuije kuvaro valage kaghu kwa mburi ya uure wa swaho kaghu, mira techeekhwae to kuli azeto. <verse eid="MAT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9" />Kwato nimubaiya, kira enemro mlage kuu mira esi kwa mburi ya udana, ekadori mlage mhali, enekhwa aaboi ukusa.” <verse eid="MAT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10" />Vahina kuu vekamba, “Chikukhwa mburi ja muagiru na mlage kuu nito, ni keba kusaadori.” <verse eid="MAT 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11" />Yesu ekavaba, “Sivakhabuna venemuru kulidoria ya ihinyo, mira nihu bi veowe umuruisho ni Kiumbi. <verse eid="MAT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12" />Kwaite helo mburi hali jiro muhe asimuru kudori, vahali nikwaite veakhoike to, vahali kwaite veteboiwe to ni vahe, na vahali tevedumue kudori kwa mburi ja Udilao wa Kiumbi. Enemuru kudoria ya ihinyo alidorie.”<verse eid="MAT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etavabusuia mapae vainyi vagitutu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mariko 10:13-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luka 18:15-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13" />Vahe vekamgeria Yesu vainyi vagitutu kalo avakee miharegha naho avabusue mapae makulho. Mira vahina vekavajoghoiya. <verse eid="MAT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14" />Yesu ekaba, “Varoni vainyi vagitutu valita hagho neri musivatiti, kwaite Udilao wa Kiumbi niwa vahe vekhwae saya vainyi.” <verse eid="MAT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15" />Niho Yesu ekavakeiya miharegha ana he mia kini, naho ekahaka ata hodi.<verse eid="MAT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mburatu mzuri</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mariko 10:17-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luka 18:18-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16" />Mhe muwe ekamlitia Yesu ekamlhasu, “Mhinya mkulho, niboi mburi mina kulho kalo niudorie uzime wa maaze khabuna?” <verse eid="MAT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17" />Yesu ekamba, “Kwaakhoni unise mkulho? Mkulho ni Kiumbi bi. Mira ukudumu kubuu heuzime, dara miku ja Kiumbi.” <verse eid="MAT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18" />Hu muhe ekamlhasu, “Miku hama?” Yesu ekamba, “Usigae, usibodi na valage esivakechi, Usigwa, Usiyo lame, <verse eid="MAT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19" />uvako aba kechi ne lage kechi, naho mdumu msina kechi sahucho ukudumue salaghe.” <verse eid="MAT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20" />Ka mburatu ekaba, “Ka makhabuna niyadarie. Niboi kiakhoni kihali?” <verse eid="MAT 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21" />Yesu ekamba, “Kai udumu usibeni kigi, so uredidi vikhabuna ulonavyo, uvao vahuye, naari unekhwa na uzuri he Kiumbi niho uniliahe.” <verse eid="MAT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22" />Ka mburatu areako to, ekaso ilai elo vuhuye, kwaite eelo uzuri mgiru. <verse eid="MAT 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23" />Niho Yesu ekavawesia vahina kuu ekavaba, “Kweri nimubaiya chinekhwa kiure hemzuri kubuu he Udilao wa Kiumbi. <verse eid="MAT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24" />Kahali nimubaiya, chimangamuruika ngamia kutakho he idaho la singano kuro mzuri kubuu he Udilao wa Kiumbi.” <verse eid="MAT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25" />Vahina kuu vareako kayo Yesu eyoe vekamakisha, vekamlhasu, “Ho niji enemuru kuguwe hemakusa?” <verse eid="MAT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26" />Yesu ekavawesiisha ekavaba, “Ya mburi teimuruika he vahe, mira he Kiumbi mburi khabuna jimuruika.” <verse eid="MAT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27" />Niho Petro ekamba, “Wesia nne twaaro vigi vikhabuna nakukuliaha ari, tunedoria kiakhoni?” <verse eid="MAT 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28" />Yesu ekavaba, kweri nimubaiya ite kune muniliahe ani heidi ikuale, ekunelita Muinyi wa Muhe hekikire kuu cha ugiru kuu, na kune munezokhodi hevikire ikado na vinu, mkuyazamari mbari ikado na manu ya Iziraeli. <verse eid="MAT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29" />Naho kira eroe muang'a kuu hile vabakhu kuu vakiagiru hile vakilage hile igii hile alhii hile vainyi hile mbuva kwa mburi gho enedoria kagi igana kutakho naho enepala uzime wa maaze makhabuna. <verse eid="MAT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30" />Mira vahe vakumure vekuakho ite veye waijiji, venekhwa vahe vesiye hemadamo yelitie. Naho vesiye waijiji, veneye hemadamo yelitie.<verse eid="MAT 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20" />
  <para style="s">Vanyamalo he mbuva ya mizabibu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1" />Kwaite Udilao wa Kiumbi utoiane sa muhe elo mbuva ya mizabibu, ekae hachalhenuchalhenu kuvatii vanyamalo he mbuva kuu ya mizabibu. <verse eid="MAT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2" />Vekayo na kuiseko mzalo mbuva avalhanu ka vanyamalo kwa muaze muwe, niho ekavatii he mbuva kuu ya mizabibu. <verse eid="MAT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3" />Ekahali hemadamo ya kela kai chalhenu, ekavaakho vahe vahali veumae he kikhoja, tevelo nyamalo. <verse eid="MAT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4" />Ekavaba, “Soni na kune mureboi nyamalo he mbuva gho ya mizabibu, naani ninemuo hu chimutara.” <verse eid="MAT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5" />Niho ka mzalo mbuva ekaso kahali he madamo ya kela sita chakhakho nahe madamo ya kela kenda chamagheni, ekaboi wato oto. <verse eid="MAT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6" />Hareahe madamo ya kela ikado nawe chamagheri, ekaso kahali, ekavahelha vahali veumae to kihoja, ekavalhasu, “Kwaakhoni muumae ii chakhako kizime neri musiboi nyamalo?” <verse eid="MAT 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7" />Vekamba, “Kwaite tehelo muhe etuoe nyamalo.” Nau ekavaba, “Soni na kune mureboi nyamalo he mbuva gho ya mizabibu.” <verse eid="MAT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8" />Hareakhokwa, ka mzalombuva ekamba mzake mihaku kuu, “Vase vanyamalo uvalhanu mawero kini, ukulholhoshi nahu va mkhito kubuu he nyamalo, na kufiriti nahu vabosi kubuu he nyamalo.” <verse eid="MAT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9" />Niho varealita huva kela ikado nawe, kira muwe ekadoria mhaku kuu mkhabuna wa muaze. <verse eid="MAT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10" />Nahu va bosi kubuu he nyamalo, vekatoti ite veneowe kumure, navo vekaowe kira muwe ekadoria mhaku kuu mkhabuna wa muaze. <verse eid="MAT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11" />Vereadoria mhaku kini, vekalholhoshi kumkararija hu mzalo mbuva, <verse eid="MAT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12" />vekaba, “Ya vahe uvaoe nyamalo mkhito veboie nyamalo kela we bi, kwaakhoni iji utulhanue mhaku uaghae navo naho nne tunyamarike na nyamalo giru chakhakho na kaaze kekhaisha kwa muaze mzime?” <verse eid="MAT 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13" />Hu mzalo mbuva ekamba muwe kini, “Msaho sikutae. Ho, tetuisekoe naari nikulhanu mhaku wa muaze muwe?” <verse eid="MAT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14" />Dori mhaku kechi uso. Ntedumu kumlhanu wa mkhito sakigi nikuoe ari. <verse eid="MAT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15" />Ho, ani sidumuwe kuboi hucho nidumu namhaku gho? Hile utako wiju kwaite ani nimkulho? <verse eid="MAT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16" />Yesu ekafiriti ekuba, “Kwato vamkhito venekhwa va bosi naho vabosi venekhwa va mkhito.”<verse eid="MAT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etayo kagi kakakai mburi ya kigame kuu na kuka kuli he kigame.</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mariko 10:32-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luka 18:31-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17" />Niho Yesu nahu vahina kuu vareakhwa vekutu kuso Yerusalemu, ekavadori hu vahina ikado na vanu kakhera ekavaba, <verse eid="MAT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18" />“Lakhonhani, tutaso Yerusalemu, tukuhe are Muinyi wa Muhe eneotijwa he vagiru va kuaresija na vahinya va miku yakwe Musa, navo venemzamari agaawe. <verse eid="MAT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19" />Venemuotija he vahe vesi Vayahudi vo venemolhu, venemma ndate naho venemsurumija nakumma misumari he msaraba, mira muaze wa kakai eneka kuli he kigame.”<verse eid="MAT 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlage etamlhawa Yesu amboie kigi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:35-45">Mariko 10:35-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20" />Niho mlage wakwe Zebedayo hawe na vainyi kuu vanu vekamliaha Yesu, vekama mamuro he Yesu naho ekamlhawa kigi. <verse eid="MAT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21" />Yesu ekamlhasu, “Udumu kiakhoni?” Ka mlage ekamba, “Nikeiye m'o ite he udilao kechi ya vainyi gho vanu venezokhodi muwe mlha wa sughano na muwe mlha wa hina.” <verse eid="MAT 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22" />Yesu ekavaba, “Temuilie cho mulhawa. Ho, munemuru kuwahia kikonho cha kharo cho ninewahaya ani?” Vekamba, “Tunemuru.” <verse eid="MAT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23" />Yesu ekavaba, “Kweri munewahia kikonho gho cha kharo, mira kuzokhodi mlha wa sughano hile mlha wa hina gho ka si nyamalo gho kumuo, ata hodi veneowe ka vefiritie kukeiwa ni Aba gho.” <verse eid="MAT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24" />Hu vahina vahali ikado vareako ka mburi vekavasanuiwa ka vabakhu vanu. <verse eid="MAT 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25" />Kwato Yesu ekavase ekavaba, “Mureile ite vagiru va madi vevakaeti vahe kini kwa u, naka vagiru veaija ugiru kini. <verse eid="MAT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26" />Chisikhwato hekune, mira muhe edumu kukhwa na ugiru hakaghu, edumuwa akhwa mnyamalo kaghu, <verse eid="MAT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27" />naho edumu kukhwa wa bosi hekune edumuwe akhwa mnyamalo kaghu, <verse eid="MAT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28" />sahucho Muinyi wa Mhe esilitie kalo anyamarikiwe, mira kunyamarika, naho agu uzime kuu ukhwa ukombo kwa mburi ya vakumure.”<verse eid="MAT 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etavauti vahe vanu vesiakho</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mariko 10:46-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luka 18:35-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29" />Yesu na vahina kuu vareakhwa vehali he muang'a wa Yeriko, vahe vakumure vekamliaha. <verse eid="MAT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30" />Vahe vanu vesiakho veezokhodie kakera he kwalhi, vareako ite Yesu etatakho ata, vekama lukalasu vekuba, “Mgiru, Muinyi wakwe dilao Daudi, tuakhoie mbalamija.” <verse eid="MAT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31" />Hu vahe vakumure vekavajoghoiya vekavaba vataa. Mira vo vekamaisha nkalasu vekuba, “Mgiru, Muinyi wakwe dilao Daudi tuakhoie mbalamija.” <verse eid="MAT 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32" />Yesu ekauma, ekavase na kuvalhasu, “Mudumu nimuboie kiakhoni?” <verse eid="MAT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33" />Vekamba, “Mgiru, tukugogo uyalha maila kanu.” <verse eid="MAT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34" />Yesu ekavaakhoia mbalamija, ekavadara maila kini, watooto maila kini yekaakho, navo vekamliaha.<verse eid="MAT 20:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21" />
  <para style="s">Vahe vetamlhamuia Yesu ekubuu Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mariko 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yohana 12:12-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1" />Yesu na vahina kuu vareahe sina na Yerusalemu na kuhe Besefage he vijiji viaha sina na lubwa lwa Mizeituni, ekavasugha vahina kuu vanu, <verse eid="MAT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2" />ekavaba, “Soni he kijiji chiaha kara kaghu muneheiya mpunda iorowe hawe na muinyi kuu ata. Jigeni munigerie.” <verse eid="MAT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3" />Kai muhe ekunemulhasu, mumba, “Dilao ejidumu,” Nau enejikiriti madamo si makumure. <verse eid="MAT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4" />Ya mburi jeeboike kalo hu vyeeyowe ni mroto wa Kiumbi vilijanye, <verse eid="MAT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5" />vabaiyeni vahe va Yerusalemu ite, “Wesia, Dilao kaghu etalita, mnyulu wa swaho ekutue he muinyi wa mhunda.” <verse eid="MAT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6" />Hu vahina vekaso vekaboi sakigi Yesu evasughae. <verse eid="MAT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7" />Vekazaigera hu mhunda hawe na muinyi kuu, vekanagha gomae ana hehu mhunda Yesu ekazokhodi ana heka mhunda. <verse eid="MAT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8" />Vahe vakumure vekanagha gomae kini he kwalhi, naho vahe vahali vekapu matambi magitutu ya mikhatu vekayanagha he kwalhi. <verse eid="MAT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9" />Vahe vakumure vemkaeye nahu veekumliha vekama gimbe vekaba, “ Muinyi wakwe Daudi ekairiwe, nagimbikwe kaye elita kwa ilhe lakwe Dilao, eye kukairiwa ni Kiumbi are ana.” <verse eid="MAT 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10" />Yesu areakhwa ebuu Yerusalemu, vahe vakhabuna vaka muang'a vekamaka. Vekabubulhuka vekalhasu, “Ho niji ya?” <verse eid="MAT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11" />Vahe hehu ifyo vekaba, “Ya ni Yesu, hu mroto wa Kiumbi kuli Nazareti idi la Galilaya.”<verse eid="MAT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etavaguguluti vahe vekoranya mihaku he minda ya Kiumbi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mariko 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luka 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yohana 2:13-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12" />Yesu areabuu he minda ya Kiumbi, ekavaheia vahe veekuchuluja hawe vigi gahana he minda ya Kiumbi, ekajilhuku hu meza jahu veekukoranya mihaku, na vigi vyahu vahe veekudidi sua. <verse eid="MAT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13" />Ekavaba, “Hegondiwe he magondo ya Kiumbi ite, ‘Minda gho inesewe minda ya miaresi.’ Mira kune mwaiboi kukhwa mhanga ya vagwalo.” <verse eid="MAT 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14" />Vesiakho na vilemuna vahali vekamliaha Yesu are heminda ya Kiumbi, nau ekavauti. <verse eid="MAT 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15" />Mira vagiru va muaresi na vahinya va miku yakwe Musa vareakho ka vimako vyo Yesu eboie, naho na vainyi cho veekubirikira he minda ya Kiumbi vekuba, “Nhogolo he Muinyi wakwe dilao Daudi,” Vekasanuiwa, <verse eid="MAT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16" />Kwato vekamlhasu ite, “Ho, urako cho ya vainyi veyo?” Yesu ekavaba, “Ee nirako, Ho temuzemuru kusoma ya magondo yeba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:16">“Kuli he mio ya vainyi vagitutu, nahu vainyi vegosiwe venekukairi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:16">Waakudaia kitumulilo.”<verse eid="MAT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17" />Niho iji, ekavaro, ekali gahana he muang'a ekaso Betania, ekai are.<verse eid="MAT 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etaubusu lupae mkhatu usewa mtini</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 11:12-14">Mariko 11:12-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:20-24">11:20-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18" />Lhenu kuu chalhenu Yesu areakhwa eaha kwalhi ekirii he muang'a, ekako kela. <verse eid="MAT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19" />Ekauakho mkhatu usewa mtini khakhera he kwalhi, mira ekauheya teulo matunda ulo mahako bi. Iji, ekauba, “Useezasa kahali matunda maaze khabuna.” Waata ata ka mtini ukanyuluka. <verse eid="MAT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20" />Vahina kuu vareakho to vekamaka vekamlhasu ite, “Kwaakhoni ya mkhatu wa mtini waamanganyuluka?” <verse eid="MAT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21" />Yesu ekavaba, “Kweri nimubao, kai mukukhwa na mdarisho ufurue, temukaboi bi yacho niboie heya mkhatu usewa mtini, mira sari mukuneluba ya lubwa ite ‘Kung'ofule uzekubibi he bahari,’ Chineboiika wato. <verse eid="MAT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22" />Naho mkudarisha, cho munelhawa kwa kuaresi, mneowe.”<verse eid="MAT 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etalhasuwa mburi ya umuruisho kuu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mariko 11:27-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luka 20:1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23" />Yesu areabuu he minda ya Kiumbi, ekakhwa ehinya. Ilai ehinya, vagiru va muaresi, na madilao vekamlhasu, “Ya mburi ujiboi kwa umuruisho mina? Niji ekuoe ka umuruisho?” <verse eid="MAT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24" />Yesu ekavaba, “Naani ninemulhasu mburi we, mkunibaya, niho naani ninemubaya niboi ya mburi kwa umuruisho wakweji. <verse eid="MAT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25" />Ho, umuruisho wakwe Yohana wa kubatija weeliye hakweji? Ho, weelie ana he Kiumbi hile he vahe?” Mira vekayotijanya vo kwa vo vekaba, “Twaraaba, ‘Ulie ana he Kiumbi,’ enetulhasu, ‘Iji, niakhoni temudarishe?’ <verse eid="MAT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26" />Naho tukuba, ‘Ulie he vahe,’ Tubugheno ifyo la vahe kwaite vakhabuna veilie ite Yohana ni mroto wa Kiumbi.” <verse eid="MAT 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27" />Niho, vekamba, “Nne tetuilie.” Yesu nau ekavaba, “Naani sikamubae niboi ya mburi kwa umuruisho mina.”<verse eid="MAT 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mtotiano wa vaburatu vanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28" />Yesu ekayo kahali ekavaba “Kune muakho kimomo, muhe muwe eelo vaburatu vanu, ekamsugha hu wabosi ekamba, ‘Muinyi gho, wai uso uzeboi nyamalo he mbuva ya mizabibu.’” <verse eid="MAT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29" />Hu muinyi ekamba, “Aba ani sikaso” Mira kalufunda ekakheriti mitotire kuu, ekaso kuzaboi ka nyamalo. <verse eid="MAT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30" />Niho ka aba ekamsugha muinyi kuu wa kanu sacho emsughae hu wabosi, naka esughawe kakanu ekamba, “Ee aba nineso. Mira tezeso. <verse eid="MAT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31" />Ho, ni mhama heya vanu eboie hucho aba edumue?” Vekamba, “Nihu muinyi wabosi.” Niho Yesu ekavaba, “Kweri nimubaiya vazadara kodi navadana venemukaeiya kubuu he Udilao wa Kiumbi” <verse eid="MAT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32" />“Kwaite Yohana mzabatija eelitie hakaghu ekamuhinya mifufuire mikulho, kune temumdarishe, mira vedara kodi na vadana vekamdarisha. Hawe na kuakho ka vikhabuna kune temuyoe nakuro makusa kaghu kalo mumdarishe.”<verse eid="MAT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mtotiano wa vakurume hembuva ya mizabibu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mariko 12:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luka 20:9-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33" />Niho Yesu ekaba, “Lakhonhani mtotiano mhali. Muhe muwe elo mbuva eekuruye mbuva ya mizabibu, ekaikwauiya lugo, ekatu ihora lakuboiiya divai, naho ekakwa kiringo. Niho ekaikodisha ka mbuva he vakurume, ekaso bari ya uda. <verse eid="MAT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34" />Madamo ya kuloja yareahe, ekavasugha vanyamalo kuu hehu vakurume, kalo vazedori matunda kuu.” <verse eid="MAT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35" />Mira hu vakurume vekavadara ka vanyamalo muwe vekamma, mhali vekamgaa na mhali vekamma masaheru. <verse eid="MAT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36" />Ka mzalombuva ekavasugha vanyamalo vahali, vakumure kutakho hu vabosi. Hu vakurume vekavaboiya mburi sawahuhu. <verse eid="MAT 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37" />Niho iji mzalo mbuva ekazamsugha muinyi kuu ilai ekutoti ite “Ya ni muinyi gho venemko.” <verse eid="MAT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38" />Mira hu vakurume vareamuakho muinyi kuu vekayotijana, “Ya niu mzapala, iji tumgaa kalo tudori vyo enepala” <verse eid="MAT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39" />Kwato, vekamdara, vekamgu gahana hehu mbuva ya mizabibu, vekamgaa. <verse eid="MAT 21:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40" />“Iji, ka mzalo mbuva ya mizabibu ekuralita, enevasamo ka vakurume?” <verse eid="MAT 21:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41" />Niho vekamba, “Enevagaa kikusa ka vakurume vakusa, nahu mbuva enevao vakurume vahali venemlhanu mihaku kuu he madamo yeye.” <verse eid="MAT 21:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42" />Ata Yesu ekavaba, “He, temusomie ya mburi he magondo ya Kiumbi? ‘Isaheru veelilhie vazakwa, waijiji laakhwa isaheru igiru la khakhera. Dilao niu eboiye mburi yayo, naho iji ni kimako kigiru hakanu.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43" />Kwato namubao, Udilao wa Kiumbi unekaawe hakaghu na kuowe vahe vahali veboi kikulho.” <verse eid="MAT 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44" />Naho enelhu heka isaheru enepuikapuika, mira hu enelhuiwa nika isaheru, linemtighinha pere. <verse eid="MAT 21:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45" />Vagiru vakuaresija na Mafarisayo vareako mitoyanire kuu vekaile ite evayo vo. <verse eid="MAT 21:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46" />Kwato vekakhwa vedaa kwalhi ya kumdara, mira vekakhwa vebugheno vahe kwaite vo veemuilie Yesu ite ni mroto wa Kiumbi.<verse eid="MAT 21:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22" />
  <para style="s">Mtotiano wa vagalho he elha ya kudori</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 14:15-24">Luka 14:15-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1" />Yesu ekayo navo kahali kwa mitotiano ekuba, <verse eid="MAT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2" />“Udilao waare ana he Kiumbi utotiane ne dilao muwe emboie muinyi kuu vighu vya elha ya kudori.” <verse eid="MAT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3" />Kwato ekavasugha vanyamalo varevase verarikwe valita he elha, mira verarikwe vekalhi kulita. <verse eid="MAT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4" />Niho ekavasugha kahali vanyamalo vahali, ekuba, “Vabaiyeni ka verarikwe ite, elha gho yaahe, naagaa churu na mili gho jigabie hawe na viaghu vikulho vyaadaawe pere, litani he elha ya kudori.” <verse eid="MAT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5" />Mira vo vekafwa ka elha niho vekaso he mburi kini, muwe ekaso he mbuva kuu na mhali ekaso he nyamalo kuu, <verse eid="MAT 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6" />na vahali vemerisie vekavadara hu vanyamalo kuu vekavama na kuvagaa. <verse eid="MAT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7" />Hu mgiru ekasanuiwa, ekavasugha vakilaaru kuu varevagaa ka vegaae naho vaulhaha ka muang'a kini. <verse eid="MAT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8" />Niho ekavaba ka vanyamalo kuu ite, “Viaghu vya elha ya kudori vyadaawe pere, mira verarikwe teveye kubuu heya elha. <verse eid="MAT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9" />Iji soni hebalabala naho ka munevaheya vararikeni ite valita heviaghu vya elha ya kudori.” <verse eid="MAT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10" />Hu vanyamalo vekali, vekaso he kwalhi, vekavagera vahe vakhabuna, vakusa na vakulho. Minda ya elha ya kudori ikahu vagalho. <verse eid="MAT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11" />“Mgiru areabuu kuvawesia vagalho, ekamuakho mhe muwe esioroe gomae jahe elha.” <verse eid="MAT 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12" />Mgiru ekamlhasu, “Msaho, ubuiye kimomo ii usilo gomae ja elha ya kudori?” Mira ka muhe teandue. <verse eid="MAT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13" />Niho ata dilao ekavabaya vanyamalo, “Muoroni mulhu he masame na miheregha murembibi are gana he kidughu are enezo na kushagha maiki.” <verse eid="MAT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14" />Yesu ekafiriti kwakuba, “Verarikwe ni vakumure mira velhoijwe ni vaghere.”<verse eid="MAT 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulhanu kodi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mariko 12:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luka 20:20-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15" />Niho Mafarisayo vekali gahana, vekaiseko hucho venemdara Yesu kwa viome kuu. <verse eid="MAT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16" />Kwato, vekavasugha vahina kini hawe na vasaho vakwe Herode. Vekamlhasu Yesu vekumba, Mhinya, tureile ite ari umuhe mkulho, naho ite uhinya kwalhi ya Kiumbi kwa ukweri neri tumbughenu muhe, kwaite ugiru wa muhe heari si kigi. <verse eid="MAT 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17" />“Tubaiye iji kutoti kechi. Ho, chiye hile hai, kulhanu kodi he Kaisari?” <verse eid="MAT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18" />Mira Yesu ereile ukusa kini, ekavaba, “Kune vakusa mukuboi muvakulho kwaakhoni munitegha? <verse eid="MAT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19" />Niaijani igongolo la kulhanuiya kodi.” Navo vekamguiya igongolo la mhaku. <verse eid="MAT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20" />Yesu nau ekavalhasu, “Ya vubasa naya ilhe nivyakweji?” <verse eid="MAT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21" />Vekamba, “Ni yakwe Kaisari.” Niho Yesu ekavaba, “Muoni Kaisari chiye kumuo, nayakwe Kiumbi muoni Kiumbi.” <verse eid="MAT 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22" />Vareako to vekamaka vekamro, vekahaka.<verse eid="MAT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mburi ya kuka kuli he kigame</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mariko 12:18-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luka 20:27-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23" />Muaze wahuuhu, Masadukayo, vahe vedarisha ite tehelo kuka kuli hekigame, veedumue kumlhasu Yesu vekamliaha, <verse eid="MAT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24" />vekamba, “Mhinya, Musa eebae muhe edorie ekuga esiroe muinyi, chidumuwe mbakhu kuu amdori ka mlage egaiwe ni muagiru kalo amwakhoiye vainyi mbakhu kuu agae. <verse eid="MAT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25" />Iji, ii hakanu heelo vabahu saba. Wabosi edorie mlage naho ekaga neri esiakhoiwe vainyi nika mlage, mbakhu kuu ekampala ka mlage egaiwe ni muagiru. <verse eid="MAT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26" />Chikarakhwa wato oto he mbakhu wa kanu, na wakakai, sari wa saba. <verse eid="MAT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27" />Ka vabakhu vakhabuna vareaga, hu mlage nau ekaga. <verse eid="MAT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28" />Ho hu muaze wa kuka kuli he kigame ka mlage enekhwa mlage wakweji hehu vabakhu saba? Kwaite vakhabuna saba veemdorie.” <verse eid="MAT 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29" />Yesu ekavaba, “Kune muboi visiye kwaite temuilie magondo ya Kiumbi neri umuruisho wa Kiumbi. <verse eid="MAT 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30" />Kwaite vegae vekuneka tevekadori neri kudoriwe, venekhwa sa vazasughawa va areana he Kiumbi kwaite tevedori neri kudoriwa. <verse eid="MAT 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31" />Mira kwa mburi ya kukaawe vegae, he kigame, temusomie hucho mubaiwe ni Kiumbi? Eemubae ite, <verse eid="MAT 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32" />‘Ani ni Kiumbi wakwe Ibrahimu na Kiumbi wakwe Isaka na Kiumbi wakwe Yakobo.’ Kwato, U si Kiumbi wa vavegae, mira ni Kiumbi wa vazime.” <verse eid="MAT 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33" />Hu ifyo la vahe lireako to likamakisha mahinyo kuu.<verse eid="MAT 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Miku giru</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Mariko 12:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luka 10:25-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34" />Mafarisayo vareako ite Yesu aavataija Masadukayo ka Mafarisayo vekaiseko vasahe hawe. <verse eid="MAT 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35" />Muwe wa Mafarisayo ee mhinya wa miku yakwe Musa, ekamlhasu Yesu kwa kumgali ekumba, <verse eid="MAT 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36" />“Mhinya, ni miku hama giru he miku khabuna?” <verse eid="MAT 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37" />Yesu ekamba, “Mdumuishe Dilao Kiumbi kwa swaho kechi khabuna namitotire kechi mikhabuna hawe na akiri kechi khabuna. <verse eid="MAT 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38" />Ya niu miku giru naho ya bosi. <verse eid="MAT 22:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39" />Miku haliwa giru saka niuya, ‘Umdumu muaro kechi sahucho ukudumuisha salaghe’. <verse eid="MAT 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40" />Miku khabuna yakwe Musa na mahinyo ya varoto va Kiumbi yelie heya miku minu.”<verse eid="MAT 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kiristo niji?</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mariko 12:35-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luka 20:41-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41" />Mafarisayo vareasahe hawe, Yesu ekavalhasu, <verse eid="MAT 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42" />Kune muakho kimomo he mburi yakwe Masia? Ni muinyi wakweji? Vekamba, “Ni muinyi wakwe Daudi.” <verse eid="MAT 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43" />Yesu ekavaba, “Kwato, chimuruika kimomo ite kwa umuruisho wa Saa wa Kiumbi, Daudi emse Kiristo Dilao?” Kwaite Daudi eebae,<verse eid="MAT 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44" />“Dilao Kiumbi eembae Dilao gho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 22:44">Zokhodi bwa gho wa sughano,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 22:44">Sari nikunevamuru vankuru kechi.”<verse eid="MAT 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45" />Kwato iji, kai Daudi emse Kiristo “Dilao,” Emuru kimomo kukhwa muinyi kuu? <verse eid="MAT 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46" />Tehelo neri mhe muwe eandue, na kulholhoshi to tehelo eregali kumlhasu Yesu kigi kihali.<verse eid="MAT 22:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23" />
  <para style="s">Yesu etavakanya vahinya va miku na Mafarisayo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:38">Mariko 12:38</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 12:39">39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:43-46">Luka 11:43-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:46">20:46</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1" />Yesu ekayo na vahe vakumure hawe na vahina kuu ekuvaba, <verse eid="MAT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2" />“Vahinya va miku yakwe Musa hawe na Mafarisayo velo ugiru wakuyoiya miku yakwe Musa, <verse eid="MAT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3" />kwato mudumuwa muvako na kuboi kira cho venemubaiya. Mira musiboi cho veboi, kwaite teveboi huyo veyabirikira.” <verse eid="MAT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4" />Veoro mimaru iyakhi na kuvabadika vahe he vituro, mira vo salaghini tevedumu neri kukaa kisatu kuisusughuja. <verse eid="MAT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5" />Vo veboi ka mburi khabuna kalo vaakhowe ni vahe. He vubasa na miharegha veoro vubegi vuboiwe na bulhe naka vubegi kini vubutuwe vikhao vya makaratasi vigondiwe miku yakwe Musa, nakuboi vufundo vwa gomae kini vukhwa vukulhe. <verse eid="MAT 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6" />Vedumuisha kuzokhodi he vikire vya ugiru vyabosi he elha hawe na kuzokhodi he vikire vya bosi hodi hakusahe Vayahudi. <verse eid="MAT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7" />Kahaliwa vedumuisha kuholuwe kikulho he vikhoja naho vedumuisha kusewa ni vahe, “Mhinya.” <verse eid="MAT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8" />Mira kune musisewe, “Mhinya,” Kwaite kune mhinya kaghu ni muwe bi, na kune vakhabuna muvabakhu. <verse eid="MAT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9" />Naho kune musimse mhe neri muwe “Aba” ii he idi, kwaite Aba kaghu ni muwe bi, eaha are ana. <verse eid="MAT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10" />Neri musisewe “Mzakaeti” kwaite emukaeti kuni ni muwe bi, niu Kiristo <verse eid="MAT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11" />Kira muhe edumu kukhwa mgiru he kune chidumuwa akhwa mnyamalo kaghu. <verse eid="MAT 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12" />Kwaite neri muhe muwe ekukuturu Kiumbi enemdimiri, naho ekudimiri Kiumbi enemkuturu.<verse eid="MAT 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etakararija vakusa vekuboi vakulho</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:40">Mariko 12:40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:39-42">Luka 11:39-42</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:44">44</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:52">52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:47">20:47</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13" />Kuriuwa kaghu, vahinya va miku yakwe Musa na Mafarisayo, kune vakusa mukuaija ite muvakulho, muvalhatiya vahe maluhige ya Ugiru wa ana he Kiumbi. Kune salaghe temubuu are, naho hu vedumu kubuu mutavalhiija. <verse eid="MAT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14" />Kuriuwa kaghu kune vahinya va miku na Mafarisayo vakusa mukuboi ite muvakulho, muvaale valage vegaiwe ni vaagiru kini vigi kini naho mukuboi muvakulho, muaresi madamo maeza kwato zamaro kaghu inekhwa girusha. <verse eid="MAT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15" />“Kuriuwa kaghu, kune vahinya va miku na Mafarisayo, kune vakusa mukuboi ite muvakulho, kune mubari he bahari nahe idi lisilo mai mukumdaa muhe muwe kalo ailiahe kwalhi kaghu mira mkunemuakho mutamboi akhwa muhe edumuwa aso he iziwa lilo mwalha usiga maaze khabuna kagi kanu kutakho kune.” <verse eid="MAT 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16" />“Kuriuwa kaghu, vagiru musiakho.” Kune muba, “Muhe ekuapa kwa ilhe la minda ya Kiumbi, kuapa kutoe to si kigi mira muhe ekuapa he zahabu ya Minda ya Kiumbi aorowe ni kiapo kuu.” <verse eid="MAT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17" />Kune maivile musiakho, nikihama kigirusha, nihu zahabu hile nihu Minda ya Kiumbi niu iboi hu zahabu idumuijwe he Kiumbi? <verse eid="MAT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18" />Kahali muba ite muhe ekulapa eeaha hodi hakuaresia si kigi, mira ekulapa eeaha helo kivulu chikewe hodi hakuaresia ka kilapo chinemdara. <verse eid="MAT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19" />Kune musiakho ni kihama chiyeisha hu kivulu hile nito hodi hakuguiya ka kivulu chidumuijwe he Kiumbi? <verse eid="MAT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20" />Kwato muhe elapa kwa hodi hakuguiya kivulu elapa ata hodi hakuguiya kuvulu hawe na kira kigi chikeiwe ana kuu. <verse eid="MAT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21" />Naho elapa he minda ya Kiumbi enekhwa alapa heka minda ya Kiumbi hawe nahuye ezokho heka minda. <verse eid="MAT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22" />Naka elapa areana he Kiumbi, elapa he kikire cha Udilao wa Kiumbi, nahehu Kiumbi salaghe ezokhodi ana heka kikire. <verse eid="MAT 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23" />Kuriuwa kaghu vahinya va miku yakwe Musa na Mafarisayo, kune vakusa mukuaija ite muvakulho, kwaite mugu zaka neri ja mbukha ja mahako, bizari na jira, naho mulhi mburi jiye kuboiwa kutakho miku sa kukhwa na ukulho he Kiumbi ja kweri na mbalamija hawe na kudarisha. Yayo iji neeyo mweekudumuwe kuboi mburi giru na gitutu neri musizi hu mahali. <verse eid="MAT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24" />Kune vagiru va idi musiakho, mugu sindaki he mai ya kuwaha, mira munguju wa. <verse eid="MAT 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25" />Kuriuwa kaghu vahinya va miku na mafarisayo, kune vakusa mukuaija ite muvakulho, muonhi ibakuri na kikonho kwa gahana, mira are za muro hehuye vigi vya ugwalo na kula. <verse eid="MAT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26" />Kune Mafarisayo musiakho, rongachionhini ka kikonho za niho muchionhi gahana chineakhu. <verse eid="MAT 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27" />Kuriuwa kaghu vahinya va miku na Mafarisayo, kune vakusa mukuaija ite muvakulho mukhwae sa mbira jilhomiwe chokaa kwa gahana yeakhoika ite ni makulho, mira za jihuye mafwara ya vabenisi na kira kiwe chisiye. <verse eid="MAT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28" />Nire wato oto na kune muakhokana ite muvaboia vahe kikulho, mira heswaho kaghu muhuye lame na ukusa.<verse eid="MAT 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etayoiya zamaro kini</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:47-51">Luka 11:47-51</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29" />“Kuriuwa kaghu vahinya va miku na Mafarisayo, vakusa mukuaija ite muvakulho.” Mukwau kikulho mbira ja varoto va Kiumbi na kujiboiya kikulho mbira ja vahe vakulho. <verse eid="MAT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30" />Muba ite, “Kai nne tweezokhoye he madamo yaare azeto ja vaaba kanu tetweseekhwariana navo he kugaa varoto va Kiumbi. <verse eid="MAT 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31" />Kwato kune salaghe muradumu ite muvainyi va vahe vegaae varoto va Kiumbi.” <verse eid="MAT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32" />Haya, firitini hu nyamalo ya vaaba kaghu veilholhoshie. <verse eid="MAT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33" />Kune ikolwa la bome mulo mbari ya bome jilo sumu, mumuru kimomo kugugulu zamaro ya mwalha wa usiga maaze khabuna? <verse eid="MAT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34" />Nicho ani nimugeria varoto, vahe velo viugho na vahinya, mira munevagaa na kuvasurumija naho vahali munevama ndate ja bulhe hodi hakusaheya Vayahudi na kuvaguguluja he kira muang'a <verse eid="MAT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35" />Kwato munekararijwa kwa mburi ya sako khabuna ya vahe vakulho isuiwe ana he idi. Kulholhoshi hu sako yakwe Habili eesiboie ukusa sari huyo yakwe Zakaria, muinyi wakwe Bakaria huye eegaiwe hasi he Minda ya Kiumbi hodi hanyakhare hakuaresia. <verse eid="MAT 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36" />Nimubaya kweri, ite ya ikolwa linenyamarishwa kwaya mburi.<verse eid="MAT 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etavadumu vahe va Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 13:34-35">Luka 13:34-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37" />Kune vahe va Yerusalemu, muvagaa varoto va Kiumbi na kuvama masaheru hu veeajiiwe hakaghu. Ni kagi kame nigalie kuvabunguru vainyi kaghu hagho, sahucho nkweno ibunguru vusio kuu he mawawa kuu, mira tumudumue. <verse eid="MAT 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38" />Kwato iji, Kiumbi eneiro minda kaghu yo muaresia naho munerowa mweevahuye. <verse eid="MAT 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39" />Nakubao, tukazeniakho kahali sari ukuba “Akairiwe ka elita kwa ilhe la Dilao.”<verse eid="MAT 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24" />
  <para style="s">Yesu etarota kuoniwe kwa minda ya Kiumbi .</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mariko 13:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luka 21:5-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1" />Yesu ekahali he lwigo lwa Minda ya Kiumbi kalo aso, areakhwa elihali, vahinya kuu vekamliaha vamuaije minda ja Kiumbi. <verse eid="MAT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2" />Niho Yesu ekavaba, “Ee mumuru kujiakho ya minda cho jitoe kulho waijiji. Mira namubao, tehelo neri isaheru iwe ii linefufu ana he isaheru ihali, kwaite kira iwe lineoniwa.”<verse eid="MAT 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kharo na Kunyamarika</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mariko 13:3-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luka 21:7-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3" />Niho Yesu ekakutu sari ana helubwa lwa mizeituni ekazokhodi ata, vahinya kuu vekamliaha hodi hesilo vahe, vekamlhasu, “Tubaiye ni madamo mina ya mburi jineralijanya naho ni lhaa mina inetuaija ite kulita kechi na mkhito wa Idi kwaahe sina?” <verse eid="MAT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4" />Yesu ekavaba, “Kuwesiisheni neri muhe asimuta.” <verse eid="MAT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5" />Kwaite vahe vakumure venelita vekuba ite “Vo niu Kiristo.” Navo venevata vahe vakumure. <verse eid="MAT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6" />Muneko gimbe jaaku jimaanwa sina, na mburi ja aku jiaha uda, mira musibughenu, kwaite ka yedumuwa yaliijanye. Mira kayo teyeaija ite mkhito waahe. <verse eid="MAT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7" />Vahe va idi iwe venemaana na vahe va idi ihali, vahe va udilao muwe unekwekwe na vahe vaudilao mhali. Kira hodi henekhwa na kela na idi kuu. <verse eid="MAT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8" />Ka makhabuna yenekhwa nisa kulholhoshi kwa mlage elhaiwa eaha sina kuakho muinyi. <verse eid="MAT 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9" />“Heka madamo vahe va madi makhabuna venemusanuiya venemudara kalo vamukharotije na kumugaa kune kwa mburi ya kukhwa vahina gho.” <verse eid="MAT 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10" />Kahali, vakumure venero kuniliaha ani, navyo venelhiana na kusanuiyana. <verse eid="MAT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11" />Kamadamo venelijanya varoto vakumure va lame venevata vahe vakumure. <verse eid="MAT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12" />Kwa mburi ya kususuika kwa makusa, vahe vakumure venero kudumuana. <verse eid="MAT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13" />Mira enegumirija sari mkhito Kiumbi enekombo. <verse eid="MAT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14" />Mkhito usinahe, Mburi Kulho ya Udilao wa Kiumbi inebirikirwa hevahe va idi ikhabuna kalo vahe va madi makhabuna vako Mburi Kulho kuli he Kiumbi. Niho Kiumbi eneboi mkhito waidi uhe.<verse eid="MAT 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maaze ya kharo giru</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Mariko 13:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luka 21:20-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15" />Ka madamo muneakho kigi chibughenusha chigera kuoni na kusanuija, hu yeeyowe ni Danieli mroto wa Kiumbi, chiaha za he minda ya Kiumbi, kira muhe esoma ya mburi, aile. <verse eid="MAT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16" />Kwato hu veaha are Yudea na vaguguluye he malubwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17" />Nahu eaha ana he minda kuu asidimi kudori vigi viaha are za he minda kuu mira agugulu. <verse eid="MAT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18" />Neri eaha he mbuva asikirii mzungure kuradori gomae kuu mira agugulu. <verse eid="MAT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19" />Tunevakoia mbalamija valage velo maso na vegosija heka maaze. <verse eid="MAT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20" />Muaresini Kiumbi kalo kugugulu kaghu kusirekhwa he maaze ya kiuho hile he Muaze wa kufufu. <verse eid="MAT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21" />Kwaite heka madamo vahe venekhwa na kharo giru jisinaralijanyaa kuli ho idi liboiwe sari wai, neri tejikazelijanya kahali. <verse eid="MAT 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22" />Naho kai ka maaze teyete pungujwa, tehelo neri muhe eseeu mira Kiumbi enepunguja ka maaze kwa mburi ya vahe kuu evalhoije. <verse eid="MAT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23" />Kwato heka maaze muhe ekumubaya ite, “Kiristo eaha ii” Hile eaha to, musidumu. <verse eid="MAT 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24" />Vahe vakuwe venemuba, ani ni Kiristo hile nitesughawe ni Kiristo, na vahe vahali veneba, “Ani ni mroto kuli he Kiumbi” Mira viome kini vinekhwa vya lame. Veneboi vimako vigiru na vigi vikumure vigalho he maila ya vahe vya kumuru kuvata naho chikumuruika venevata na vahe velhoijwe ni Kiumbi. <verse eid="MAT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25" />Lakhonhani, naafiriti kumukanya madamo yaka mburi jisinalijanya. <verse eid="MAT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26" />Kwato vekumuba, “Wesiani, aeha heilangwa,” Musiso arai hile “Wesiani, ekumatue za heminda, musidarishe.” <verse eid="MAT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27" />Muile ite kulita kwa Muinyi wa Muhe kunekhwa nakawe. Kunekhwa sa luatame lwa lubambala lumangadimi kuli kaaze ho keliia sari ho kefilia. <verse eid="MAT 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28" />Kwaite kira hodi helo chigae, niho makunguru yenebunguru kua nihena.<verse eid="MAT 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulita kwa Muinyi wa Muhe.</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mariko 13:24-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luka 21:25-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29" />Yekutakho bi maaze ya kunyamarika, Kiumbi eneboi kaaze kakhwa kidughu na mlhihe teukagu luatame, nhondwe jinelhu kuli ana, na u ja areana he Kiumbi jinehehejwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30" />Niho henelijanya lhaa ya Muinyi wa Muhe ineakhoika ana, naho vahe vakhabuna va idi venezo, navo venemuakho Muinyi wa Muhe ekulita ana he malhareno ekukhwa na u na ekuuaija ugiru kuu. <verse eid="MAT 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31" />Nau enevasugha vazasughawe kuu velo igunda lizoisha, naho venevabunguru vahe kuu velhoijwe kuli bwa khabuna hai ja idi, kulholhoshi bwa muwe waare ana he Kiumbi sari mkhito kuu.<verse eid="MAT 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kigi cha kuhina kuli he mkhatu usewa mtini.</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mariko 13:28-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luka 21:29-33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32" />Yesu ekakhwa echeri yo ekuba, “Muhine kuli he mkhatu wa mtini, to matambi kuu yekulholhoshi kukhwa makenye na kugu makhupi muile ite madamo ya uloji yaahe sina. <verse eid="MAT 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33" />Watooto nakune mkuneakho ya mburi khabuna jikuboika, muile ite eaha sinasha. <verse eid="MAT 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34" />Nimubaiya ukweri, ya ikolwa telikatakho, ka mburi khabuna jisinalijanya. <verse eid="MAT 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35" />Are ana heilhareno henetakho, idi nau linetakho, mira viome gho neri tevikatakho.”<verse eid="MAT 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tehelo eilie muaze neri kela</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:32-37">Mariko 13:32-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26-30">Luka 17:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:34-36">17:34-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36" />Mira he mburi ya muaze hile kela Muinyi Kiumbi enelita, kavyo tehelo muhe eviilie ite vinekhwa ami, neri vazasughawe va are ana he Kiumbi neri Muinyi, mira Aba salaghe bi niu eilie. <verse eid="MAT 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37" />Kwaite sahucho cheekhwae he maaze yakwe Nuhu, nicho chinezakhwa hehu madamo Muinyi wa Muhe ekuralita. <verse eid="MAT 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38" />Kwaite ka madamo, mare girusha jisinalita nakugera mai kumure, vahe veekua na kuwaha, veekudori na kudoriwa sari Nuhu areabuu za he mashua giru isewa safina. <verse eid="MAT 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39" />Ka vahe teveeilie kigi chineliijanya sari to mare girusha ireasi, ikavagaa vakhabuna. Nicho chinekhwa he madamo ya Muinyi wa Muhe ekuralita. <verse eid="MAT 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40" />Heka madamo vahe vanu venekhwa he mbuva, Kiumbi enemdori muwe mhali enemro. <verse eid="MAT 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41" />Naho valage vanu venekhwa vetu mhure, Kiumbi enemdori na mhali enemro. <verse eid="MAT 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42" />Kwato, aleni kwaite temuilie muaze hile kela yo enelita Dilao kaghu. <verse eid="MAT 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43" />Mira muhulha ya mburi, kai mzalo minda eereile muaze wo mgwalo enelita, eseraale, neri teseeroe minda kuu ipuwe. <verse eid="MAT 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44" />Kwato iji, nakune mukuke kikulho, kwaite Muinyi wa Muhe enelita he kela yo musiilie.<verse eid="MAT 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mnyamalo edaraishwa naesidaraishwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:41-48">Luka 12:41-48</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45" />Yesu ekavalhasu vahina kuu ekavaba, “Ni mnyamalo mhama mkweri naho elo viugho, mgiru kuu enemke avaumaie vahe kuu heminda kuu kalo akhwa evao viaghu he madamo yedumuwe? <verse eid="MAT 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46" />Enelhamuiwa ka mnyamalo kwaite madamo mgiru kuu ekunelita enemhea eboi sato.” <verse eid="MAT 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47" />Kweri namubayani, ka mgiru enemke ka mnyamalo aumaiye uzuri mkhabuna waka mgiru . <verse eid="MAT 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48" />Mira kai ka mnyamalo ni mkusa, nau ekatoti he swaho kuu ite, “Mgiru gho enehareti kulita,” <verse eid="MAT 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49" />Naho ekalholhoshi kuvama vanyamalo vaaro, ekalholhoshi kuaisha na kuwahaisha mala hawe na vazaengeli, <verse eid="MAT 24:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50" />mgiru kuu enelita muaze esiuarire nahe kela esiilie, <verse eid="MAT 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51" />ka mgiru enemkharotija kikusa ka mnyamalo na kumke hodi hawe na vekuboi vakulho kave nivakusa. Hodi henekhwa na manyamarisho makumure helo kizoi na kung'e maiki.<verse eid="MAT 24:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25" />
  <para style="s">Mtotitiano wa vaaleta ikado</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1" />“Ka madamo Udilao wa ana he Kiumbi unetoijwa sa vaaleta ikado vedorie vijari kini, vekaso kuramdaria muagiru mzadori. <verse eid="MAT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2" />Vakoi kini veekwae vivile na vakoi veelo viugho. <verse eid="MAT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3" />Hu vivile vakaoi vekadori vijari kini, mira tevedorie malhoma mahali kakera, <verse eid="MAT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4" />mira hu velo viugho vekadori vijari vilo malhoma na malhoma mahali he nyhupa. <verse eid="MAT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5" />Muagiru mzadori ereahareti kulita, hu vaaleta vakhabuna vekai luireno.” <verse eid="MAT 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6" />Mira hareahe kiama kigiru hekakhwa nagimbe, “Wesiani muagiru mzadori aalita,” Lini gahana muremdaria. <verse eid="MAT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7" />Niho iji hu vaaleta vakhabuna vekaka, vekakati vijari kini. <verse eid="MAT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8" />Mira hu vaaleta vivile vekavaba hu vaaleta velo viugho, “Tukakaieni malhoma kaghu maghere kwaite vijari kanu vitaga.” <verse eid="MAT 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9" />Mira hu velo viugho vekavaba, ya malhoma teyekatuagha nne na kune, keba muso murewe he vave vedidi malhoma. <verse eid="MAT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10" />Iji, hu vaaleta vivile vareaso kurawe malhoma mzadori ekahe, nahu vaaleta veelo vijari vilo malhoma vekabuu hawe na mzadori he minda yeekuboiika elha ya kudori, niho luhige lukalhatiwe. <verse eid="MAT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11" />Kalufunda, vekalita hu vaaleta vivile, vekase, “Mgiru, mgiru, tulhaiye luhige.” <verse eid="MAT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12" />Mira ka mgiru ekavaba, “Nimubaia kweri, simuilie kune.” <verse eid="MAT 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13" />Niho Yesu ekaba, “Kualeni, kwaite temuilie muaze hile kela Muinyi wa Mhe enelita.”<verse eid="MAT 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mtotiano wa vanyamalo vakai</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Luka 19:11-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14" />“Kahali Yesu ekaba, Udilao waare ana he Kiumbi utoe sa muhe eso bari ya uda, nau esinaso ekavase vanyamalo kuu na kuvaroa mari kuu kalo vajiumaiye. <verse eid="MAT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15" />Ekamuo wabosi magongolo makoi, wakanu ekamo magongolo manu nahu wakakai ekamo igongolo iwe la zahabu, naho eemoe kira muwe kuwesia na umuruisho wa kira mnyamalo, niho u ekabari.” <verse eid="MAT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16" />Hu eoiwe magongolo makoi ya zahabu ekaso ekaraboia nyamalo ya uchuluji ekasusu magongolo mahali makoi ya zahabu. <verse eid="MAT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17" />Hu eoiwe magongolo manu ya zahabu ekasusu magongolo mahali manu ya zahabu. <verse eid="MAT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18" />Mira hu eoiwe mhaku wa igongolo iwe ekaso, ekatu ihora he mpulhe, ekamatu ka igongolo ugiru kuu. <verse eid="MAT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19" />“Yareatakho madamo makumure hu dilao ekakirii, ekavaso vanyamalo kuu kalo awesie cho vesusue.” <verse eid="MAT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20" />Mnyamalo eoiwe mhaku wa magongolo makoi ya zahabu ekalita adarae magongolo mahali makoi yesusuike ekamba, “Mgiru, weenioe magongolo makoi ya zahabu, wesia ii helo magongolo makoi yo nisusue.” <verse eid="MAT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21" />Mgiru kuu ekamba, “Waaboi kikulho, mnyamalo uye kudaraishwa. Waakhwa mkweri he vigi vighere, ninekuo vigi vikumure. Lita ulhamuiwe hawe na mgiru kechi.” <verse eid="MAT 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22" />Mnyamalo eoiwe magongolo manu ya zahabu ekalita, ekagu magongolo manu mahali eyasusue ekaba, “Mgiru, weenioe talanta nu, doria talanta hali nu jo nisusue.” <verse eid="MAT 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23" />Mgiru kuu ekamba, “Kikulho, mnyamalo uye kudaraishwa. Waakhwa mkweri he vigi vighere, ninekuo vigi vikumure. Lita ulhamuiwe hawe ne mgiru kechi.” <verse eid="MAT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24" />Mira hu eoiwe mhaku wa igongolo iwe la zahabu ekalita, ekaba, “Mgiru, nireila ite ari umuhe mkusa, ari uloja to hodi usilhae, naho ubunguru to usizarishe. <verse eid="MAT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25" />Kwato naabughenu nikaso kumatu mhaku kechi he mpulhe. Iji dori mhaku kechi yaawo.” <verse eid="MAT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26" />Mgiru kuu ekamba, “Ari umnyamalo mkusa naho umvizu usidumu kuboi nyamalo, uilie ite ani nloja ho nisilhae, naho nibunguru to nisizarishe mbeyu. <verse eid="MAT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27" />Ni kikulho kai weeterake mhaku gho he vahe vechuluja mihaku, naani nikukirii neseeradori mhaku gho weeukee nahu ususuike kuu.” <verse eid="MAT 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28" />Iji, “Mlani ka mhaku murem'o hu elo magongolo ikado. <verse eid="MAT 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29" />Kwaite elo kigi eneowa na kususuwe vikumure. Mira esilo kigi, enelawe sari kigitutu elo nacho.” <verse eid="MAT 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30" />Niho ka mgiru eneba, “Ya muhe teye, mbibini are gahana he kidughu, are enezo na kung'e maiki.”<verse eid="MAT 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maalu na afa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31" />Muinyi wa Muhe ekunelita sa mgiru hawe na vazasughawe vaare ana he Kiumbi vakhabuna vekukhwa nau, ata enezokhodi he kikire kigiru cha udilao, <verse eid="MAT 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32" />Vahe va madi makhabuna venekubunguru heu, nau enekakaanya vahe he maifyo manu sa mzemo cho ekakaanya maalu na afa. <verse eid="MAT 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33" />Sakigi mzemo eyake maalu mlha wa sughano na afa mlha wa hina nirewato ani Muinyi wa Muhe ninevake vahe veekuboi mburi jo Kiumbi edumu mlha wa mharegha gho wa sughano, nahu veboie makusa ninevake mlha wa mharegha gho wa hina. <verse eid="MAT 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34" />Niho Dilao enevaba hu veaha mlha gho wa sughano, “Litani kune muboiiwe kikulho ni Aba gho, buuni he udilao wo mweekeiwe kuli azeto he kuboiwe kwa idi. <verse eid="MAT 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35" />Kwaite neelo kela kune mukanio viaghu, neelo kasu kune mukanio mai naho neekhwae mgalho na kune mkanidoria he minda kaghu, <verse eid="MAT 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36" />madamo hu neealaluje mkanioroija nee mrukao na kune mukanirukuti, neeoroiwe naho kune mukalita kuniwesia.” <verse eid="MAT 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37" />Niho iji ka vahe vakulho venemba “Dilao, niami tweekuakhoe ulo kela na nne tukakuo viaghu, hile weelo kasu na nne tukakuo mai ya kuwaha? <verse eid="MAT 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38" />Naho niami tweekuakhoe mgalho na nne tukakudoria, hile ualaluje tukakuo gomae? <verse eid="MAT 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39" />Naho tukuakhoe weekhwae mrukao tukakurukuti hile mzaorowe na nne tukalita kukuwesia?” <verse eid="MAT 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40" />Mgiru enevaba, “Nimubaya kweri, kigi cho mweemboiie muwe heya vabakhu gho vagitutu, mweeniboiie ani.” <verse eid="MAT 25:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41" />Niho mgiru enevaba hu veaha mlha wa hina kuu, “Hakani ii kune mubusuiwe lupae, soni he mwalha usiga maaze khabuna wo eekeiwe shetani na vazasughawe kuu. <verse eid="MAT 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42" />Kwaite neelo kela na kune temunioe viaghu, neelo kasu kune temnioe mai ya kuwaha. <verse eid="MAT 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43" />Nee mgalho kune temunidoriie he minda kaghu naho neealaluje temunioe gomae, nee mrukhao mira temnirukutie naho nee mzaorowa temulitie kuniwesia.” <verse eid="MAT 25:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44" />Ata niho venemba, “Mgiru niami tweekuakhoe weelo kela hile kasu, wee mgalho hile ualaluje hile umrukao hile mzaorowe na nne tetukulhaarie?” <verse eid="MAT 25:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45" />Naka mgiru enevaba, “Kweri namubao, sacho mulhie kumlhaari muwe waya vabakhu gho, mweelhiye kunilhaari ani. <verse eid="MAT 25:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46" />Kwato, yavo venebuu he kharo ja maaze makhabuna, mira hu vakulho venebuu he uzime wa maaze khabuna.”<verse eid="MAT 25:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26" />
  <para style="s">Vahe vetadaa kwalhi ya kumdara nakumgaa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mariko 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luka 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yohana 11:45-53</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1" />Yesu areafiriti kuhinya ka mburi khabuna, ekavaba vahina kuu, <verse eid="MAT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2" />“Mureila ite yekunetakho maaze manu henekhwa na elha ya Pasaka, naho Muinyi wa Mhe eneotijwa he vahe vemsanuia aremawa misumari he msaraba.” <verse eid="MAT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3" />Niho vagiru va muaresi hawe na vaagiru vazime vekasahe he minda ya mgiru wa vearesija ilhe kuu ni Kayafa. <verse eid="MAT 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4" />Vekadaa kwalhi ya kumdara nakumgaa Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5" />Mira vekaiseko ite, “ Ka mburi tusiiboi to he muaze wa elha ya Pasaka, kwaite venegera aku he vahe.”<verse eid="MAT 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlage muwe etamsuiya Yesu malhoma are Betania</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mariko 14:3-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yohana 12:1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6" />Yesu eeaha Betania he minda yakwe Simoni hu eeloo lukoma, <verse eid="MAT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7" />Heka madamo Yesu eezokodie ekua viaghu vya chamagheri, mlage muwe ekalita na nyhupa iboiiwe kwa isaheru lisewe Alabasta ihue malhoma ya mihaku mikumure yesumu kikulho ekailha ka nyhupa ekamsuiya Yesu he mua. <verse eid="MAT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8" />Mira vahina kuu vareakho to vekasanuiwa, vekalhasu, “Kwaakhoni eoni ka malhoma ya mihaku mikumure to? <verse eid="MAT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9" />Ya malhoma yeseedidiwe kwa mihaku mikumure naho ka mihaku vekaowe vahuye.” <verse eid="MAT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10" />Yesu ekakhwa eilie cho veekuyo, ekavaba, “Niakhoni mumnyamarisha ya mlage? U aaniboia mburi kulhosha. <verse eid="MAT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11" />Kwaite vahuye munekhwa navo maaze makhabuna, mira temkakhwa naani maaze makhabuna. <verse eid="MAT 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12" />Areanisuiya malhoma he msa gho eekutaboiya kikulho kwa mburi ya muaze gho wa kurakewe he mbira. <verse eid="MAT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13" />Kweri nimubaya, kira hodi henebirikirwa Mburi Kulho he idi ikhabuna, ya mburi eboie ya mlage, nayo ineyowe kwa kuhulhawe kuu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda aadumu kumkherii Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mariko 14:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luka 22:3-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14" />Kwato muwe wa vahina ikado na vanu esewe Yuda Isikariote, ekaso he vagiru va vearesija, <verse eid="MAT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15" />naho ekavalhasu, “Munenio kiakhoni nikunemkherii Yesu he kune?” Vekamtaria vikhao salasini vya madini mihaku. <verse eid="MAT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16" />Kulholhoshi ata Yuda Iskarioti ekakhwa edaa madamo makulho yeneye kumkherii Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etaa viaghu vya elha ya Pasaka hawe na vahina kuu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mariko 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-13">Luka 22:7-13</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yohana 13:21-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17" />He muaze wa bosi wa elha ya mikate isibutuwe hamira, vahina vakwe Yesu vekamliaha Yesu, vekamlhasu, “Udumu turekuboia le ho uneaiya viaghu vya elha ya Pasaka?” <verse eid="MAT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18" />Ekavaba, “Soni he mhe muwe are he muang'a muremba,” “Mhinya etetusugha ekuba ite, madamo gho yaahe sina nineaiya viaghu vya elha ya Pasaka hawe na vahina gho he minda kechi.” <verse eid="MAT 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19" />Kwato vahina vekaboi sahucho Yesu evabae, navo vekarake kikulho mburi ja elha ya Pasaka. <verse eid="MAT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20" />Hareahe chamagheri, Yesu ekazokhodi hawe na vahina kuu ikado na vanu veekua viaghu. <verse eid="MAT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21" />Vareakhwa vea viaghu, Yesu ekavaba, “Namubao, mhe muwe he kune enenikherii.” <verse eid="MAT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22" />Vahina kuu vekadarwa ni vuhuye vugirusha, vekalholhoshi kumlhasu, muwe muwe, “Dilao hile niani?” <verse eid="MAT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23" />Yesu ekavaba, “Hu eginhie he ibakuri mkate hawe naani, niu enenikherii. <verse eid="MAT 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24" />Muinyi wakwe Adamu eneso he Kiumbi sakigi egondiiwe. Mira henekhwa na manyamarisho hehu muhe enemkherii Muinyi wa Muhe, cheseekhwa ni keba ka muhe teseeakhoike.” <verse eid="MAT 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25" />Niho Yuda, huye eedumue kumkherii Yesu ekamlhasu Yesu ekaba, “Mhinya hile niani?” Yesu ekamba, “Ari waayo.”<verse eid="MAT 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Viaghu vyakwe Dilao vitalholhoshijwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mariko 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luka 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1Vakorinto 11:23-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26" />Ata veekua, Yesu ekadori mkate, ekamba Kiumbi hongera, ekaubendula, ekavao vahina kuu ekuba, “Dorini mua, yawo niu msa gho.” <verse eid="MAT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27" />Naho ekadori kikonho chilo divai, ekamba Kiumbi hongera, ekavao ekuba, “Wahani vakhabuna heya kikonho cha divai. <verse eid="MAT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28" />Ya niu sako gho iaija Iaghano la Kiumbi na vahe vakumure, huyo isuika kwa mburi ya vahe vakumure kwa kuvakaia makusa.” <verse eid="MAT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29" />Mira nimubaiya, kuli waijiji sikawaha divai kahali kuli heya matunda ya mzabibu sari he muaze wo ninewaha divai kuale na kune he Udilao wakwe Aba mgho. <verse eid="MAT 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30" />Vareafiriti kufaru lufaru, vekali na kuso he lubwa lwa mizeituni.<verse eid="MAT 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etarota ite Petro eneyo ite tem'ilie</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mariko 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yohana 13:36-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31" />Niho Yesu ekavaba, “Kiama cha wai munenigugulu,” Kwaite Magondo ya Kiumbi yeba, “Kiumbi enemma mzemo, na maalu heka ifyo yeneparaa. <verse eid="MAT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32" />Mira nikuneka kuli he kigame, ninemukaeya kuso Galilaya.” <verse eid="MAT 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33" />Petro ekakaa muo ekaba, “Mira kai vakhabuna venekugugulu, ani sikakuro neri.” <verse eid="MAT 26:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34" />Yesu ekamba Petro, “Nakubao ii neri nkuruve isinazo kiama cha wai, unekhwa waayo kagi kakai ite tuniilie.” <verse eid="MAT 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35" />Mira Petro ekaba, “Kai ninedumuwa kuga hawe naari, mira sikakulhi neri.” Na vahina vahali vekayo sato.<verse eid="MAT 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etaaresi are he kaseu Getisemane</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mariko 14:32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luka 22:39-46</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36" />Yesu hawe na vahina kuu vekaso hodi hesewe kabuva ka Getisemane, ekavaba, “Fufuni ii madamo ya ani nitaso twai kuaresi.” <verse eid="MAT 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37" />Ekavadori Petro hawe nahu vainyi vanu vakwe Zebedayo, nau ekalholhoshi kuhuyeti na kuhirisha swaho. <verse eid="MAT 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38" />Niho Yesu ekavaba, “Swaho gho ihuye vuhuye itahe sina na kuga. Fufuni ii naho muzokho maila hawe naani.” <verse eid="MAT 26:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39" />Ekaso kakara hagitutu, ekalhuya maso nakuaresi ekuba, “Aba gho, kai chimuruika, ya kikonho cha kharo chisiniheye, mira chisikhwa sacho nidumu ani mira hucho udumu ari.” <verse eid="MAT 26:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40" />Niho ekakirii hehu vahina vakai ekavaheiya vebodie, ekamlhaasu Petro, “Ho, kune vakai mutekwasiwe kukhwa maila hawe naani neri kela we? <verse eid="MAT 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41" />Zokhoni maila naho muaresi museebuu he kugaliwe. Uhe udumu, mira msa teudumu.” <verse eid="MAT 26:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42" />Ekaso kagi kakanu kuraaresi, ekaba, “Aba gho, kai techimuruika ya kikonho cha kharo techimuruika kukaiwa hagho, iji cho udumu nachiboiike.” <verse eid="MAT 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43" />Arekirii, ekavaheiya vebodie kahali kwaite teveekumuru kukaa maila kini kwa luireno lugiru. <verse eid="MAT 26:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44" />Kwato ekavaro ekaso kahali kagi kakakai kuraaresi ekuyo viome wahuuhu. <verse eid="MAT 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45" />Naho ekakirii he vahina kuu ekavabaya, “Ho, murecheri ie na kufufu? Wesiani, madamo yaahe Muinyi wa Muhe enerowa adarawe he miharegha ya vahe velo makusa.” <verse eid="MAT 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46" />Kwato kani, tusoni, kwaite hu enenikherii elitie.<verse eid="MAT 26:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etadarawe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mariko 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yohana 18:3-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47" />Yesu areakhwa echeri yo, Yuda muwe wahu vahina ikado na vanu, ekahe eekaetiane na ifyo igiru la vahe vedarae mahamba na viboi veesughaiwe ni vagiru va kuaresija na vaagiru velo ugiru he vaibaraza. <verse eid="MAT 26:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48" />Muhe enemlhi Yesu eevaoye lhaa ite, “Huye ninemholu kwa miharegha minu niu, mdareni.” <verse eid="MAT 26:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49" />Niho Yuda ekamliaha Yesu naho ekamholu kwa miharegha minu ekamba “Nikuholu Mhinya” <verse eid="MAT 26:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50" />Yesu ekamba “Werewe, ari boi hucho ulitie kuboi ii.” Niho hu vahe vekahe sina, vekamdara Yesu vekamoro. <verse eid="MAT 26:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51" />Wato oto muwe wahu vahe veeaha hawe ne Yesu areakho to, ekadara sime kuu, ekaigu ekamma naho ekamte ilama mnyamalo wa Mgiru wa kuaresija . <verse eid="MAT 26:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52" />Niho Yesu ekamba, “Re sime kechi heiala kuu, kwaite vakhabuna vegaa vahe kwa sime venegaawe kwa sime. <verse eid="MAT 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53" />Ho, temuilie ite nimuru kumlhawa Aba gho ekamanganigeria maifyo ikado na manu ya vazasughawe vaare ana he Kiumbi? <verse eid="MAT 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54" />Mira iji Magondo ya Kiumbi yenefuru kimomo hu yeba ite chidumuwe kukhwa sato?” <verse eid="MAT 26:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55" />Niho Yesu ekalibaya hu ifyo la vahe, “Mulitie na mahamba na viboi kalo munidara sauraba ite ani ni mgwalo? Maaze makhabuna neeaha hawe nakune he Minda ya Kiumbi nikuhinya, kwakhoni temnidarae? <verse eid="MAT 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56" />Mira ya makhabuna yelijanye kalo Magondo ya varoto va Kiumbi yafuru.” Niho vahina kuu vakhabuna vekamro na vekagugulu.<verse eid="MAT 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etatiiwe he ibaraza la Vayahudi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Mariko 14:53-65</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luka 22:54-55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yohana 18:13-14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57" />Hu veemdarae Yesu vekamtii he Mgiru wa kuaresija esewe Kayafa, hodi ho vahinya va miku yakwe Musa hawe na vaagiru veebungurue. <verse eid="MAT 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58" />Mira Petro ekamliaha ankau kwa uda sari he lukumbi lwa Mgiru wa Muaresi. Ekabuu za he lukumbi ekazokhodi hawe na vakilaaru kalo aakho chinelijanya. <verse eid="MAT 26:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59" />Kwato vagiru na vaagiru vazime na ibaraza ikhabuna vekadaa vahe vemuru kuyo lame kwamburi ya kwe Yesu kalo vamuru kumgaa Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 26:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60" />Mira teveakhoe mburi neri, hawe na ite veelitie valame vakumure. Niho vekalijanya vahe vanu venemuru kuyo vigi vya ulame, <verse eid="MAT 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61" />vekaba, “Ya muhe eebae ite, ‘Nimuru kupu Minda ya Kiumbi na kuikwa kahali he maaze makai.’ ” <verse eid="MAT 26:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62" />Niho Mgiru wa Muaresi ekauma na kumba Yesu, “Ho, ari tulo cha kuyo heya mburi ya vahe vejiyo?” <verse eid="MAT 26:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63" />Mira Yesu ekataa chwi. Niho Mgiru wa kuaresija ekamba, “Kwa ilhe la Kiumbi efufu, tubae kai ari niu Kiristo, Muinyi wa Kiumbi.” <verse eid="MAT 26:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64" />Yesu ekamba, “Niari uyo. Mira nitamubaiya kune vakhabuna, kulholhoshi waijiji munemuakho Muinyi wa Muhe ezokhodie bwa wa sughano wahu elo u, naho munemuakho ekulita kuli are ana hemalhareno.” <verse eid="MAT 26:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65" />Niho Mgiru wa kirurumo ekamangakha'a gomae kuu na kuba, “Aam'olhu Kiumbi! Niakhoni tudaijaa ukweri mhali? Wesiani waijiji kune mwaakho kacho eolhue. <verse eid="MAT 26:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66" />Kwato kune mubamo?” Vekamba, “Chidumuwe agaawe.” <verse eid="MAT 26:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67" />Niho vekambusuya mapae he vubasa na vahali vekamma nkundi. Vahali vekamma mazokhera, <verse eid="MAT 26:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68" />naho vekaba, “ Ari Kiristo, rota ite, niji ekumae.”<verse eid="MAT 26:68" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petro etamlhi Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Mariko 14:66-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luka 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yohana 18:15-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69" />Ka madamo Petro eezokhodie he lukumbi gahana. Mnyamalo muwe wa kilage ekamliaha ekumba, “Naari weaha hawe ne Yesu wa Galilaya.” <verse eid="MAT 26:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70" />Mira Petro ekalhi he vahe vakhabuna ekuba, “Siilie kacho uyo.” <verse eid="MAT 26:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71" />Areli gahana kuhe he luhige, mnyamalo mhali wa kilage ekamuakho, ekavaba vahe veeta to, “Ya muhe eeaha hawe ne Yesu Mnazareti.” <verse eid="MAT 26:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72" />Ekalhi kahali kwa kuapa ekuba, “Ani sim'ilie ka muhe.” <verse eid="MAT 26:72" /><verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73" />Kalufunda hu veeumae to vekamliaha Petro vekamba, “Kweri ari um'aro kini, kwaite miyore kechi itoiyane navo.” <verse eid="MAT 26:73" /><verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74" />Niho Petro ekalholhoshi kulapa ekuba , “ Kai naayo lame Kiumbi anikharoti, Sim'ilie ka muhe!” Wato oto nkuruve ikazo. <verse eid="MAT 26:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75" />Waata ata Petro ekahulha hu kiome eebaiwe ni Yesu ite, “Nkuruve isinazo, unenilhi kagi kakai.” Niho, ekali gahana, ekazo kwa vuhuye.<verse eid="MAT 26:75" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27" />
  <para style="s">Yesu etatiiwe hakwe Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:1">Mariko 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-2">Luka 23:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-32">Yohana 18:28-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1" />Lhenu kuu ama ama, vagiru va kuaresija vakhabuna na vaagiru vazime, vekaiseko hawe mburi ya kumgaa Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2" />Vekamuoro mhingu, vekamtii vekumuoti he Pilato, hu ee Dilao wa Kirumi.<verse eid="MAT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kigame chakwe Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="ACT 1:18-19">Miboire 1:18-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3" />Iji Yuda huye eemlhie Yesu areakho ite Yesu aazamiriwe pere, ekahiri swaho niho ekavakiritia hu magongolo mikado mikai vya zahabu vyo eowe ni vagiru vakuaresija na vagiru va Vayahudi. <verse eid="MAT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4" />Yuda ekaba, “Naaboi makusa, kwaite naikherii sako isionie kigi.” Vekamba, “Kalo litulanga kiahoni nne? Uneile salaghe.” <verse eid="MAT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5" />Kwato Yuda ekavibibi hu magongolo ya mihaku ya zahabu za he Minda ekahaka ekaso ekakurengesha. <verse eid="MAT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6" />Hu vagiru va muaresi vekadori hu mihaku vekaba, “Si kikulho kukwarianya ya mihaku na vivulu kwaite ya mihaku ilo sako.” <verse eid="MAT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7" />Kwato vareafiriti kuiseko, vekaakho vawe mbuva he muhe eboi kore, ikhwa hodi ha mbira ja kukea vagalho vekuga. <verse eid="MAT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8" />Ya nicho chiroe hu mbuva ikasewe Mbuva ya Sako sari wai. <verse eid="MAT 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9" />Niho vikafuru hu viome vyeegondiwe ni Yeremia mroto wa Kiumbi viba ite, “Veedorie hu vikhao mikado mikai vya mihaku, sacho Vaizraeli veeisekoe kumlhanu ka mzalo mbuva, <verse eid="MAT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10" />vekawea mbuva he muhe eboi kore, sacho Dilao Kiumbi eajie.”<verse eid="MAT 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pilato etamlhasu Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:2-5">Mariko 15:2-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:3-5">Luka 23:3-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:33-38">Yohana 18:33-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11" />To Yesu eeumae he Pilato eemgiru wa mkoa eekeiwe ni Varumi. Ka mgiru wa mkoa ekamlhasu, “Ho ari niu Ngurumo wa Vayahudi?” Yesu ekaba, “Niari uba to.” <verse eid="MAT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12" />Mira vagiru va kuaresija na vagiru va Vayahudi vareamyoija, teandue. <verse eid="MAT 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13" />Niho Pilato ekamlhasu, “Ho, tuko ya maoghe makhabuna vekuyoijija?” <verse eid="MAT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14" />Mira Yesu teandue neri ioghe iwe, niho dilao ekamakisha.<verse eid="MAT 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etazamariwe kuga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mariko 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yohana 18:39-19:16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15" />He muaze wa elha ya Pasaka mgiru wa Kirumi eekuramlhamera mzaorowe muwe enelhojwa ni ifyo la vahe. <verse eid="MAT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16" />Heka madamo heelo mzaorowe eilikishe he vahe kwa makusa kuu, esewe Baraba. <verse eid="MAT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17" />Kwato Pilato ekavalhasu hu ifyo la vahe leekubungurue ite, “Mudumu nimulhamereie ji, Baraba hile Yesu hu esewe Kiristo?” <verse eid="MAT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18" />Kwaite eereile ite Yesu eetiiwe hakuu kwa mburi ya luiju. <verse eid="MAT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19" />To Pilato eezokhodie he kikire cha kuzamaria, mlage kuu ekamsughaya mburi iba, “Usimboi kigi neri kiwe ka muhe esionie kigi, kwaite wai naanyamarika kweri he makhala kwa mburi yaka muhe.” <verse eid="MAT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20" />Mira vagiru va kuaresija na vagiru va Vayahudi vekusukuruia hu ifyo la vahe ite vagogo amlhamere baraba bi mira Yesu agaawe. <verse eid="MAT 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21" />Mgiru wa Kirumi ekavalhasu kahali, “Ni mhama heya vanu mudumu nimulhamere?” Vekamba “Baraba.” <verse eid="MAT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22" />Pilato ekavalhaasu, “Kwato mudumu nimsamo ya Yesu esewe Kiristo?” Vakhabuna vekayoisha. “Mma misumari he msaraba!” <verse eid="MAT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23" />Pilato ekavalhaasu, “Kwa kiakhoni? Eonie kiakhoni?” Mira vo vekamaisha gimbe, “Mma misumari he msaraba.” <verse eid="MAT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24" />Pilato areakho ite temuru kuboi kigi, naho aku jeekutalholhoshi, ekadori mai ekaonhi miharegha kuu sina na hehu ifyo la vahe, ekaba, “Silo maoghe he sako yaya muhe, kwato ya ni mburi kaghu!” <verse eid="MAT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25" />Vahe vakhabuna vekaba, “Kigame kuu chikhwa ana kanu naho ana ya vainyi kanu!” <verse eid="MAT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26" />Kwato Pilato ekavalhamereia Baraba kuli he igereza, naho areafiriti ekaba Yesu amawe ndate naho ekamgu kalo amawe misumari he msaraba.<verse eid="MAT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vakilaaru vetamfwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Mariko 15:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yohana 19:2-3</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27" />Wato oto vakilaaru vakwe Pilato vekamtii Yesu sari ang'a he mgiru wa Kirumi naho vekabunguru ifyo la vakilaaru vakhabuna vekamjunguluka Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28" />Vekamgu gomae kuu nakumuoro gomae ibayu, <verse eid="MAT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29" />naho vekahi ankara ya milhae vekam'oro he m'a kuu. Vekamkeiya ndate he muharegha kuu wa sughano kalo akhwa se Ngurumo, vekama mamuro heu na kumfwa vekuba, “Tukuholu Ngurumo wa Vayahudi!” <verse eid="MAT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30" />Vekambusuiya mapae naho vekadori hu ndate ya mwanzi vekammaisha he m'a. <verse eid="MAT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31" />Vareafiriti kumfwa, vekamgu hu gomae, vekamuoro kahali gomae kuu. Naho vekamtii kalo varemma misumari he msaraba.<verse eid="MAT 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etamawe misumari he msaraba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mariko 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yohana 19:17-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32" />Ka madamo vekuso, vekasahe na muhe muwe esewe Simoni kuli muang'a usewa Kirene, navo vekamkungumija atii hu msaraba Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33" />Vekahe hodi hesewe Goligota, nisakuba ite ni Hodi he Ifwara la m'a, <verse eid="MAT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34" />niho hu vaaku vekamuo Yesu divai ikwarijanywe na kigi chinyera kalo awaha, mira areaigali, ekalhi kuwaha. <verse eid="MAT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35" />Vareafiriti kumma misumari he msaraba vekakaana gomae kuu kwakuma simbi, kalo chifuru hu kiome cheeyoiwe ni mroto wa Kiumbi ite, “Veekakaane gomae gho naho gomae gho vekaimaia simbi” <verse eid="MAT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36" />Niho vekazokhodi vekakhwa vemlaaija. <verse eid="MAT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37" />Ana he mua kuu, to he msaraba, vekagonda maoghe kuu, yeba “YAYE NIU YESU NGURUMO WA VAYAHUDI.” <verse eid="MAT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38" />Yesu emaiwe misumari sina na vagwalo vanu kira muwe he msaraba kuu, muwe mlha wa sughano kuu na mhali wa hina kuu. <verse eid="MAT 27:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39" />Vahe veekutakho he kwalhi vekakhwa vebibi viome vya kuolhu ilai vekukusha mia kini <verse eid="MAT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40" />vekuba, “Ari weebae unepu Minda ya Kiumbi na kuikwa kwa maaze makai, kukaa salaghe iji he kharo. Kai kweri ari u Muinyi wa Kiumbi, iji dimi kuli he msaraba.” <verse eid="MAT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41" />Wato oto, velo ugiru va kuaresija na vahinya va miku yakwe Musa na vagiru va Vayahudi vekamfwa vekumba, <verse eid="MAT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42" />“Eevakae vahali he kharo, mira temuru kukukaa he kharo salaghe! Uye ni Dilao wa Israeli. Nadimi iji kuli he msaraba, nanne tunemdarisha. <verse eid="MAT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43" />Eramdarisha Kiumbi, iji Kiumbi namdimiri he msaraba kai emdumu, kwaite eebae, ‘Ani ni Muinyi wa Kiumbi.’ ” <verse eid="MAT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44" />Nahu vagwalo veemaiwe misumari he misaraba hawe nau vekam'olhu sato oto.<verse eid="MAT 27:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kigame chakwe Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mariko 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yohana 19:28-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45" />Kwato kuli kela sita chakhakho sari kela kenda chamagheti kidughu cheelighubike idi izime. <verse eid="MAT 27:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46" />Ireahe kela kenda Yesu ekakaa lukalasu ekuzo ekuba, “Eloi, Eloi lama Sabakitani?” Nisa kuba ite, “Kiumbi gho, Kiumbi gho, kwaakhoni waaniro?” <verse eid="MAT 27:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47" />Vahe vakuwe veeumae to vareako ekuyo to, vekaba “Etamse Eliya.” <verse eid="MAT 27:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48" />Wato oto muwe kini ekagugulu kuradori kikhao cha gomae, naho ekachiginha he kikonho chilo siki ekachike he ndate kulhe ekam'o awaha. <verse eid="MAT 27:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49" />Vahali vekaba, “Mroni tuakho ite kai Eliya enelita kumlhaari.” <verse eid="MAT 27:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50" />Yesu areazo kahali kwa kiome kigiru, ekapaa swaho kuu ekaga. <verse eid="MAT 27:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51" />Madamo waka aka ipazia la he Minda ya Kiumbi likakhaaika vikhao vinu, kulholhoshi ana sari di. Idi izime likakushika na maghamba yekapuu. <verse eid="MAT 27:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52" />Mbira jikalhaika naho misa ya vahe vanyakhare veegae vekaka kuli he kigame. <verse eid="MAT 27:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53" />Vekali he mbira na to Yesu areaka kuli he kigame vekabuu he Muang'a Mnyakhare usewe Yerusalemu na kuvalijanyia vahe vakumure. <verse eid="MAT 27:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54" />Kwato hu mgiru wa vakilaaru nahu veaha hawe nau vekumlaaiija Yesu, vareakho hucho idi likushike nahu vikhabuna viliijanye, vekabughenu vekuba, “Kweri ya Yesu nee Muinyi wa Kiumbi!” <verse eid="MAT 27:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55" />Ata hodi heelo valage veekuwesia kwa uda. Vo vemliahie Yesu kuli Galilaya naho veekumlhaari hucho eekudumu. <verse eid="MAT 27:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56" />Heka valage eeaha Maria kuli Magidala ne Maria lage kini Yakobo ne Josefu ne mlage wakwe Zebedayo.<verse eid="MAT 27:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etakewe he mhanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mariko 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yohana 19:38-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57" />Hareahe chamagheri, ekalita muhe muwe mzuri kuli Arimatea esewe Josefu, nau nee mhina wakwe Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58" />Ekaso he Pilato, kumlhawa adori msa wakwe Yesu. Pilato ekaba adumuijwe. <verse eid="MAT 27:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59" />Josefu ekadori msa wakwe Yesu, ekauoro sanda, <verse eid="MAT 27:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60" />naho ekarauke za he mbira kuu kua ya mhanga yo eiboie salaghe. Naho ekadongolosha isaheru igiru he luhige lwa mbira ekuka ekaso. <verse eid="MAT 27:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61" />Maria kuli Magidala nahu Maria mhali veaha to hodi, veezokhodie kuwesiana nahu mbira.<verse eid="MAT 27:61" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vakilaaru to he mbira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62" />Lhenu kuu he muaze wa kanu wa kuke kikulho mburi ja muaze wa kufufu, velo ugiru wa kuaresija na Mafarisayo vekamliaha Pilato, <verse eid="MAT 27:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63" />vekamba, “Dilao, twaahulha ite hu mlame to esinaga eeyoe ite, ‘He muaze wakakai, nineka kuli he kigame.’ <verse eid="MAT 27:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64" />Kwato usugha vakilaaru kalo vailaaije ka mbira sari muaze waakakai. Kai sito, vahina kuu vemuru valita vagwa msa kuu naho vavabae vahe ite aaka kuli he kigame. Ya lame inekhwa kusa kutakho hu yabosi.” <verse eid="MAT 27:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65" />Pilato ekavaba, “Kune mulo vakilaaru. Soni, mureikeiya ukilaaru ka mbira kacho munemuru.” <verse eid="MAT 27:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66" />Kwato vekaso na vakilaaru kalo varelaiija hu mbira kikulho, vekake ibalo hehu isaheru kalo mhe ekunelidongolosha vamuru kuile.<verse eid="MAT 27:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28" />
  <para style="s">Yesu etaka kuli he kigame</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 16:1-10">Mariko 16:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yohana 20:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1" />Muaze wa kufufu ureatakho, muaze wa bosi wa ijuma hachalhenu ama ama, Maria kuli Magidala nahu Maria mhali vekaso kurawesia mbira. <verse eid="MAT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2" />Wato oto hekakhwa na ikushiko igiru la idi, kwaite mzasughawa wa Kiumbi eedimie kuli ana he are ana he Kiumbi ekaso ekalidongolosha hu isaheru ekazokhodi to ana he isaheru. <verse eid="MAT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3" />Vubasa vwahu mzasughawa waare ana he Kiumbi vweeakue sa luatame lwa lubambara na gomae kuu jeeakue swe. <verse eid="MAT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4" />Hu vakilaaru va mbira vekambughenuisha naho vekazingiza vekalhu atadi sa vegae. <verse eid="MAT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5" />Hu mzasughawa wa Kiumbi ekavaba hu valage, “Musibughenu, kwaite nireile ite mumdaa Yesu eemaiwe misumari he msaraba. <verse eid="MAT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6" />Teaha ii, kwaite aaka kuli he kigame, sakigi eeyoe. Litani iji muhawesie hodi ho veembodije. <verse eid="MAT 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7" />Naho muso nakawe murevabaya vahina kuu ite, ‘Aaka kuli he kigame, naho etamukaeiya kuso Galilaya, are niho munemuakho. Hulhani yayo nimubaiye.’ ” <verse eid="MAT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8" />Kwato hu valage vekahaka to he mbira ilai vebughenu mira velhamuishishwe, vekaso nakawe kuravabaya vahina vakwe Yesu ka mburi. <verse eid="MAT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9" />Wato oto Yesu ekasahe navo, ekavaba, “Nimuholu!” Hu valage vekamheiya sina vekamdara masame kuu, vekumuaresi. <verse eid="MAT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10" />Niho Yesu ekavaba, “Musibughenu. Soni murevabaya vabakhu gho vaso Galilaya, niho veneniakho.”<verse eid="MAT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vakilaaru vetayo mburi jo veakhoe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11" />To hu valage veeaha kwalhi vekuso, vakilaaru vakuwe veekulaa mbira vekaso he muang'a kuravabaiya velo ugiru va kuaresija kira kigi chilijanye. <verse eid="MAT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12" />Iji, vareasahe velo ugiru va muaresi na vagiru va Vayahudi vekaiseko kuvalhanu hu vakilaaru mihaku mikumure, <verse eid="MAT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13" />vekavaba, “Mudumuwe muyo ite, vahina kuu veelitie naama kumgwa nne tweeie.” <verse eid="MAT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14" />Kai mgiru eneile ya mburi, nne tuneyo nau kalo musiebuu he kharo. <verse eid="MAT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15" />Kwato hu vakilaaru vekadoria hu mihaku navo vekaboi sahucho vebaiwe. Ya mburi ikailika he Vayahudi sari wai.<verse eid="MAT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etavalianyija vahina kuu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mariko 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yohana 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Miboire 1:6-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16" />Iji hu vahina ikado na muwe vekaso sari Galilaya hehu lubwa lwo Yesu eevaajie. <verse eid="MAT 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17" />Vareamuakho, vekam'aresi mira vakuwe veelo bughu. <verse eid="MAT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18" />Yesu ekavaliaha nakuvaba, “Naaowe lumuruisho lukhabuna waare ana he Kiumbi nahe idi. <verse eid="MAT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19" />Kwato iji, soni he idi izime murevaboi vahe vakhabuna vakhwa vahina gho, mukuvabatija kwa ilhe la Aba nala Muinyi nala Saa wa Kiumbi, <verse eid="MAT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20" />nakune vahinyeni kudara mburi khabuna jo nimubaie kune. Kweri ani niaha hawe na kune maaze khabuna, sari mkhto wa idi.” Nachikhwa to.<verse eid="MAT 28:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28" />
</usx>